PVD("china_ndp_2016-2020",{"docs":["","CN NDP 2016 20"],"s":{"1":[[1,"65","4","Strategic Emerging Industries Development Support","By targeting cutting-edge technologies, adhering to industrial development trends, focusing on key areas, and optimizing the integration of policies, we will create space for the growth of emerging industries and see that they gain a competitive advantage in the future.",""],[1,"65","5","Support for Emerging Strategic Industries and Next-Generation Technologies","We will support the development of next generation information technology, new-energy vehicles, biotechnology, green and low-carbon technology, high-end equipment and materials, and digital creative industries.",""],[1,"65","5","Innovation and Industrial Application in Cutting-Edge Fields","In fostering new areas of economic growth, we will spur innovation and industrial application in emerging, cutting-edge fields such as advanced semi-conductivity, robotics, additive manufacturing, intelligent systems, next generation aviation equipment, comprehensive service systems for space technologies, smart transportation, precision medicine, systems for high-efficiency energy storage and distributed energy, smart materials, efficient energy conservation, environmental protection, virtual reality, and interactive movies and television.",""],[1,"66","1","Strategic Emerging Industries Development Programme","we will foster strategic industries in the fields of aerospace, oceanography, information networks, the life sciences, and nuclear technology.",""],[1,"66","1","Advanced Technology Development Initiative","we will develop new types of air and underwater vehicles, next generation operating platforms, and integrated aerospace observation systems, develop quantum communication and a safe and ubiquitous Internet of Things, and accelerate the development of synthetic biology and regenerative medical techniques as well as next generation nuclear power equipment, small nuclear power systems, and civil nuclear analytical and imaging techniques.",""],[1,"66","2","Industrial Innovation and Technology Promotion Centers","We will support the development of industrial innovation centers and new technology promotion centers",""],[1,"66","2","Innovation-Driven Development of Emerging Industries","as well as the efforts of cities rich in innovation resources to lead the innovation-driven development of emerging industries",""],[1,"66","2","Emerging Industries Production and Innovation Chain Acceleration","We will help ensure rapid development of the production and innovation chains of emerging industries to accelerate industry clustering according to their specific characteristics",""],[1,"66","2","Global Innovation-Driven Development Network for Emerging Industries","We will put in place a plan to build a global innovation-driven development network for emerging industries",""],[1,"66","2","Global Allocation of Enterprise Innovation Resources","encourage Chinese enterprises to allocate innovation resources globally",""],[1,"66","2","Overseas Research and Development Centers","support the establishment of overseas research and development centers",""],[1,"67","1","Industrial Policy and Market Access Regulatory Framework","We will ensure that industrial policies guide development and promote competition, and will put in place market access requirements, regulatory rules, and standards systems conducive to the development of new technologies, new products, and new forms and models of businesses.",""],[1,"67","1","Innovative Procurement Promotion","We will encourage the procurement of innovative products and services both in major infrastructure projects and in projects concerning people's wellbeing.",""],[1,"67","1","National Strategic Industry Development Fund","We will set up a national strategic industry development fund and ensure that the National Venture Capital Guide Fund for Emerging Industries fully plays its role, giving primary support to innovative enterprises in emerging industries that are still in an early stage of development.",""],[1,"67","3","Integrated Circuit Industrial Systems Development","Cultivate integrated circuit industrial systems;",""],[1,"67","4","Emerging Digital Industries Development Initiative","Foster artificial intelligence, intelligent hardware, new display technologies, smart mobile terminals, 5G mobile communications, advanced sensors, and wearable devices into becoming new areas of growth.",""],[1,"67","5","Genomics and Biotechnology Application Acceleration","Move faster to facilitate the wide application of genomics and other biotechnologies;",""],[1,"67","6","Network-Based Biotechnology Demonstration Projects","Create demonstrations of network-based biotech applications;",""],[1,"67","7","Personalized Medical Treatment and Next-Generation Biotechnology Development","Stimulate the large-scale development of personalized medical treatment, new drugs, bio-breeding, and other next generation biotech products and services;",""],[1,"67","8","Gene and Cell Bank Platform Development","Promote the creation of basic platforms such as gene and cell banks.",""],[1,"67","9","National Civil Space Infrastructure Construction","Accelerate the construction of national civil space infrastructure, primarily revolving around multimode remote sensing, broadband mobile communications, and the BeiDou Navigation Satellite System;",""],[1,"67","10","Systemic Technological Support for Industrial Applications","Provide systemic technological support and greater capacity for industrial applications within the fields of global telecommunications, disaster prevention and mitigation, natural resource surveys and regulation, urban management, meteorological and environmental monitoring, positioning services, and others;",""],[1,"67","11","Commercial Application of BeiDou and Remote Sensing Satellites","Accelerate commercial applications of the BeiDou Navigation Satellite System and remote sensing satellites.",""],[1,"68","1","Large-Scale Development of Related Techniques and Equipment","Promote the large-scale development of related techniques and equipment.",""],[1,"68","2","Advanced Materials Development Programme","Develop smart materials such as shape-memory alloys and self-healing materials, functional nanomaterials such as grapheme and metamaterials, next generation semiconductor materials such as indium phosphide and silicon carbide, new types of structural materials such as high-performance carbon fibers, vanadium titanium alloy, and high-temperature alloys, and also degradable materials and new biosynthetic materials.",""],[1,"68","11","Industrial Design and Innovation Promotion","we will promote the development of industrial design and innovation, engineering and commercial",""],[1,"78","11","Key Technology Breakthroughs Programme","Make breakthroughs in key technologies such as core chips, basic software, key components, and major machinery systems;",""],[1,"88","6","Industrial Capacity Upgrade for Advanced Energy Equipment Manufacturing","Improve capacity to manufacture equipment including: 3rd generation nuclear power reactors; gigawatt hydropower units; energy-efficient boilers and electric motors.",""],[1,"88","7","Advanced Manufacturing and Applied Technology Breakthrough Initiative","Make breakthroughs in the manufacturing of and applied technologies for key components and materials such as high-power electric and electronic equipment and high-temperature superconductors.",""]],"2":[[1,"32","1","Supply-Side Innovation and Demand Stimulation Measures","To strengthen new drivers of growth, we will follow the lead of market demand, make innovations in supply, improve the quality and efficiency of supply, stimulate and unleash effective demand, and create a highly efficient cycle of positive interplay between consumption and investment and of coordinated progress in demand and supply upgrading.",""],[1,"32","2","Consumer Demand Expansion and Consumption Upgrade Initiative","we will work to improve the environment in which the potential of consumption is unleashed, better satisfy and create consumer demand through improved and innovative supply, and constantly strengthen the fundamental role that consumption plays in fueling economic growth",""],[1,"32","2","Household Spending and Rural Consumption Expansion Measures","We will channel great energy into expanding consumer spending by increasing consumer buying power, improving consumer expectations, and tapping rural potential for consumption",""],[1,"32","2","Service Consumption and New Consumption Forms Promotion","We will focus on expanding consumption of services to stimulate an upgrade in the structure of consumption, support new forms of consumption including information consumption, green consumption, fashion consumption, and quality consumption, and work steadily to promote spending on housing, automobiles, fitness, and elderly care",""],[1,"32","2","Online-Offline Consumption Integration Model","We will help develop new models of consumption, such as the integration of online and offline consumption",""],[1,"32","2","Consumer Goods Quality and Consumer Rights Protection","We will see that the quality of consumer goods is improved, strengthen the protection of consumer rights and interests, and give full play to the role of consumer associations in order to create convenient, worry-free environments for consumption",""],[1,"32","2","Domestic Product Purchasing Promotion Campaign","We will actively work to encourage those who are used to shopping overseas to buy domestic products",""],[1,"32","2","Duty-Free Shop Distribution and International Consumption Center Development","We will improve the distribution of duty-free shops across major tourist destination cities and develop international consumption centers",""]],"3":[[1,"139","3","Green Services Provider Development and Green Industry Support","We will support the development of green services providers, expand the use of energy efficient and environmentally friendly products, support innovations in technology, equipment, and service models, and improve related policies and mechanisms, so as to facilitate the development of energy efficient and environmentally friendly industries.",""],[1,"139","4","Environmental Credentials Management System Improvement","We will improve the environmental credentials management system for enterprises and encourage the development of professional services for energy",""],[1,"140","1","Energy Performance Contracting and Water-Saving Management Contracting","We will promote energy performance contracting, water-saving management contracting, and third party governance of environmental pollution.",""],[1,"140","1","Third-Party Environmental Pollution Governance","We will promote energy performance contracting, water-saving management contracting, and third party governance of environmental pollution.",""],[1,"140","1","Environmental Protection Infrastructure Investment Mobilization","We will encourage nongovernmental investment in environmental protection infrastructure construction and carry out trials for putting the comprehensive environmental governance of small towns and industrial parks under trusteeship.",""],[1,"140","1","Comprehensive Environmental Governance Trusteeship Trials","We will encourage nongovernmental investment in environmental protection infrastructure construction and carry out trials for putting the comprehensive environmental governance of small towns and industrial parks under trusteeship.",""],[1,"140","1","Internationally Competitive Energy Conservation and Environmental Protection Enterprises","We will promote the development of large energy conservation and environmental protection enterprises that are able to compete internationally, and encourage advanced, practical energy- conserving and environmental protection technologies and products to reach out to the world.",""],[1,"140","1","Green Labeling, Certification, and Green Public Procurement System","We will advance systems for green labeling, green certification, and green government procurement in a coordinated way.",""],[1,"140","1","Green Finance System Development","We will establish a green finance system, develop green credit and bonds, and launch green development funds.",""],[1,"140","1","Green Credit, Bonds, and Development Funds","We will establish a green finance system, develop green credit and bonds, and launch green development funds.",""],[1,"140","1","Grid Policy Reform for Waste-to-Energy and Industrial By-Product Power","We will improve grid policies for electricity generated from coal gangue, leftover heat and pressure, waste incineration, and methane.",""],[1,"140","1","Green Supply Chain Industrial System Development","We will accelerate the formation of industrial systems for the green supply chain.",""],[1,"140","2","Energy-Saving and Environmentally Friendly Technology Development and Dissemination","We will strengthen China's capabilities with respect to energy-saving and environmentally friendly engineering, technology, and equipment manufacturing, and research, develop, demonstrate, and disseminate a number of advanced, environmentally friendly technologies and equipment.",""],[1,"140","2","Advanced Clean Technology Research, Development, and Industrial Application","We will accelerate research and development on and the industrial application of new technologies and equipment, such as those for low- grade waste heat power generation, small gas turbines, fine particulate matter control, vehicle exhaust emissions purification, landfill leachate treatment, sludge recycling, coordinated multi-pollutant treatment, and soil remediation.",""],[1,"140","2","Promotion of Mature Clean and Resource-Efficient Technologies","We will promote the use of mature and applicable technologies, such as those for integrated high- efficiency flue gas dust removal and waste heat recovery, high-efficiency heat pumps, semi-conductor illumination, and waste recycling.",""]],"5":[[1,"26","2","Internet-Based Startup and Innovation Support","We will make use of the internet to help business startups and innovators become better connected to market resources and more responsive to public demand.",""],[1,"26","2","Crowd Innovation and Resource Sharing Platform Development","We will advance crowd innovation based on specialized spaces and online platforms as well as within enterprises, and improve innovation resource sharing.",""],[1,"26","2","Crowdsourcing Expansion for Production and Services","We will promote research crowdsourcing, development crowdsourcing, and creativity crowdsourcing as well as the crowdsourcing of manufacturing operations and maintenance services, knowledge, content, and consumer services to give impetus to public participation in the division of labor in online production and distribution.",""],[1,"26","2","Crowd Support Ecosystem Development","We will promote the development of public crowd support, shared crowd support, and mutual crowd support.",""],[1,"26","2","Crowdfunding and Online Lending Regulatory Oversight","We will improve supervision and oversight systems to ensure the well- regulated development of rewards crowdfunding, equity crowdfunding, and online lending.",""]],"6":[[1,"141","1","Belt and Road Cooperation and Opening-Up Expansion","With the Belt and Road Initiative paving the way, we will give greater meaning to the notion of opening up, increase our level of openness, and coordinate efforts to strengthen strategic mutual trust, investment and trade cooperation, and cultural exchanges.",""],[1,"141","2","Bidirectional Opening-Up and Market Integration Initiative","We will comprehensively advance bidirectional opening up, facilitate the orderly flow of domestic and international factors of production, the efficient allocation of domestic and international resources, and the deep integration of Chinese and foreign markets, and work faster in cultivating new international competitive edges.",""],[1,"141","3","Cross-Border Transport Corridor and Port of Entry Development","We will strengthen the development of ports of entry and infrastructure in both inland and border regions and create cross-border multimodal transport corridors.",""],[1,"141","3","Outward-Oriented Industrial Cluster Development","We will develop outward-oriented industrial clusters and create centers of opening up with specialized areas of focus.",""],[1,"141","3","Special Customs Control Area Integration and Upgrading","We will accelerate the integration and upgrading of special customs control areas and improve the development of both border and cross-border economic cooperation zones.",""],[1,"141","3","International Cooperation in Economic and Technological Development Zones","We will increase the level of international cooperation in economic and technological development zones.",""],[1,"141","3","Inland Opening-Up Strategic Support Belt Development","We will develop strategic support belts for inland opening up, relying on principal cities and city clusters in China's interior.",""],[1,"141","3","Coastal Area Global Economic Cooperation and Competition Support","We will support coastal areas in fully participating in global economic cooperation and competition, give expression to the role of the Bohai Sea Rim, the Yangtze River Delta, and the Pearl River Delta as portals of China's opening up, and support these regions in taking the lead in embracing high-standard international rules for investment and trade",""],[1,"142","1","Development of Inland Open Economic Pilot Zones","We will support the development of Ningxia and other inland open economic pilot zones as well as the development of the China-Singapore (Chongqing) Demonstration Initiative on Strategic Connectivity.",""],[1,"142","1","China-Singapore (Chongqing) Demonstration Initiative on Strategic Connectivity","We will support the development of Ningxia and other inland open economic pilot zones as well as the development of the China-Singapore (Chongqing) Demonstration Initiative on Strategic Connectivity.",""],[1,"142","1","Industrial Parks for Bilateral International Cooperation","We will advance the building of industrial parks for bilateral international cooperation.",""],[1,"142","1","Zhoushan Free Trade Port Establishment","We will explore the establishment of a free trade port in Zhoushan.",""],[1,"142","2","International Production Capacity Cooperation and Overseas Expansion Initiative","We will encourage more of China's equipment, technology, standards, and services to go global by engaging in international cooperation on production capacity and equipment manufacturing through overseas investment, project contracting, technology cooperation, equipment exporting, and other means, with a focus on industries such as steel, nonferrous metals, building materials, railways, electric power, chemical engineering, textiles, automobiles, communications, engineering machinery, aviation and aerospace, shipbuilding, and ocean engineering.",""],[1,"142","2","Production Capacity Cooperation Project Repository and Demonstration Projects","We will set up a repository for production capacity cooperation projects and promote major demonstration projects.",""],[1,"142","2","Enterprise International Market Participation Support Mechanism","We will guide enterprises in participating in international markets in ways that utilize their group advantage, and develop industrial clusters overseas suitable to local conditions.",""],[1,"142","2","Bilateral and Multilateral Production Capacity Cooperation Mechanisms","We will move faster in expanding bilateral and multilateral cooperation mechanisms on production capacity and actively work with developed countries to jointly explore third party markets.",""],[1,"142","2","Overall Coordination and Support Services for Production Capacity Cooperation","We will put in place mechanisms to facilitate overall coordination and communication that involve the participation of enterprises, financial institutions, local governments, chambers of commerce, and industry associations.",""],[1,"142","2","Financial and Risk Support Services for Overseas Cooperation","We will improve services such as taxation, finance, insurance, investment and financing platforms, and risk assessment to support efforts in this regard.",""]],"7":[[1,"175","1","Market Opening and Service Sector Regulation Reform","We will open the market, improve regulation, and work to increase the supply of non-basic public services and products.",""],[1,"175","1","Digital Service Integration and New Business Model Promotion","We will actively apply new technologies, develop new forms of business, and promote integration between online and offline services, enabling people to enjoy efficient, convenient, and high-quality services.",""]],"8":[[1,"143","2","Foreign Investment Market Opening and Capital Utilization Reform","We will open more sectors to foreign investment, relax restrictions on market access, work proactively and effectively to bring in foreign capital and advanced technology, and increase the overall efficacy of foreign capital utilization.",""],[1,"143","2","Foreign Capital Investment Promotion in Priority Sectors and Regions","We will encourage more foreign capital investment in sectors such as advanced manufacturing, new technology, energy conservation and environmental protection, and modern service industries as well as in the central, western, and northeastern regions, and will support the establishment of research and development centers with foreign capital.",""],[1,"143","2","Outbound Financing and Overseas Investment Support Mechanism","We will encourage Chinese financial institutions and enterprises to obtain financing in foreign markets.",""],[1,"143","2","Overseas Production Centers and Cooperation Zones","We will establish overseas production centers and cooperation zones for major commodities and actively build financial and information service platforms for outbound investment.",""]],"9":[[1,"64","8","CNC Machine Tools and Integrated Manufacturing Systems Development","Develop fast, flexible, and high-precision CNC machine tools, basic manufacturing equipment, and integrated manufacturing systems;",""],[1,"64","9","Development of High-Grade Digital Control Components and Application Software","Develop high-grade digitally controlled systems, bearings, gratings, sensors, and other major components as well as key application software, with a focus on improving reliability and retention of precision.",""],[1,"64","10","Robot Development Initiative","Develop industrial, service, surgical, and military robots;",""],[1,"64","11","Domestic Production of Key Industrial Components","Promote independence in the design and production of high-precision retarders, high-speed high-performance controllers, high-performance servo motors and drives, and other key parts and components;",""],[1,"64","12","Commercial Application of Artificial Intelligence Technologies","Facilitate the commercial application of artificial intelligence technologies in all sectors.",""],[1,"65","2","Advanced Chemical Machinery Design and Production Initiative","With the support of projects demonstrating upgrades to the modern coal- to- chemical industry, work toward the independent design and production of a complete set of advanced chemical machinery, focusing on coal classification, coal gasification, syngas purification, energy utilization, wastewater treatment, and other key areas;",""],[1,"65","3","Oil Refining and Petrochemical R&D Support Programme","Accelerate research and development on key equipment for the integration of the oil refining and chemical industries as well as for the intensive processing of downstream petrochemical products, and help enhance complimentary support capabilities.",""]],"10":[[1,"63","2","Core Aircraft Engine and Gas Turbine Technology Breakthrough Programme","Make breakthroughs in core aircraft engine and gas turbine technologies;",""],[1,"63","3","Large Aircraft Development Acceleration","Accelerate the development of large aircraft;",""],[1,"63","4","Industrialized Development of Civil Aircraft and UAVs","Promote the industrialized development of trunk and feeder route aircraft, helicopters, general-purpose aircraft, and unmanned aerial vehicles;",""],[1,"63","5","Advanced Airborne Equipment and Systems Development","Develop advanced airborne equipment and systems;",""],[1,"63","6","Civil Aircraft Support Systems Strengthening","Strengthen supporting systems for civil aircraft;",""],[1,"63","7","Next-Generation Space Launch and Satellite Development","Develop next generation and heavy-lift launch vehicles, new types of satellites, and other space platforms and payloads;",""],[1,"63","8","Core Aerospace Components Technology Breakthrough Programme","Make breakthroughs in core technologies for key aerospace components and put them into use.",""],[1,"64","4","Rail Transit Product Development","Develop advanced and reliable rail transit products and light, modular, and serial rail products;",""],[1,"64","5","Next-Generation High-Speed and Heavy-Load Rail Transit Equipment Development","Develop next generation high-speed and heavy-load rail transit equipment and systems;",""],[1,"64","7","National High-Speed Train Technological Innovation Center","Set up a national high-speed train technological innovation center.",""]],"11":[[1,"68","10","Modern Services Development and Liberalization","We will accelerate the development of modern services, further open them to foreign competition, and improve their development environment",""],[1,"69","1","Commodity Distribution System Reform","We will deepen reform of the commodity distribution system, thereby making commodity distribution more IT-based, procedure-based, and intensive and helping traditional commercial industries move more quickly toward utilizing modern distribution methods.",""],[1,"69","1","Logistics Infrastructure and Modern Logistics Development","We will strengthen the construction of logistics infrastructure, and develop third party, green, and cold chain logistics as well as rural and urban delivery services.",""],[1,"69","1","High-Tech Services Innovation Promotion","We will promote innovation in high-tech services.",""],[1,"69","1","Producer Services Outsourcing and International Standards Alignment","We will guide producers in moving faster to see that services are separated from production and outsourced.",""],[1,"69","1","Producer Service Standards Alignment","We will bring China's producer service standards more in line with international standards so as to increase their international competitiveness.",""],[1,"69","2","Service Sector Development Acceleration","We will accelerate the development of service sectors such as education and training, health and elderly care, culture and entertainment, and sports and fitness.",""],[1,"69","2","Tourism Industry Quality and Ecotourism Development","We will develop the tourism industry by improving its quality and efficiency, accelerating the work to make Hainan an international hotspot for tourism, and supporting the development of ecotourism, cultural tourism, leisure tourism, and mountain tourism.",""],[1,"69","2","Domestic Services Modernization","We will promote the development of domestic services, working to ensure they become more specialized, scaled-up, and online-based.",""],[1,"69","2","Consumer Service Integration and Customization Support","We will encourage integration in the consumer service sector and the growth of customized services to meet personalized demands.",""],[1,"69","2","Occupational Training and Skill Appraisal for Service Workers","We will support service sector workers in taking part in occupational training and skill appraisal examinations in order to increase their levels of professionalization and specialization.",""],[1,"69","2","Quality Consumer Services Action Plan","We will put in place an action plan to ensure quality consumer services, spread the use of identifiers of quality service commitments along with systems for their management, and foster well-known service brands.",""],[1,"70","1","Market Opening for Nongovernmental Capital","We will ensure that nongovernmental capital has greater market access, accelerate the opening of competitive operations in industries such as power, civil aviation, railway, petroleum, natural gas, postal services, and urban utilities, further open the banking, education, medical service, culture, internet, commerce, and logistics sectors, and carry out comprehensive trials to further open up the service sector.",""],[1,"70","1","Removal of Discriminatory Market Regulations","We will eliminate all types of discriminatory regulations and improve policies to ensure that all types of nongovernmental capital are able to participate on an equal footing in the development of sectors such as medical services, education, childcare and early childhood education, elderly care, and sports.",""],[1,"70","1","Competitive Government Service Procurement Expansion","We will expand the scope of government service procurement and promote competition-based procurement of third party services.",""]],"12":[[1,"59","10","Supply-Side Structural Reform and Industrial Upgrading","we will move ahead with supply- side structural reforms, foster new industries while upgrading traditional ones, and move faster to put in place a new modern industrial system that has strong innovative capabilities, provides quality services, is based on close collaboration, and is environmentally friendly.",""],[1,"60","1","Made in China 2025 Action Plan","We will implement the Made in China 2025 action plan.",""],[1,"60","2","Foundational Industrial Capability Strengthening Programme","We will strengthen the foundations of industry by working to break through bottlenecks in four areas: key basic materials, core basic spare parts and components, advanced fundamental techniques, and basic industrial technologies.",""],[1,"60","2","Whole-Chain Collaborative Innovation and Joint Research Initiative","We will guide cooperation between whole- equipment manufacturing enterprises on the one hand and enterprises, institutions of higher learning, and research institutes engaged in these four areas on the other.",""],[1,"60","2","Industrial Standards and Quality Infrastructure Development","We will strengthen the development of standards, measurement, certification and accreditation, and inspection and testing systems related to fundamental industrial areas.",""],[1,"60","2","Manufacturing Innovation Center Development","We will build manufacturing innovation centers and support the development of industrial design centers.",""],[1,"60","2","National Industrial Design Institute Establishment","We will set up a national industrial design institute.",""],[1,"61","1","High-End Equipment Innovation and Development Project","We will implement the high-end equipment innovation and development project to significantly increase our design and systems integration capabilities.",""],[1,"61","1","Smart Manufacturing Initiative","We will carry out a smart manufacturing initiative aimed at accelerating the development of technologies and equipment crucial for smart manufacturing and strengthening industrial foundations such as smart manufacturing standards, industrial electronic devices, and core support software.",""],[1,"61","1","Industrial Internet Demonstration and Promotion Initiative","We will intensify facilities construction, technological verification, and the demonstration and promotion of the industrial internet, and make substantial breakthroughs in promoting Made in China + the internet.",""],[1,"61","1","Smart Manufacturing Alliance Development","We will encourage the establishment of smart manufacturing alliances.",""],[1,"61","1","Green Manufacturing System Development","We will create a green manufacturing system through green manufacturing projects and green product lifecycle management.",""],[1,"61","1","Manufacturing Service Chain Extension Initiative","To promote the transformation of manufacturing from production to both production and the provision of services, we will encourage manufacturing enterprises to extend their service chains and add value to their services.",""],[1,"61","1","Manufacturing Cluster Upgrading and Advanced Manufacturing Center Development","We will help manufacturing clusters transform and upgrade, establish demonstration centers for new industrialization, and cultivate advanced manufacturing centers.",""],[1,"61","2","Manufacturing Technology Upgrade and Enterprise Support Policy","We will transform and upgrade major manufacturing technologies and improve policies to support enterprises in emulating world-wide models in terms of techniques, processes, equipment, energy efficiency, and environmental protection, thereby helping key manufacturing sectors move into the medium-high end.",""],[1,"61","2","Consumer Goods Supply Improvement","We will improve the supply of consumer goods.",""],[1,"61","2","Industrial Consolidation and Specialized SME Development","We will encourage mergers and acquisitions of enterprises so as to put in place a highly concentrated, specialized, and cooperative industrial structure with a core of conglomerate companies.",""],[1,"61","2","Specialized Small and Medium Enterprise Development Support","We will support the development of specialized small and medium enterprises.",""],[1,"62","1","Enterprise Quality Management and Product Quality Improvement Initiative","we will work to see that enterprise quality management is strengthened, the quality of products is improved and brands are elevated, key generic technology problems affecting product quality improvement are addressed, legal protections for trademarks and brands are strengthened, and a number of competitive, well- known brands are created.",""],[1,"62","1","Product and Service Standards Release and Oversight System","We will establish a release and oversight system for the declaration of product and service standards by enterprises, and support enterprises in improving their online quality inspection and control capabilities as well as their product lifecycle quality tracking capabilities.",""],[1,"62","1","National Quality Assurance and Inspection Capacity Upgrade","We will improve quality assurance and regulation systems and strengthen national-level quality inspection and evaluation centers as well as public service platforms for quality inspection and testing certification.",""],[1,"62","1","Punitive Compensation for Product Quality Non-Compliance","We will introduce a punitive compensation system for producers who fail to meet product quality standards.",""],[1,"63","1","Business Cost Reduction and Enterprise Support Measures","We will cut business costs in the real economy.",""]],"14":[[1,"63","9","Deep-Water Exploration Equipment and Systems Development","Develop equipment and systems for deep-water exploration, ocean",""],[1,"64","2","Deep-Sea Stations and Large Floating Structures Development Projects","Promote the development and engineering of deep-sea stations and large floating structures and launch projects in this regard;",""],[1,"64","3","Core Technology Breakthroughs for High-Tech Vessel Manufacturing","Focus on breakthroughs in core technologies for cruise ships and other high- tech vessels, as well as for the integrated, intelligent, and modular design and manufacturing of key accessory equipment for such vessels.",""]],"16":[[1,"12","2","Strategic Adaptation and Reform for Development Quality Improvement","In response, we will develop a proper understanding of the deep changes in the implications of and conditions presented by this period.",""],[1,"12","2","Worst-Case Scenario Preparedness Framework","We will become more mindful of the difficulties ahead, develop a stronger sense of responsibility, and prepare ourselves for worst-case scenarios.",""],[1,"12","2","New Normal Adaptation and Guidance Initiative","We will respect both objective laws and China's national context, and work proactively to adapt to, understand, and guide the new normal.",""],[1,"12","2","Structural Reform and Growth Model Transformation Agenda","We will strive to make breakthroughs in making structural improvements, bolstering the drivers of growth, tackling problems, and strengthening areas of weakness; transform the growth model; improve the quality and efficiency of development; take care to avoid falling into the middle income trap; and constantly open up new horizons for development.",""],[1,"13","1","Supply-Side Structural Reform and Development Quality Improvement","We will make it our central task to improve the quality and efficiency of development and make supply-side structural reform the main thread of our work.",""],[1,"13","1","Demand-Supply Balancing and Growth Model Transformation","We will expand effective supply and meet effective demand, and move faster to create systems, mechanisms, and growth models that can guide the new normal in economic development.",""],[1,"13","1","Coordinated National Development and Party Building Agenda","We will maintain strategic focus, seek progress while working to keep performance stable, and coordinate efforts to achieve economic, political, cultural, social, and ecological progress and make headway in Party building so as to ensure the completion of the building of a moderately prosperous society in all respects within the set time frame",""],[1,"14","4","Economic Structural Reform and Institutional Mechanism Improvement","Placing particular emphasis on economic structural reform, we need to work more quickly to improve institutions and mechanisms in every area and remove all systemic barriers to effective development so as to provide sustained impetus for development.",""],[1,"21","5","Supply-Side Structural Reform","we must also strive to carry out supply-side structural reform so that our supply is able to satisfy the people's ever-",""],[1,"22","1","Structural Adjustment and Supply-Side Reform Package","We must use reform to push forward with structural adjustment; intensify market-oriented reform in key sectors; make adjustments to distorted policies and institutions; improve the market environment and mechanisms to encourage fair competition and survival of the fittest; do everything possible to boost vitality at the micro level; improve factor allocation; move forward in industrial structural upgrading; expand effective supply and medium- and high-end supply; make the structure of supply more adaptive and flexible; and improve total factor productivity.",""]],"17":[[1,"208","1","National Strategic Goods Reserve System","We will improve the country's reserves of strategic goods and create a national strategic resource and energy reserve system based on a combination of reserve goods, production capacity, and production locations.",""]],"18":[[1,"16","1","Core Technology Breakthroughs and Innovation Capacity Enhancement","ingredients needed for innovation will be allocated to greater effect, major breakthroughs will be made in core technologies in key sectors, and China's capacity for innovation will see an all-around improvement.",""],[1,"23","2","Basic Research and Frontier Innovation Support","Our work will be strategy-driven and frontier-oriented, will support basic research and research on key general-purpose technologies which have a bearing on overall development, and will attach greater importance to primary and disruptive innovation.",""],[1,"23","2","Acceleration of National Science and Technology Programs","We will stay focused on our objectives, give high priority to key areas, expedite the implementation of existing national science and technology programs, and launch a number of new science and technology programs.",""],[1,"23","2","Core Technology Breakthrough Initiative","We will move faster to make breakthroughs in core technologies in fields such as next generation information and communications, new energy, new materials, aeronautics and astronautics, biomedicine, and smart manufacturing.",""],[1,"23","2","Strategic High-Technology Development Program","We will strengthen the development of strategic high technologies in deep sea, deep Earth, deep space, deep blue (i.e. information technology), and other fields.",""],[1,"23","2","Systematic Technology Solutions for Development Bottlenecks","We will design programs aimed at finding systematic technological solutions to addressing bottlenecks in modern agriculture, urbanization, environmental governance, health care, elderly care, and public services.",""],[1,"23","2","Basic and Frontier Scientific Research Program","We will strengthen basic and frontier scientific research on the evolution of the universe, the structure of matter, the origin of life, the brain and cognition, and so on.",""]],"19":[[1,"3","7","Innovation Promoting Institutions and Mechanisms","Establish Innovation Promoting Institutions and Mechanisms",""],[1,"15","7","Innovation-Driven Development Strategy","We will pursue innovation-driven development, ensure that business startups and innovation flourish, and see that total factor productivity is markedly improved.",""],[1,"22","2","National Innovation-Driven Development Strategy","With innovation as the basis from which to pursue development, we will give a central role to innovation in science and technology and a supporting role to the development of talent, closely integrating scientific and technological innovation with business startups and innovation by the general public in order to achieve leading-edge development that relies more on innovation as its driver and offers greater incentives for first innovators.",""],[1,"22","3","Scientific and Technological Innovation Strengthening","We will strengthen basic research, bolster primary innovation, innovation based on the integration of existing technologies, and innovation based on import and",""],[1,"23","3","National Innovation Network Development","We will make clear the functions and roles of different types of entities involved in innovation and establish an innovation network that integrates the efforts of government, enterprises, universities, research institutes, and end-users.",""],[1,"23","3","Enterprise-Led Innovation Strengthening","We will strengthen the position of enterprises as principal entities for innovation as well as the leading role of enterprises in innovation, encourage them to conduct basic and frontier",""],[1,"24","1","100 Most Innovative Enterprises Initiative","research, implement the 100 Most Innovative Enterprises initiative, develop innovative and internationally competitive enterprises, and support the growth of small and medium high-tech enterprises.",""],[1,"24","1","National Innovation System Development","We will integrate the development of science and education, encourage institutions of higher learning, vocational colleges, and research institutes to participate fully in the development of a national innovation system, and support high-quality universities and research institutes in building comprehensive, interdisciplinary research teams.",""],[1,"24","1","National Technological Innovation Programs","We will put into effect national technological innovation programs, establish industry associations for technological innovation, develop new types of market- oriented research institutes, and give impetus to collaborative innovation across fields and industries.",""],[1,"25","1","Trans-Regional Innovation Network Development","We will guide the flow and grouping together of innovative factors and create trans-regional innovation networks.",""],[1,"25","1","Regional Innovation Center and Innovative Province Development","We will use major cities with strong concentrations of institutions of higher learning and research institutes, national innovation demonstration areas, and national high- tech industry development parks to develop innovative provinces, cities, and regional innovation centers that can greatly facilitate the development of their surrounding areas.",""],[1,"25","1","Comprehensive Innovation Pilot Reforms","Systematic steps will be taken to carry out pilot reforms for comprehensive innovation.",""],[1,"25","1","International Scientific and Technological Innovation Centers in Beijing and Shanghai","We will support Beijing and Shanghai in developing internationally influential centers of scientific and technological innovation.",""],[1,"25","16","Innovation and New Business Development Promotion","We will integrate efforts to see that more people start businesses and make innovations in all areas of development and encourage different types of entities to develop new technologies, products, forms of business, and models, creating new drivers of development.",""],[1,"26","1","Business Startup and Innovation Support Action Plan","We will put into effect an action plan to see that more people start businesses and make innovations, encourage the development of low-cost, convenient, and open service platforms for the public as well as micro, small, and medium enterprises, and create a number of business startup and innovation demonstration centers and cities.",""],[1,"26","1","Open Access Patent Information and Research Resource Platform","We will channel greater energy into integrating information resources and make patent information resources and research centers openly accessible to businesses.",""],[1,"26","1","Enterprise Technology Transfer and Startup Support Platforms","We will encourage large enterprises to establish technology transfer and service platforms, providing technological support to those who are starting up in business.",""],[1,"26","1","Business Startup Service Improvement and Venture Capital Platform Development","We will improve services for fostering business startups and develop open service providers combining business startup services with venture capital investment and online with offline services.",""],[1,"26","1","Government Venture Capital Guide Fund Utilization","We will make better use of government venture capital guide funds.",""],[1,"27","1","Innovation Commercialization and Policy Reform","We will remove institutional barriers to innovation and the commercialization of the results of innovation, improve relevant policies, and develop systems and mechanisms that help to unleash creativity, ensure efficient application of the outcomes of innovation, and fully reward innovation.",""],[1,"27","2","Innovation-Oriented Science and Technology Governance Reform","we will bring about a shift in the role of government away from research and development management toward the provision of innovation services.",""],[1,"27","2","Unified Science and Technology Management Platform","We will establish a unified science and technology management platform and improve mechanisms for managing science and technology reports, carrying out innovation surveys, and releasing and sharing resources.",""],[1,"27","2","Science and Technology Consultation and Entrepreneur Participation Mechanism","We will improve the consultation system for national decisions on science and technology and strengthen the say of entrepreneurs in the country's decision-making systems related to innovation.",""],[1,"27","2","Enterprise-Led Market-Oriented Science and Technology Programs","We will ensure that enterprises play the leading role in market-oriented science and technology programs.",""],[1,"27","2","Autonomy and Performance Reform for Higher Education and Research Institutions","Greater autonomy will be given to institutions of higher learning and research institutes, performance evaluation mechanisms that take medium- and long-term objectives into consideration will be put into effect, and more importance will be attached to the quality, originality, and contribution of research.",""],[1,"27","2","Innovation Leadership Resource Empowerment Initiative","We will empower leaders of innovation by seeing that they have more human, financial, and material resources at their disposal and more power to make decisions related to technology roadmaps.",""],[1,"27","2","Exploratory Innovation Support Policy","We will support exploratory work and allow for innovation over which consensus has not yet formed.",""],[1,"27","2","Intellectual Property Rights Reform and Judicial Protection","We will deepen reform related to intellectual property rights and strengthen their judicial protection.",""],[1,"28","1","Science and Technology Commercialization Reform","We will implement a plan to improve the commercialization of science and technology advances, fully delegate the rights to dispose, use, and profit from the results of innovation, ensure that researchers enjoy a greater share of the proceeds from the commercialization of their research achievements, and support them in working part- time or full-time toward the application of their scientific and technological results.",""],[1,"28","1","Innovation Financing Model Development","We will establish financing models that cover the entire process of scientific and technological innovation from the experimental research stage to mid-stage trials and right through to production, and promote the assetization and industrial application of scientific and technological advances.",""],[1,"28","1","Knowledge-Based Incentive Policy Reform","We will adopt profit distribution policies oriented toward strengthening the value ascribed to knowledge, and we will strengthen stock-, stock option-, and dividend-based incentives for innovators.",""],[1,"28","2","Innovation-Friendly Market and Regulatory Reform","We will work to create a competitive market environment that incentivizes innovation; straighten out institutions, regulations, and industry standards that hold back innovation; expedite legislation in areas where innovation is weak; and strengthen oversight over compliance with industrial technology policies and standards.",""],[1,"28","2","Public Science and Technology Investment Expansion","Government science and technology investment will be increased, with the focus on supporting basic and frontier research, public benefit-related research, and research related to key general-purpose technologies.",""],[1,"28","2","R&D Tax Incentives and Accelerated Depreciation Support","To encourage businesses to increase their investment in research and development, we will implement additional tax deductions for their expenditures on research and development, expand the coverage of policies for the accelerated depreciation of fixed assets, and increase initial government purchasing and commissioning of innovative products.",""],[1,"28","2","Innovation Finance and Venture Capital Development","We will strengthen financial support for innovation and channel great energy into developing venture capital.",""],[1,"28","2","Entrepreneurship Rights Protection and Innovation Incentives","We will give full play to the role of entrepreneurs, allow for the challenge that innovation poses toward entrenched interests, and protect entrepreneurs' property rights and proceeds from innovation in accordance with the law.",""]],"20":[[1,"24","2","Development of National Science and Technology Infrastructure","We will work faster to develop national science and technology infrastructure for research on energy, the life sciences, Earth system science and environmental science, materials science, particle physics and nuclear physics, space and astronomy, and engineering technology, and for research in certain interdisciplinary fields of study, and make use of existing advanced facilities to develop comprehensive national science centers.",""],[1,"24","2","National Technological Innovation Centers and Corporate Technology Centers","Enterprises, universities, and research institutes will be entrusted with building national technological innovation centers and we will support the development of corporate technology centers.",""],[1,"24","2","Open Sharing of Research Infrastructure and Innovation Resources","We will give impetus to the open sharing of research infrastructure and innovation resources by institutions of higher learning and research institutes.",""]],"21":[[1,"163","2","Modern University System and Higher Education Governance Reform","We will develop the modern university system and refine the internal governance structures of universities.",""],[1,"163","2","Higher Education Teaching Staff and Curriculum Upgrade","We will cultivate a first-class teaching staff and update teaching content with new theories, knowledge, and techniques.",""],[1,"163","2","Higher Education Quality Assurance Improvement","We will improve the system for ensuring the quality of higher education.",""],[1,"163","2","Comprehensive Reform of Higher Education Institutions","We will manage higher education based on classification and carry out the comprehensive reform of institutions of higher learning to ensure that they optimize the arrangement of their disciplines and majors, reform their training mechanisms, implement an educational system using different methods to cultivate academic talent and applied talent whilst combining general knowledge and major-specific knowledge, strengthen instruction through practice, and nurture the capacity of students for creativity, innovation, and starting businesses.",""],[1,"163","2","Higher Education Expansion in Central and Western Regions","We will invigorate higher education in the central and western regions and see that more students from these regions and rural areas are able to enter key institutions of higher learning.",""],[1,"163","2","University Innovation Capacity Enhancement","We will ensure that all universities improve their capacity for innovation, and will adopt a coordinated approach to developing world- class universities and disciplines.",""],[1,"165","6","College Basic Conditions Improvement Programme","Support colleges providing undergraduate education in improving their basic conditions including facilities for teaching, conducting experiments, and training;",""],[1,"165","8","University-Enterprise Collaboration for Emerging Discipline Clusters","Support the development of clusters of emerging disciplines and majors to serve modern industry through cooperation between universities and enterprises.",""],[1,"165","9","World-Class University and Discipline Development Initiative","Give high priority to supporting the development of a number of world- class universities and disciplines, and ensuring that some disciplines reach the highest ranks worldwide;",""],[1,"165","10","University Innovation Capacity Improvement Initiative","Continue the initiative to improve universities' capacity for innovation.",""]],"22":[[1,"179","2","Lifelong Vocational Skills Training System","put in place a system for life-long vocational skills training",""],[1,"179","2","Free Vocational Training Initiative for Priority Groups","We will implement an initiative to provide free vocational training to children from poor families, junior and senior secondary school graduates who have not moved on to the next level of education, migrant workers, the unemployed, workers reemployed in other fields, former military personnel, and persons with disabilities",""],[1,"179","2","Professional Title Evaluation and Technical Skill Certification Reform","We will improve policies for evaluating professional titles and certifying technical skill grades for highly-skilled personnel",""],[1,"179","4","Workforce Skills Improvement Initiative","Improve the skills of new members of the workforce;",""],[1,"179","5","Training for Already Employed Workers","Conduct training for already employed workers;",""],[1,"179","6","Enterprise Apprenticeship System Promotion","Encourage enterprises to implement new apprenticeship systems;",""],[1,"179","7","Strategic Emerging Industries Skills Development","Develop the skills of workers in urgently needed areas within strategic emerging industries.",""],[1,"180","1","Entrepreneurship Education and Training Expansion","Make education on starting new businesses more widespread and strengthen entrepreneurship training;",""],[1,"180","2","Community-Level Work Experience Plan for College Graduates","Implement a plan for college graduates to gain experience through community- level work.",""],[1,"180","3","Employment Skills Training for Rural School Graduates and Migrant Workers","Through targeted training programs and training for specific job and business demands, provide employment skills training for rural junior and senior secondary school graduates who have not moved on to the next level of education as well as other new generation migrant worker groups;",""],[1,"180","4","Entrepreneurship Training for Migrant Workers","Provide entrepreneurship training for migrant workers who wish to start their own businesses;",""],[1,"180","6","Vocational and Entrepreneurship Training Support","Strengthen vocational skills training and entrepreneurship training for children of families with financial difficulties, older unemployed persons, workers reemployed in other fields, former military personnel, and workers with disabilities;",""],[1,"180","7","Training Subsidy Provision","Provide training subsidies in accordance with regulations;",""],[1,"180","8","Apprenticeship Living Allowance Support","Offer living allowances to people from rural families with financial difficulties and from urban families receiving subsistence allowances who are engaged in apprenticeships.",""],[1,"180","11","Regional Public Training Centers","Establish regional public training centers;",""],[1,"188","1","Rehabilitation Universities Establishment","We will establish rehabilitation universities to cultivate rehabilitation health professionals.",""],[1,"188","8","Youth Centers and Youth Development Organizations Strengthening","Strengthen the development of youth centers and other organizations serving the needs of youth development;",""]],"23":[[1,"162","1","Unified Compulsory Education Funding Mechanism","We will establish a unified urban and rural funding mechanism for compulsory education which places emphasis on rural areas, and increase funding for public education in the central and western regions, remote or poor areas, and areas with concentrations of ethnic minorities.",""],[1,"162","1","Compulsory Education Standards and School Improvement Program","We will take appropriate measures to ensure that state-run schools that provide compulsory education comply with educational standards, improve conditions in boarding schools as well as badly built and poorly operated schools, improve the regional layout of education institutions and services, work to eliminate extremely large class sizes in urban schools, achieve a basic balance between schools in the same county in the allocation of educational resources, and raise the completion rate of compulsory education to 95%.",""],[1,"162","1","Rural Teacher Support and Shortage Reduction Plan","We will strengthen the ranks of teachers with emphasis on those teachers in rural schools, implement a support plan for rural teachers, and address structural, school level-specific, and regional teacher shortages through methods such as the provision of government-purchased teaching positions.",""],[1,"162","1","Rural School Teaching Environment Improvement","We will improve the teaching environment in rural schools.",""],[1,"162","1","Rural Preschool Expansion and Three-Year Preschool Plan","We will help make rural preschool education more accessible by encouraging the development of rural kindergartens open to all children, carry out the three-year preschool education plan, and work to see the gross enrollment ratio for children receiving three-year preschool education rise to 85%.",""],[1,"162","1","Senior Secondary Fee Waiver and Enrollment Expansion","We will work to make senior secondary school education more universal and give high priority to waiving fees for senior secondary school students registered as economically disadvantaged students, with the aim of seeing the gross enrollment ratio rise to over 90%.",""],[1,"162","1","Special Needs Education Support Expansion","We will increase the availability and quality of special needs education for groups with disabilities, and increase support given to such education.",""],[1,"162","1","Ethnic Minority Education and Bilingual Teacher Training","We will actively promote the development of education for ethnic minority students, appropriately move ahead with bilingual education, and strengthen bilingual teacher training.",""],[1,"165","1","Upgrading State-Run Compulsory Education Schools","Gradually ensure that state-run compulsory education schools that cannot yet meet required standards work to bring their buildings, premises, and staffing up to standard.",""],[1,"165","2","Senior Secondary Education Resource Expansion in Poor Areas","Increase senior secondary education resources in poor areas in the central and western regions, particularly in contiguous poor areas;",""],[1,"165","4","Kindergarten Access Expansion","Strengthen the development of such kindergartens, focusing particularly on making sure children of kindergarten age in rural parts of the central and western regions as well as children born in urban areas after the introduction of the two- child policy have access to kindergarten education.",""]],"24":[[1,"162","2","Modern Vocational Education System Strengthening","We will improve the modern vocational education system and strengthen infrastructure in vocational education.",""],[1,"162","2","Applied Institution Conversion for Undergraduate Colleges","If conditions are suitable, colleges providing undergraduate education will be encouraged to become applied institutions.",""],[1,"162","2","Industry-School Vocational Training Cooperation Model","We will give impetus to training models for applied expertise or technical skills which allow for the involvement of industry and vocational education as well as cooperation between schools and enterprises, and promote two-way exchanges between faculty members",""],[1,"163","1","Production-Oriented Vocational Education Reform","We will prompt the development of production-oriented majors, class content, and teaching methods.",""],[1,"163","1","Vocational and General Education Mobility Framework","We will promote mutual recognition and vertical mobility between vocational education and regular education.",""],[1,"163","1","Secondary Vocational Education Fee Waiver","We will phase in, based on classification, the waiving of tuition and miscellaneous fees at schools providing secondary vocational education and put into effect a national program to offer basic vocational training packages.",""],[1,"165","3","Secondary Vocational Schooling Access for Junior Secondary Graduates","See that basically all junior secondary school graduates in poor parts of these regions who did not enroll in regular senior secondary education enter into secondary vocational schooling.",""],[1,"165","5","Vocational Education Enterprise Cooperation Support Programme","Support 100 higher vocational institutions and 1,000 secondary vocational schools in strengthening cooperation with enterprises to develop vocational education internship and training facilities;",""],[1,"165","7","Establish Applied Undergraduate Colleges","Establish a number of high-quality applied undergraduate colleges;",""]],"25":[[1,"29","1","Human Resource Development System and Policy Innovation","move faster to make innovations in the systems and policies for human resource development",""],[1,"29","1","Internationally Competitive Personnel System","create an internationally competitive personnel system",""],[1,"29","1","Human Resources Quality and Structure Improvement","improve the caliber and structure of human resources",""],[1,"29","2","Strategic Skilled Personnel Adjustment and Talent Development Initiative","We will carry out strategic adjustments to the structure of skilled personnel, orienting our efforts particularly toward cultivating highly educated, professionally competent, cutting-edge, and urgently needed talent, and launch major talent development initiatives to identify, foster, and bring together science strategists, leading talent in the field of science and technology, talent working in the social sciences, outstanding entrepreneurs, and highly skilled personnel.",""],[1,"29","2","Party and Government Cadre Training Programme","We will train Party and government workers who have political integrity, professional competence, good managerial skills, and the ability to adopt an international perspective.",""],[1,"29","2","Innovative Student Cultivation Reform in Higher Education","We will promote reform of the models for cultivating innovative students at institutions of higher learning and guide efforts to closely link the talent cultivation chain with industry chains and innovation chains.",""],[1,"29","3","Talent Mobility and Incentive Policy Reform","We will establish sound mechanisms for the free movement of talent, improve horizontal and vertical social mobility, and encourage the orderly, free movement of talent between different kinds of organizations and between different regions.",""],[1,"29","3","Talent Incentive Package for Community-Level Organizations","We will improve policies on wages, medical care, professional titles, old-age pensions, and other incentives to encourage the flow of talent toward community-level organizations, the",""],[1,"30","1","Talent Exchange and Pairing Support Initiative","We will advance talent exchanges and pairing talent support between the eastern coastal region on the one hand and the central and western regions and the northeast and other old industrial regions on the other, and continue the talent training initiative whereby cities in the east provide pairing support to cities in the west.",""],[1,"30","2","Skilled Personnel Assessment and Incentive Reform","We will improve assessment, incentive, and service systems for skilled personnel, and foster a society in which all members are able to tap into their potential and talented young people are able to excel.",""],[1,"30","2","Overseas Talent Attraction and Residency Facilitation","We will adopt more proactive, more open, and more effective policies to bring in overseas talent, improve the permanent residence system for foreign nationals, and relax the criteria for highly skilled foreign nationals to gain permanent residency.",""],[1,"30","2","Skilled Foreign National Entry and Residence Services","We will move faster to provide more efficient and convenient entry, exit, and residence services for skilled foreign nationals coming to work in China.",""],[1,"30","2","International Student Support and Talent Development","We will increase the number of international students in China, optimize the international student mix, and improve the mechanisms for supporting their training.",""],[1,"30","2","Outstanding Talent International Placement and Return Support","We will cultivate outstanding talent and recommend them to international organizations, improve relevant supporting policies, and ensure that barriers are removed for them to return and take up positions in China.",""],[1,"30","3","Scientist Studios for Leading Scientific and Technological Innovators","Set up scientist studios for fields where China has competitive strengths, focusing particularly on supporting and training young and middle-aged leading scientific and technological innovators;",""],[1,"31","1","Innovation Team Development Initiative","Build teams of innovators in key fields;",""],[1,"31","2","Innovation Support and Learning Centers","Make focused efforts to support innovators and entrepreneurs working in science and technology and establish centers for others to learn from them to foster innovative talent.",""],[1,"31","3","Young Talent Training and Research Support Programme","Train the very best young talent in key disciplines and support their research;",""],[1,"31","4","National Young Talent Training Centers","Establish national young talent training centers for outstanding college students at quality research universities and research institutes for basic disciplines where the strengths of the respective university or institute lie;",""],[1,"31","5","Overseas Advanced Training Talent Selection Programme","Select the best talent from new senior secondary school and college graduates every year to participate in advanced training at first-class universities outside China and keep track of their progress.",""],[1,"31","6","Entrepreneur Training Programme","Train entrepreneurs who have a perspective on global needs, think strategically, and are innovative;",""],[1,"31","7","Business Executive Training Programme","Train 10,000 business executives in strategic planning, capital operations, quality control, human resources management, finance, accounting, and law.",""],[1,"31","8","Overseas Science and Technology Talent Attraction Initiative","Attract science strategists and leading talent working in science and technology from overseas who have the capacity to engage in primary innovation, make breakthroughs in key technologies, develop high-tech industries, and drive the development of emerging disciplines;",""],[1,"31","9","Overseas Talent Recruitment Initiative","Bring in approximately 10,000 high-caliber talented individuals from overseas",""],[1,"31","11","Talent Recruitment and Support Programme","Select from within China and offer support to approximately 10,000 urgently needed, highly talented individuals.",""],[1,"31","12","Professional and Technical Personnel Training Programme","Train one million high-caliber, urgently needed, and key professional and technical personnel each year;",""],[1,"31","13","National Continuing Education Centers","Establish national continuing education centers, drawing on existing education institutions at universities, research institutes, and large enterprises.",""],[1,"31","14","Master Studios and Training Centers for Highly Skilled Personnel","Build master studios and 1,200 training centers for highly skilled personnel around the country to train ten million highly skilled workers.",""],[1,"59","4","Modern Agricultural Talent Development Plan","Implement the modern agricultural talent development plan;",""],[1,"59","5","Agribusiness Leadership and Modern Farm Management Training","Cultivate leaders of new types of agribusiness, and train young managers capable of operating modern farms, people with practical skills for rural areas, and a new type of professional farmer.",""]],"26":[[1,"160","7","School Infrastructure and Operations Improvement in Poor Areas","Improve the basic conditions of badly built and poorly operated schools providing compulsory education in poor areas throughout the country;",""],[1,"160","8","Rural Teacher Training Programme","Strengthen training for teachers working in rural areas;",""],[1,"160","9","Nutrition Improvement Project for Rural Students","Ensure effective implementation of the nutrition improvement project for students receiving compulsory education in rural areas;",""],[1,"160","9","Education Aid and Financial Support for Poor Families","Step up aid and financial support for students from poor families receiving pre-school education, special needs education, and senior secondary and higher education;",""],[1,"160","10","Targeted Vocational Training for Rural Poor Households","Continue to implement the initiative to provide targeted training for people living in poverty in rural areas, ensuring that all high school graduates from poor families who have failed to receive higher education have access to vocational education.",""],[1,"165","12","Teacher Training Development and High-Caliber Teacher Cultivation Program","Support the development of teacher training and launch a program to cultivate high-caliber teachers;",""],[1,"165","13","Expansion of Bilingual and Secondary Vocational Teacher Numbers","Add to bilingual teacher numbers in areas with concentrations of ethnic minorities and to secondary vocational teacher numbers in poor areas;",""],[1,"165","14","Special Rural Teacher Recruitment and Housing Programme","Recruit teachers for the special rural teacher program every year to gradually bring their number to 100,000; Build accommodations for teachers in rural areas;",""],[1,"165","15","Head Teacher Plan Implementation","Implement the head teacher plan in primary and secondary schools",""],[1,"166","2","Special Needs Teacher Training Programme","Strengthen efforts to train special needs teachers.",""]],"27":[[1,"175","7","Public-Interest Preschool Education Subsidies","Subsidies for public-interest preschool education;",""],[1,"175","8","National Financial Assistance for Secondary Vocational Education","National financial assistance for secondary vocational education;",""],[1,"175","9","Tuition Fee Waivers for Secondary Vocational Education","Tuition fee waivers for secondary vocational education;",""],[1,"175","10","Financial Assistance for Ordinary Senior Secondary Students","Financial assistance for ordinary senior secondary school students;",""],[1,"175","11","Tuition Fee Waivers for Poor Senior Secondary Students","Tuition fee waivers for senior secondary school students from poor",""],[1,"188","6","Preschool Education Support for Poor Rural Children","Help the children of poor rural families to receive preschool education.",""]],"28":[[1,"16","3","Education Modernization and Adult Educational Attainment Upgrade","Important progress will be made in modernizing education, and the average number of years of education completed by the working-age population will be significantly increased.",""],[1,"163","3","Lifelong Learning and Continuing Education System","We will emphasize the development of continuing education and build a system for lifelong learning and training available to all members of society.",""],[1,"163","3","Open Learning Resources Sharing Initiative","We will encourage the open sharing of all types of learning resources, ensure the success of open",""],[1,"164","1","Online and Distance Learning Expansion","develop online and distance learning, and integrate all kinds of digital learning resources to make them available to the general public.",""],[1,"164","1","Personal Learning Accounts and Credit System","We will establish a system for personal learning accounts and credits, make it easier for people to pursue continuing education and lifelong learning, formulate a national qualifications framework, and promote credit transfers and recognition of the learning outcomes of non-degree education and vocational skill grades.",""],[1,"164","1","National Qualifications Framework","We will establish a system for personal learning accounts and credits, make it easier for people to pursue continuing education and lifelong learning, formulate a national qualifications framework, and promote credit transfers and recognition of the learning outcomes of non-degree education and vocational skill grades.",""],[1,"164","1","Senior Citizen Education Programme","We will develop senior citizen education.",""],[1,"165","11","Continuing Education and Training Support for Migrant Workers and Other Groups","Support higher learning institutions and vocational institutions in providing continuing education and training for migrant workers in cities, modern professional farmers, modern industrial workers, and demobilized service personnel;",""],[1,"165","11","Personal Learning Accounts and Academic Credit Certification Platform","Establish personal learning accounts and an academic credit certification platform.",""]],"29":[[1,"164","2","Comprehensive Education Reform","We will deepen education reform to increase students' sense of social responsibility, their awareness of rule of law, their spirit of innovation, and their ability to put ideas into practice; to strengthen education in sports, physical health, mental health, the arts, and aesthetics; and to cultivate students' interest in innovation and their scientific literacy.",""],[1,"164","2","Examination and Enrollment System Reform","We will deepen reform of the examination and enrollment systems as well as instructional reform.",""],[1,"164","2","Student Assessment Administration","We will administer the Academic Proficiency Test and the Comprehensive Student Assessment to junior and senior secondary school students.",""],[1,"164","2","Teacher Professional Title System Reform","We will launch a nationwide reform of the professional title system for primary and secondary school teachers and improve teacher salaries and benefits.",""],[1,"164","2","Education Digital Integration Initiative","We will promote close integration of modern information technology with education and teaching.",""],[1,"164","2","Education Spending Guarantee","We will guarantee certain levels of spending on education in accordance with the law.",""],[1,"164","2","School Governance and Oversight Reform","We will operate on the principle of separation between the management, running, and assessment of schools, expand the decision-making powers of schools, improve inspection of and oversight over education, and strengthen social oversight over education.",""],[1,"164","2","Differentiated Education Support Policy System","We will put in place a system of policies for management according to institution type and for the provision of differentiated support, and encourage nongovernmental actors and investors to provide a diverse range of education services.",""],[1,"164","2","Student Financial Support System","We will improve the financial support system and ensure that all students from financially disadvantaged families are covered.",""],[1,"164","3","Education Development Action Plan for Central and Western Regions","Implement an action plan to accelerate the development of education in the central and western regions;",""]],"30":[[1,"176","3","Joint Recruitment Services in Large and Medium Cities","Joint recruitment services in large and medium cities;",""],[1,"178","3","Proactive Employment Policy and Startup Promotion","We will implement a more proactive employment policy, create more job opportunities, work to solve problems of structural unemployment, and encourage business startups that create employment, so as to ensure relatively full and high quality employment.",""],[1,"178","4","Full Employment Promotion and Employment Support Measures","We will give greater prominence to the realization of full employment and set this as a priority goal for economic and social development.",""],[1,"178","4","Graduate Employment and Entrepreneurship Support","We will implement initiatives for promoting the employment of college graduates and for guiding them in starting their own businesses, build platforms for innovation and business startups, and improve policy incentives to encourage college graduates to start up their own businesses and work at the community level.",""],[1,"178","4","Rural Labor Reemployment and Migrant Returnee Entrepreneurship Support","We will support surplus rural labor in seeking nonagricultural work and migrant workers in returning to their hometowns to startup businesses.",""],[1,"178","4","Flexible and New Forms of Employment Support","We will support flexible employment and new forms of employment to make it easier for people to seek employment on their own.",""],[1,"178","4","Demobilized Military Personnel Employment Placement","We will see that demobilized military personnel are settled into new jobs.",""],[1,"178","4","Employment Assistance and Zero-Employment Household Support","We will strengthen employment assistance, conduct real-name dynamic management over people facing difficulty in obtaining employment and offer assistance based on the type of situation, and ensure that \"zero employment\" families get the necessary help.",""],[1,"178","4","Reemployment Support Measures","We will provide more support for reemployment.",""],[1,"178","4","Employment Discrimination Prohibition","We will prohibit all forms of employment discrimination.",""],[1,"178","4","Employment Agency Service Standardization","We will standardize services offered by employment agencies.",""],[1,"179","1","Labor Relations Coordination and Worker Protection Mechanism","improve coordination mechanisms for labor relations, strengthen labor protection inspection and dispute mediation and arbitration, protect the legitimate rights and interests of employees, protect the rights and interests of workers engaged in informal employment, and comprehensively address the problem of wage arrears for migrant workers",""],[1,"179","2","Employment and Business Startup Service System Improvement","We will improve service systems for employment and business startups",""],[1,"179","2","Employment and Unemployment Statistics and Early Warning System","We will improve the statistics system for measuring employment and unemployment, improve unemployment monitoring and early warning mechanisms, release data on surveyed unemployment rates in urban areas, and strengthen monitoring of and responses to large-scale unemployment in particular regions and sectors",""],[1,"179","2","Digital Employment Service Delivery and Information Sharing","We will further promote the use of information technology in the provision of public services for employment and business startups, and promote openness and sharing of all types of employment information",""],[1,"179","8","Graduate Employment Support Services","Improve the real name database of college graduates who have not yet found employment, and provide employment information, vocational guidance, employment internships, and other employment services for college graduates;",""],[1,"180","9","Public Service Facilities for Employment and Startup Support","Improve public service facilities for employment and business startups;",""],[1,"180","10","Business Startup Demonstration Areas for Returnees","Support the establishment of demonstration areas for business startup that have been established by people returning to their hometowns;",""],[1,"180","12","County Employment and Business Startup Service Facilities","Ensure service facilities for employment and business startups are established in all counties;",""],[1,"180","14","Basic Public Service System for Floating Population Personnel Files","Improve the basic public service system for personnel files on the floating population.",""],[1,"187","2","Employment and Business Startup Support for Persons with Disabilities","We will improve policies for supporting the employment and business startup activities of persons with disabilities, and improve the system for public organizations to offer them employment.",""]],"31":[[1,"185","3","Multilevel Elderly Care Service System","We will establish a multilevel elderly care service system based on at- home care, supported by communities, and supplemented by elderly care institutions.",""],[1,"185","3","Public-Interest Elderly Service Facilities and Care Infrastructure","We will make coordinated plans for building public-interest elderly service facilities and support the building of nursing homes and community day-care centers for disabled elderly persons.",""],[1,"185","3","Elderly Subsidy Support System","We will establish systems for providing subsidies for very elderly persons and senior citizens suffering from loss of physical and/or mental capacity, who are experiencing financial difficulties.",""],[1,"185","3","Aging Science Research Strengthening","We will strengthen research on aging science.",""],[1,"185","3","Elderly Care Workforce Training Initiative","We will put in place initiatives for training elderly care personnel and strengthen the contingent",""],[1,"186","1","Elderly Care Workforce Development","of elderly care professionals and management personnel.",""],[1,"186","1","Health and Elderly Care Service Integration","We will promote integration between health care and elderly care services.",""],[1,"186","1","Elderly Welfare and Charity System Improvement","We will improve welfare and charity systems to better meet the demands of population aging.",""],[1,"186","1","Elderly-Friendly Living Environment Support","We will help foster a comfortable living environment for the elderly.",""],[1,"186","1","Elderly Services Market Liberalization and Procurement Support","We will open up the entire elderly services market, and through means such as service procurement and equity cooperation, we will support all types of market participants in providing more elderly care products and services.",""],[1,"186","1","Elderly Rights Protection and Respect Campaign","We will strengthen protection of the rights and interests of the elderly and promote the social customs of respecting, caring for, and helping the elderly.",""],[1,"188","14","Elderly Care Facilities Expansion","Improve elderly care facilities by building nursing homes for the elderly, helping provide combined medical and care services, developing better community day- care centers, and providing rehabilitation equipment;",""],[1,"188","15","Community-Based Elderly Care Information Platforms","Develop community information platforms for at-home elderly care services, promote the construction of smart elderly care communities, promote the embedding of long-term care systems into communities, and move forward on seeing",""],[1,"188","15","Smart Elderly Care Community Construction","promote the construction of smart elderly care communities",""],[1,"188","15","Community Integration of Long-Term Care Systems","promote the embedding of long-term care systems into communities",""],[1,"189","1","Elderly Care Service Coverage Expansion","that elderly care services cover all elderly people who live at home;",""],[1,"189","1","Elderly-Friendly Facility Renovation Trials","Launch trials of renovations of facilities aimed at better meeting the needs of the elderly;",""],[1,"189","1","Mutual Assistance and Elderly Care Programme","Implement programs for mutual assistance and care among the elderly.",""]],"32":[[1,"181","2","Dynamic Social Security Mechanism for Vulnerable Groups","We will improve dynamic social security mechanisms aimed specifically at groups in difficult circumstances to ensure their basic needs are met.",""],[1,"182","2","Social Security System Management Improvement","We will steadily raise the level and quality of the overall management of social security accounts and work to make the social security system more equitable and sustainable.",""],[1,"182","3","Social Safety Net Expansion and Social Security Reform","We will ensure that the social safety net covers essentially all people entitled by law.",""],[1,"182","3","Social Security Financing and Responsibility Framework","We will ensure actuarial balance of the social security system, improve funding mechanisms, and clearly define the social security responsibilities of government, enterprises, and individuals.",""],[1,"182","3","Insurance Premium Reduction Measure","We will reduce insurance premiums as appropriate.",""],[1,"182","3","Urban Workers' Basic Old-Age Insurance Reform","We will improve the basic old-age insurance system for urban workers which is based on social pooling and individual accounts, and we will establish a multilevel old-age insurance system that includes annuities for employees of enterprises and public",""],[1,"183","1","National Social Insurance Coverage Expansion","We will continuously expand the coverage of this system.",""],[1,"183","1","Unified Management of Basic Old-Age Insurance Pooling Accounts","We will bring the social pooling account of workers' basic old- age insurance under national unified management.",""],[1,"183","1","Old-Age Insurance Account and Pension Adjustment Reform","We will improve the individual account system for workers' old-age insurance as well as incentive and restraint mechanisms related to individual insurance contributions, and establish a mechanism for making appropriate adjustments to basic pensions.",""],[1,"183","1","Deferred Tax Pension Scheme","We will launch pension schemes that allow for deferred payment of individual income tax.",""],[1,"183","1","Unemployment Insurance and Workers' Compensation Reform","We will make better use of the role of unemployment insurance and workers' compensation, increase the flexibility with which their premiums are determined, and improve and adjust the scope of their applicability.",""],[1,"183","1","Social Security Account Portability Mechanism","We will establish a mechanism to allow social security accounts to be transferred with greater ease.",""],[1,"183","1","Social Security Fund Capital Replenishment and Investment Expansion","We will appropriate a portion of state capital to replenish social security funds, expand channels for the investment of social insurance funds, and strengthen risk management in order to ensure increasing rates of returns on investments.",""],[1,"183","1","Insurance Inclusion for Flexible Workers and Migrant Workers","We will work to see a significant increase in the participation of groups such as those with flexible employment and migrant workers in insurance schemes.",""],[1,"183","1","Social Insurance Public Service Facilities and Information Platforms","We will strengthen the development of public service facilities and information platforms for social insurance.",""],[1,"183","1","Social Security Card Promotion Initiative","We will implement an initiative to promote the use of social security cards and work to see the proportion of card holders reach 90% of total social insurance participants.",""]],"33":[[1,"176","32","Special Assistance for Families Affected by Family Planning Policy","Special assistance to families following family planning policy;",""],[1,"177","2","Basic Assistance for Persons Living in Extreme Poverty","Basic assistance to persons living in extreme poverty;",""],[1,"177","5","Differentiated Assistance Programs for Children in Difficult Circumstances","Differentiated assistance programs for children living in difficulties;",""],[1,"177","27","Living Allowances for Persons with Disabilities","Living allowances for persons with disabilities who are in need;",""],[1,"177","28","Nursing Care Subsidies for Persons with Severe Disabilities","Nursing care subsidies for persons with severe disabilities;",""],[1,"177","29","Subsistence Assistance for Unemployed Persons with Severe Disabilities","Subsistence assistance for unemployed persons with severe disabilities;",""],[1,"177","30","Assistive Devices Subsidy Scheme","Subsidies for basic assistive devices for persons with disabilities living in",""],[1,"183","2","Integrated Social Assistance System Development","We will coordinate the development of social assistance systems in urban and rural areas, improve the subsistence allowance program, strengthen policy integration, promote program integration, and ensure that the basic needs of groups with difficulties are met.",""],[1,"183","2","Integrated Social Assistance Delivery Structure","We will build an integrated structure for social assistance-related work, enrich social assistance services, raise standards of assistance as appropriate, and ensure that issues related to any of the diverse range of social assistance services can be dealt with at one place through the concerted efforts of relevant departments.",""],[1,"183","2","Social Assistance Eligibility Verification Mechanism","We will establish a sound mechanism for verifying the financial situation of families receiving social assistance, and work to ensure that wherever possible, entitled families are listed for the receipt of assistance while families that do not qualify for entitlement are",""],[1,"184","1","Comprehensive Assistance Trials for People in Exceptional Difficulty","We will launch comprehensive trials of providing assistance to those experiencing exceptional difficulties, and we will improve community-level service facilities for offering assistance to beggars and the homeless.",""],[1,"184","2","Social Welfare System Improvement","We will improve the social welfare system with a focus on care and assistance for the elderly, persons with disabilities, minors, and those in financial difficulty.",""],[1,"184","2","Home-Based Elderly Care and Family Care Policy","We will establish policies to support at-home elderly care and promote family-based elderly and child care.",""],[1,"184","2","Child Welfare and Protection Services","We will ensure work related to the welfare and protection of children in need is carried out well.",""],[1,"184","2","Child Adoption System Reform","We will improve the child adoption system.",""],[1,"184","2","Resettlement Support for Entitled Groups","We will strengthen resettlement work for entitled groups.",""],[1,"184","2","Public Funeral Services and Facilities Development","We will develop basic public-interest funeral services, and support the development of public funeral parlors, public- interest facilities for storing ashes, and cemeteries.",""],[1,"184","2","Professional Social Work and Charity Development","We will give strong support to the development of professional social work and charity.",""],[1,"184","2","Regular Social Donation Mechanism","We will improve mechanisms for regular social donations.",""],[1,"184","2","NGO Social Relief and Volunteer Mobilization","We will mobilize nongovernmental actors to provide social relief, mutual aid, and volunteer services.",""],[1,"185","1","Family Planning Incentives and Assistance Scheme","We will improve the systems of awards, assistance, and special help to rural households who have followed the family planning policy, and give more care and help to households who have lost their only child.",""],[1,"185","1","Family Development Promotion Initiative","We will ensure importance is given to family development.",""],[1,"187","2","Disability Welfare and Support Program Development","We will support the development of programs for persons with disabilities, establish and improve basic welfare systems for them, and see that their basic needs are met.",""],[1,"187","2","Medical Expense Reimbursement for Persons with Severe Disabilities","We will improve the reimbursement system for the medical expenses of persons with severe disabilities.",""],[1,"187","2","Disability Rehabilitation and Care Facility Expansion","We will improve rehabilitation and care facilities for persons with disabilities and encourage nongovernmental entities to provide services for them.",""],[1,"187","2","Key Rehabilitation Programs for Young Children with Disabilities","We will implement key rehabilitation programs such as rehabilitation programs for children six years of age or younger who",""],[1,"188","1","Basic Assistive Devices Provision Program for Persons with Disabilities in Poverty","provision programs for basic assistive devices for persons with disabilities living in poverty.",""],[1,"188","3","Special Care for Left-Behind Rural Children","Provide special care for left-behind children in rural areas;",""],[1,"188","4","Child Welfare and Minor Protection Facilities Improvement","Improve facilities for child welfare and the protection of minors;",""],[1,"188","5","Expansion of Home for Children Centers","Work to see Home for Children centers cover at least 90% of urban and rural communities;",""],[1,"188","10","Living Allowances for Persons with Disabilities Program","Fully implement the program for providing living allowances for persons with disabilities who are in need and the program for granting nursing care subsidies to persons with severe disabilities;",""],[1,"188","11","Assistive Devices and Accessibility Subsidy Scheme","Ensure localities where conditions permit offer subsidies for the allocation of basic assistive devices for people with disabilities living in poverty and for accessibility renovations for poor households which have one or more family members with disabilities;",""],[1,"188","12","Support for Day-Care and Professional Care Services for Persons with Disabilities","Support day-care institutions and professional care service institutions in providing nursing services for persons with disabilities;",""],[1,"188","13","Basic Rehabilitation Services for Persons with Disabilities","Implement key rehabilitation programs and offer basic rehabilitation services to people with disabilities living in poverty and to persons with severe disabilities.",""]],"35":[[1,"16","3","Poverty Alleviation and Rural Poverty Exit Initiative","All rural residents falling below China's current poverty line will be able to lift themselves out of poverty, all poor counties will be able to rid themselves of poverty, and poverty alleviation will be achieved in all regions.",""],[1,"155","1","Targeted Poverty Reduction Strategy","we will implement the fundamental strategy of targeted poverty reduction, develop new mechanisms and models for poverty alleviation, adopt unconventional measures, and step up our efforts to ensure success in the battle against poverty.",""],[1,"155","2","Improve Poverty Reduction Assistance Programs","we will work to see that assistance programs become more effective so that people living in poverty in rural areas have adequate food and clothing and are able to access compulsory education, basic medical care, and safe housing.",""],[1,"155","3","Targeted Poverty Alleviation Measures","We will adopt categorized, targeted poverty alleviation measures that are focused on addressing the causes of poverty and providing the support needed to ensure its alleviation.",""],[1,"155","3","Integrated Support for Economically Disadvantaged People","We will support approximately 50 million people, who have registered as being economically disadvantaged, in lifting themselves out of poverty by ensuring that they can, among other things, develop businesses based on local strengths, find alternative employment, relocate, claim subsidies for ecosystem conservation, and gain access to educational and training programs, medical insurance, and assistance for medical treatment.",""],[1,"155","3","Social Security Support for People Unable to Work","We will ensure that other poor populations-those who have partially or completely lost the capacity to work-have their basic living needs met through social security policies.",""],[1,"155","3","Asset-Based Poverty Support Mechanism","We will explore a system for supporting those living in poverty by helping them realize returns on asset investments, ensuring they gain a greater share of returns through land trusts, through the transfer of poverty alleviation funds into shares of equivalent value in rural cooperatives and enterprises, and through",""],[1,"156","1","Land-Use Rights for Equity in Rural Cooperatives and Enterprises","the granting of shares in rural cooperatives and enterprises in exchange for the contribution of land-use rights.",""],[1,"156","2","National Poverty Registration and Dynamic Monitoring System","We will identify and register those living in poverty throughout the country.",""],[1,"156","2","Household Poverty Assessment Mechanism","We will put in place a household assessment mechanism for poverty alleviation, and formulate strict, well-defined, and transparent standards, procedures, and review measures to allow for the withdrawal of counties that have eradicated poverty from assistance programs.",""],[1,"156","2","Poverty Reduction Oversight and Evaluation Mechanism","We will establish mechanisms for public oversight over poverty reduction performance, conduct public satisfaction surveys on poverty reduction efforts in poor areas, and put in place mechanisms for tracking and auditing how poverty reduction policies are implemented and for third party poverty reduction performance evaluation.",""],[1,"156","3","Targeted Poverty Reduction Investment in Poor Areas","we will focus our efforts on old revolutionary bases, areas with concentrations of ethnic minorities, border areas, and contiguous poor areas; continue to increase investment in poverty reduction in contiguous areas with acute difficulties; strengthen the ability of poor areas to tap into their development potential",""],[1,"156","3","Rural Income and Basic Public Services Improvement","ensure that the per capita disposable income of farmers in these areas increases faster than the national average and that indicators for the main types of basic public services there approach national averages",""],[1,"157","3","Poverty Reduction Policy Support and Evaluation Mechanisms","We will improve policy support for poverty reduction, build sound mechanisms, and develop new models as well as corresponding evaluation systems",""],[1,"158","1","Poverty Reduction Financing Mobilization Mechanism","We will work to increase the amount that governments at central and provincial levels spend on poverty reduction, ensure complementarity between policy-backed financing, development financing, commercial financing, and cooperative financing, bring together all available resources for poverty reduction, and open up new sources of funding.",""],[1,"158","1","Land Quota Support for Poverty Reduction","We will give preference to meeting land-use needs related to development- based poverty reduction, setting annual quotas for increases in land designated for construction in poor counties.",""],[1,"158","1","Land Regulation Support for Poor Areas","We will step up support for land regulation in poor areas, allowing poor counties to use their quotas for land designated for urban and rural construction purposes anywhere within the scope of their respective provincial jurisdictions.",""],[1,"158","1","Collective Equity Compensation Trials for Resource Development","In poor areas where collective land is used for developing hydropower or extracting mineral resources, we will carry out trials to compensate local residents by offering collective equity stakes.",""],[1,"158","1","Benefit-Sharing Mechanism for Resource Development","We will improve the benefit-sharing mechanisms for resource development, so as to enable poor areas to acquire a greater share in the benefits therein.",""],[1,"158","1","Science and Technology Poverty Reduction Initiative","We will increase efforts to reduce poverty through science and technology.",""],[1,"158","1","Talent Support and Local Personnel Training for Poor Areas","We will provide talent support for poor areas and assist in the training of local personnel.",""],[1,"158","2","Poverty Reduction Collaboration Mechanisms","We will improve the mechanisms for poverty reduction collaboration between the eastern and western regions and the mechanisms for Party and government offices, the military, people's organizations, and SOEs to help lift designated poor areas out of poverty.",""],[1,"158","2","Inclusive Poverty Reduction Participation Support","We will encourage and support the participation of private enterprises, social organizations, and individuals in development-based poverty reduction, and guide social actors to shift the focus of their poverty reduction efforts to villages or households so as to effectively combine social resources with targeted government measures.",""],[1,"158","2","Poverty Reduction Financing and Volunteer Support","We will develop new models of participation, support the establishment of industry investment funds and public interest trust funds, encourage volunteers to take part in poverty reduction efforts, and ensure that social workers are serving poor areas.",""],[1,"158","2","Poverty Reduction Branding Initiative","We will work hard to see that brands well- known for poverty reduction are created.",""],[1,"159","1","Poverty Reduction Planning, Performance Evaluation, and Accountability System","We will further improve mechanisms by which the central government undertakes overall planning, governments of provinces, autonomous regions, and municipalities directly under the central government take overall responsibility, and municipal (prefectural) and county governments ensure implementation.",""],[1,"159","1","Poverty-Alleviation Performance Evaluation for Officials","We will strengthen poverty-alleviation performance evaluation for officials, fully implementing the measures for performance evaluation of development-based poverty reduction efforts, and giving high priority in government performance assessments in poor counties to measuring the effectiveness of poverty alleviation.",""],[1,"159","1","Poverty Reduction Oversight and Accountability System","We will establish a system for overseeing poverty reduction efforts, and strengthen corresponding accountability.",""],[1,"160","15","Policy-Based Financial Bonds and Special Bonds for Poverty Reduction Funding","Issue policy-based financial bonds and special bonds to ensure funding for development-based poverty reduction efforts;",""],[1,"160","16","Poverty Reduction Relending Facility","Introduce poverty reduction related relending to guide financial",""],[1,"161","2","Subsidized Microcredit for Economically Disadvantaged Households","Grant microcredit to those who have been registered as being economically disadvantaged, with no requirement for collateral or guarantee and with government- subsidized interest payments;",""],[1,"161","3","Insurance Service Network Development","Build sound insurance service networks;",""],[1,"161","4","Financing Assurance and Risk Compensation Mechanisms","Improve financing assurance and risk compensation mechanisms.",""]],"36":[[1,"5","4","Social Security Reform","Carry Out Social Security Reform",""]],"38":[[1,"136","1","Grassland Treatment and Rehabilitation Measures","Take steps to treat poisonous or harmful grasses, barren patches of grassland, and cultivated grassland in the margins between agricultural land and grazing land.",""],[1,"136","2","Integrated Soil Erosion Prevention and Control Programme","Take integrated steps to prevent and control soil erosion in the northern desertification-prevention belt, the Loess Plateau area, the chernozem soil region in the northeast, the karst areas in the southwest, and other regions where it presents a problem;",""],[1,"136","3","Terraced Farmland Improvement and Gully Erosion Control","Intensify efforts to improve terraced farmland, treat gully erosion, and ensure that small watersheds are ecologically clean;",""],[1,"136","4","Soil Erosion Control Programme","Treat soil erosion on an additional 270,000 square kilometers of land.",""],[1,"136","5","Natural Wetlands Protection Strengthening","Strengthen protection of natural wetlands on the middle and upper reaches of the Yangtze, along the Yellow River, and in the Caohai Lake area in Guizhou;",""],[1,"136","6","Wetland Restoration and Biodiversity Improvement Measures","Take integrated steps to improve the environment of wetlands with degraded ecological functions and low levels of biodiversity;",""],[1,"136","7","Sustainable Wetland Utilization Demonstration Projects","Carry out demonstrations of sustainable wetland utilization;",""],[1,"136","9","Habitat Protection for Rare and Endangered Species","Protect and improve the habitats of pandas, crested ibises, tigers, leopards, Asian elephants, and other rare and endangered animal species;",""],[1,"136","10","Rescue and Breeding Centers and Gene Banks","Establish rescue and breeding centers and gene banks;",""],[1,"136","11","Wildlife Rescue, Rehabilitation, and Release Programme","Carry out wildlife rescue, rehabilitation, and release;",""],[1,"136","12","Rare and Endangered Plant Habitat Rescue and Restoration","Strengthen efforts to rescue and restore the habitats of rare and endangered plants such as orchids as well as wild plant species with extremely small populations.",""],[1,"138","3","Ecological Restoration Compensation Mechanisms","We will accelerate the establishment of diverse compensation mechanisms for ecological restoration and conservation efforts, and improve the mechanism linking fund allocation to ecological protection performance.",""]],"40":[[1,"138","2","Ecological Risk Prevention and Emergency Response Capacity Building","We will build up institutions for ecological progress, establish sound systems for ecological risk prevention and control, and improve capabilities to respond to ecological and environmental emergencies in order to keep China ecologically secure.",""],[1,"139","2","National Ecological Security Monitoring and Early Warning System","We will establish a sound national dynamic monitoring and early- warning system for ecological security and conduct regular comprehensive surveys and assessments of ecological risks.",""],[1,"139","2","Ecological and Environmental Emergency Coordination Network","We will improve the coordination network for national, provincial, municipal, and county responses to ecological and environmental emergencies, and refine information reporting and release mechanisms for such emergencies.",""],[1,"139","2","Environmental Damage Compensation and Pollution Liability Insurance","We will become stricter in relation to compensation for environmental damage and require industries that pose a high risk to the environment to carry liability insurance for environmental pollution.",""]],"41":[[1,"101","1","Environmentally Friendly Towns and Rural Living Environment Improvement","We will develop exemplary environmentally friendly towns and villages, take comprehensive measures to improve rural living environments, redouble efforts to protect traditional villages, houses, and towns and villages with unique ethnic features, ensure rural civility is passed on to new generations, and build a charming, unspoiled, and harmonious countryside that is a beautiful and pleasant place to live.",""],[1,"103","5","Rural Dilapidated Housing Renovation Program","Make progress in the renovation of rural dilapidated housing, coordinate earthquake-resistant renovation efforts for rural housing, and basically complete renovation work on existing dilapidated houses;",""],[1,"103","6","Rural Lavatory Overhaul Programme","Undertake a complete overhaul of rural lavatories taking local conditions into account;",""],[1,"103","7","Household Refuse Treatment and Rural Environmental Improvement Project","Implement the household refuse treatment project, make comprehensive improvements to the environment in 130,000 administrative villages, implement showcase projects for agricultural waste recycling, develop sewage and refuse collection and treatment facilities, progressively promote the treatment of household wastewater, and ensure that the household refuse of 90% of administrative villages is treated;",""]],"42":[[1,"17","3","Chinese-Style Modern Military System Development","We will improve the Chinese-style modern military system and further institutionalize Party building.",""],[1,"213","2","Military Modernization and Reform Strategy","we will implement the strategy for the military under the new conditions and the reform strategy for strengthening the armed forces",""],[1,"213","2","Party Building and Political Development in the Armed Forces","We will strengthen Party building as well as political development in the armed forces",""],[1,"213","2","Military Political Work and Cadre Training Programme","put into practice the guiding principles from the military's meeting on political work held in Gutian, Fujian, and train a new generation of revolutionary officers and soldiers who are dedicated, competent, courageous, and have a strong moral character",""],[1,"213","2","Military Rule of Law and Legislative Reform","We will step up efforts to govern the armed forces in accordance with the law and strict discipline, and accelerate legislative work related to the military, so as to put in place a system of military laws and regulations that are compatible with current circumstances and tasks and with the new leadership and command systems",""],[1,"213","2","Combat Preparedness and Strategic Planning Enhancement","We will strengthen combat preparedness in all areas for all situations, ensure that military endeavors are guided by the needs of combat situations, improve the strategic arrangement of the military, and ensure active management and planning in major security fields",""],[1,"213","2","Defense Capability, Technology, Logistics, and Joint Combat Development","We will develop new combat capabilities, strengthen the development of defense-related science and technology, equipment, and modern logistics, carry out combat training, and strengthen network information system-based joint combat capabilities of the military",""],[1,"214","1","Defense and Armed Forces Modernization Reform","We will basically complete the reform objectives for defense and the armed forces, basically accomplish military mechanization, and make major strides in the adoption of information technology in the military, thereby building Chinese-style modern armed forces that are capable of successfully engaging in information technology-based warfare and effectively accomplishing their missions.",""],[1,"214","1","International Military Exchange and Peacekeeping Participation","We will strengthen international military-related exchange and cooperation and take an active role in international peacekeeping missions.",""]],"43":[[1,"213","1","Integrated Military-Civilian Development Strategy","we will stress both development and national security, strive to build both a prosperous country and a strong military, and move forward with the integrated military-civilian development strategy",""],[1,"214","2","Military-Civilian Integration Governance and Coordination Mechanism","We will improve systems and mechanisms for integrating military and civilian development as well as the systems concerning organizational management, work, and policy.",""],[1,"214","2","National and Subnational Military-Civilian Integration Leading Bodies","We will establish a national leading body for integrating military and civilian development and similar bodies for provinces, autonomous regions, and municipalities directly under the central government.",""],[1,"214","2","Military-Civilian Integration Legislation","We will advance legislation related to the integration of military and civilian development.",""],[1,"214","2","Military-Local Resource Sharing and Coordination Framework","We will ensure a better allocation and appropriate sharing of resources between the military and localities so that both peacetime and wartime needs can be met; encourage flow of factors such as technology, personnel, capital, and information between the economic and defense sectors; and strengthen coordinated development between the military and localities in the areas of infrastructure, industries, science, technology, education, and public services.",""],[1,"214","2","Military-Civilian Integration Project Financing Mechanism","We will explore the establishment of a mechanism for funding integrated military-civilian development projects.",""],[1,"214","2","Defense-Related Science and Technology Institutional Reform","We will deepen institutional reform of defense-related science and technology industries, put in place an initiative to strengthen the foundations of these industries, and establish mechanisms for achieving collaborative innovation in defense-related science and technology.",""],[1,"214","2","Defense Research, Production, and Procurement Reform","We will reform systems and mechanisms concerning defense-related research, production, and weapons and equipment procurement, move faster in opening military industries to competition and promoting the application of defense-related scientific and technological advances, and guide private businesses with a competitive advantage in entering the fields of research and development, production, and maintenance of military products.",""],[1,"214","2","Military-Civilian Common Standards Development","We will accelerate the development of standards that apply to both the military and civilian sectors.",""],[1,"214","2","Integrated Military-Civilian Development Projects","We will implement integrated military- civilian development projects, including ocean, space, and cyberspace projects and",""],[1,"215","1","Military-Civilian Innovation Demonstration Zones","the development of innovation demonstration zones for military-civilian integration",""],[1,"215","1","Military-Civilian Technology and Infrastructure Coordination Mechanism","the strengthening of coordination between the military and civilian sectors in the sharing of advanced technologies, industries, products, and infrastructure",""]],"44":[[1,"3","30","National Big Data Strategy","Implement the National Big Data Strategy",""],[1,"70","2","National Cyber Development Strategy Implementation","implement the national cyber development strategy",""],[1,"70","2","Digital Technology Development Acceleration","accelerate the development of digital technology",""],[1,"70","2","Information Technology Integration into Economic and Social Development","deepen the integration of information technology into economic and social development",""],[1,"70","2","Information Economy Expansion","accelerate the expansion of the information economy",""],[1,"70","3","Next-Generation Information Infrastructure Construction","We will accelerate the construction of high-speed, mobile, secure, and ubiquitous next generation information infrastructure and spread the use of information network technology",""],[1,"71","1","Backbone Communications Network and Fiber Optic Broadband Expansion","We will establish backbone networks for modern communications and strengthen capabilities with respect to high-speed transmission, flexible scheduling, and intelligent adapters.",""],[1,"71","1","International Communications Infrastructure and Digital Silk Road Development","We will establish open international communications facilities, refine the distribution of international communication networks, and improve cross-border land and submarine cable infrastructure.",""],[1,"71","2","High-Speed Broadband and 4G Network Expansion","We will intensify efforts to spread the availability of high-speed wireless broadband.",""],[1,"71","2","Internet Extension to Remote and Isolated Areas","We will accelerate the extension of internet networks to remote mountainous areas, pastoral areas, and island reefs.",""],[1,"71","2","Spectrum Resource Management and Satellite Frequency Planning","We will improve the allocation of the country's spectrum resources, strengthen management over the radio-frequency spectrum, and safeguard security and order with respect to radio waves.",""],[1,"72","2","5G Technology Research and Commercialization Programme","We will drive forward research in key technologies for 5G mobile networks and ultra-wideband applications, and develop commercial applications of 5G technology.",""],[1,"72","2","Next-Generation Internet and IPv6 Upgrade Plan","We will adopt a forward-thinking approach in planning for the next generation internet and move to upgrade to IPv6 across the board.",""],[1,"72","3","Telecommunications Market Opening and Broadband Infrastructure Sharing","We will open up competitive areas in basic telecommunication fields to private capital so that infrastructure can be jointly developed and shared among diverse forms of market entities and services are better able to compete with each other.",""],[1,"72","3","Integrated Telecommunications, Radio, Television, and Internet Service Delivery","We will step up efforts to offer telecommunications, radio and television, and internet services over a single broadband connection.",""],[1,"72","3","Universal Telecommunications Service Strengthening","We will strengthen universal service responsibilities and improve mechanisms toward this end.",""],[1,"72","3","Broadband Speed and Internet Pricing Reform","We will boost broadband speeds, lower rates for internet service, simplify the structure of charges for telecommunications services, and make telecommunications services more cost-effective.",""],[1,"72","3","Internet Architecture and Billing Standards Upgrade","We will improve the internet architecture, access technologies, and billing standards.",""],[1,"72","3","Internet Pricing Oversight Mechanism","We will strengthen oversight over internet pricing practices.",""],[1,"77","4","High-Speed Optical Telecommunications System","Establish a high-speed, high-capacity optical telecommunications system;",""],[1,"77","5","Rural Broadband Connectivity Expansion Projects","Implement projects to extend broadband connectivity to rural villages",""],[1,"77","6","Basic Network Infrastructure Improvement in Small and Medium Cities","improve basic network infrastructure in small and medium cities in the central and western regions;",""],[1,"77","7","International Internet Bandwidth Expansion","Expand international internet bandwidth capacity;",""],[1,"77","8","4G and Evolutionary Technology Development Plan","Plan for the development of 4G and subsequent evolutionary technologies;",""],[1,"77","9","4G Network Coverage Expansion","Extend full 4G coverage to regions where it is needed.",""],[1,"77","11","Internet Infrastructure and Service Platform Development","Develop infrastructure and service platforms for uses of the Internet of",""]],"45":[[1,"72","2","Cyber Framework and Cybersecurity Systems Planning","We will formulate plans for future cyber frameworks, cyber technology systems, and cybersecurity systems.",""],[1,"75","2","National Cybersecurity and Information Security Strengthening","We will work to see that cybersecurity is developed in tandem with information technology, systems safeguarding national cybersecurity are improved, the protection of important information systems and data resources is strengthened, and network governance capacity improves in order to ensure national information security.",""],[1,"75","3","Big Data Security Management System","We will establish a big data security management system that uses categorization and multilevel management in order to safeguard the security, effectiveness, and reliability of data use.",""],[1,"76","1","Personal Data Protection Enforcement","We will strengthen personal data protection and crack down on the unlawful release or sale of such information.",""],[1,"76","2","Cyberspace Governance and Internet Security Reform","We will improve cyberspace governance to create a safe and civil online environment.",""],[1,"76","3","Key Information Infrastructure Protection System","We will establish a system for protecting key information infrastructure and improve the design, development, and operational oversight mechanisms of important information systems affecting national security.",""],[1,"76","3","Information Security Technology Breakthrough Initiative","We will focus our resources on making breakthroughs in key technologies for information management, information protection, security reviews, and foundational support in order to raise China's information security capacity.",""],[1,"76","3","Core Technology Threat Detection and Continuous Defense Capacity Building","We will strengthen the development of threat perception capabilities and continuous defense capabilities for core technological equipment in key information infrastructure.",""],[1,"76","3","Hierarchical Protection System for Important Information Systems","We will improve hierarchical protection systems for important information systems.",""],[1,"76","3","Security Mechanism Improvement for Information Systems","We will improve security mechanisms managed both horizontally",""],[1,"77","1","Information Security Industry Development","We will actively develop the information security industry.",""],[1,"78","8","National Information Security Project","Implement the national information security project;",""],[1,"78","9","Information Infrastructure Security Enhancement","Become better able to ensure security for key information infrastructure, important information systems, and classified information systems, and use them to better support industrial development;",""],[1,"78","10","National Cyberspace Security Science and Technology Projects","Implement national science and technology projects for ensuring cyberspace security;",""],[1,"78","12","National Cyberspace Security System","Establish a national system for cyberspace security and security technology.",""]],"46":[[1,"74","2","Big Data Development and Application Plan","We will make big data a fundamental strategic resource and fully implement a plan for its development, accelerating the opening, sharing, development, and application of data resources so as to help transform and upgrade industries and bring about innovations in social governance.",""],[1,"74","3","Government Big Data Integration and Sharing Platform Development","We will promote the efficient collection and integration of big data in all key areas and deepen correlation analysis and integrated utilization of government and social data so as to increase the precision and effectiveness of macroeconomic regulation, market supervision, social governance, and public services.",""],[1,"74","3","Interdepartmental Government Data Sharing Platform","We will accelerate efforts to facilitate inter-departmental sharing and use of data resources through unified platforms for sharing and exchanging government data.",""],[1,"74","3","Open National Government Data Platform","We will ensure that government information systems and public data are interconnected, open, and shared by moving faster to establish an open national platform for government data.",""],[1,"74","3","Government Data Release and Sharing Catalogue","We will create a government data release and sharing catalogue and publically release data resources in accordance with the law.",""],[1,"74","3","National Big Data Infrastructure Planning","We will conduct overall planning for the development of infrastructure such as national big data platforms and data centers.",""],[1,"74","3","Data Sharing and Protection Legal Framework Development","We will conduct research on the formulation of data sharing and protection laws and regulations and introduce regulations for the management of government information resources.",""],[1,"75","1","Big Data Industry Development and Integration Initiative","We will work to see the innovative application of big data in all industries, explore new forms and models of collaborative development between big data industries and traditional industries, and move faster to improve big data industrial chains.",""],[1,"75","1","Big Data Technology Breakthrough Programme","We will accelerate efforts to tackle key technological issues in fields such as massive data collection, storage, redaction, analysis, visualization, and privacy protection.",""],[1,"75","1","Big Data Hardware and Software Development Support","We will promote the development of big data hardware and software products.",""],[1,"75","1","Big Data Public Service Support and Standards System","We will improve public service support systems and ecosystems for big data industries and strengthen relevant standards and quality requirements.",""],[1,"77","27","Unified Open Big Data Platform","Establish a unified open platform for big data;",""],[1,"77","28","Public Data Release Initiative","Progressively release public datasets;",""],[1,"77","29","Data Analysis and Utilization Promotion","Encourage enterprises and the general public to analyze and utilize data;",""],[1,"77","30","Big Data Innovation in Government Services","Promote the innovative use of big data in fields such as government",""],[1,"77","32","Comprehensive Big Data Experimental Zones Development","Promote the development of comprehensive big data experimental zones",""],[1,"78","2","National Unified E-Government Network Development and Utilization","Accelerate the development and utilization of a national unified e- government network;",""],[1,"78","3","Platform Improvement for Regulatory Oversight and Public Resource Trading","Improve platforms for approval oversight, credit information, public resources trading, information on the reporting of price violations, and others;",""],[1,"78","4","National Basic Information Resources Database Development and Utilization","Accelerate the development and utilization of a national database for basic information resources.",""]],"47":[[1,"41","1","Fiscal and Tax System Reform","We will deepen reforms to create sound and modern fiscal and tax systems, focusing on key issues including delineating the powers and spending obligations of the central and local governments, improving local taxation systems, strengthening local development capacity, and reducing burdens on enterprises.",""],[1,"41","2","Central-Local Fiscal Responsibility and Revenue Sharing Reform","We will create a system in which the powers of governments are commensurate with their respective spending obligations, and make appropriate adjustments to strengthen the powers and increase the spending obligations of the central government.",""],[1,"41","2","VAT Revenue Sharing Adjustment","In view of the tax system reform as well as the nature of different types of taxes, we will further adjust the distribution of revenue between the central and local governments and improve methods of sharing VAT revenue.",""],[1,"41","2","Central-to-Local Transfer Payment Reform","We will improve the system of transfer payments from the central to local governments, standardize the general transfer payment system, refine methods for allocating funds, and increase the transparency of transfer payments.",""],[1,"41","2","Provincial Financial Resource Allocation Improvement","We will improve the distribution of financial resources from the provincial level down.",""],[1,"41","3","Integrated Budget Coordination and Medium-Term Fiscal Planning Mechanism","We will put in place a sound mechanism to ensure that the compilation, execution, and oversight of budgets complement as well as constitute a check on each other.",""],[1,"43","1","Government Spending Optimization and Fiscal Sustainability Reform","We will optimize the government spending mix, revise unsustainable spending policies, adjust expenditures which are ineffectual or inefficient, and recover duplicate or misallocated expenditures.",""],[1,"43","1","Treasury and Transfer Payment Fund Linkage Mechanism","We will link the management of treasury funds with the allocation of transfer payment funds.",""],[1,"43","1","Public-Private Provision of Public Goods","we will develop new forms of government spending, guide the involvement of private capital in the provision of public goods, keep government spending at a reasonable level, and ensure government deficits and debt are kept within a manageable range.",""]],"49":[[1,"180","15","Primary Income Distribution and Income Redistribution Reform","We will improve primary income distribution, intensify efforts to regulate income redistribution, adjust and optimize the pattern of national income distribution, and work to bridge income gaps throughout the whole of society.",""],[1,"181","1","Wage Determination and Income Distribution Reform","We will improve the mechanisms allowing the market to evaluate factor contribution and base distribution on contribution.",""],[1,"181","2","Income Gap Reduction and Tax Reform Package","We will implement policies aimed at bridging income gaps, work to secure a significant increase in the earnings of low-income earners, and increase the proportion of middle-income earners.",""],[1,"181","2","Personal Income Tax System Establishment","We will accelerate the establishment of a personal income tax system based on both adjusted gross income and specific types of income.",""],[1,"181","2","Luxury Consumption Excise Tax Expansion","We will bring certain luxury consumer items and high-expenditure activities under the scope of excise tax.",""],[1,"181","2","Tax Incentives for Social Giving","We will improve tax policies which encourage giving back to society and helping to alleviate poverty.",""],[1,"181","2","Public Wellbeing Budget Allocation Increase","We will increase budgetary allocations for improving people's wellbeing, ensure that more of the earnings from the transfer of public resources go toward improving wellbeing, and gradually raise the proportion of revenue from state capital that is turned over to public finance.",""],[1,"182","1","Income Regulation and Asset Information System","We will fully put in place non-cash payment systems, establish a sound system of information on the income and property of natural persons, and improve income statistics, surveying, and monitoring systems.",""]],"50":[[1,"14","5","Socialist Rule of Law System Development","work faster to establish a Chinese-style socialist rule of law system; build a socialist rule of law country; make progress in ensuring that a well-conceived approach is applied to developing legislation, the law is strictly enforced, justice is administered impartially, and everyone abides by the law; and move more quickly to build a rule of law economy and a rule of law society, bringing economic and social development in line with the rule of law.",""],[1,"16","4","Societal Rule of Law Awareness Campaign","Awareness of the rule of law will continue to be strengthened throughout society.",""],[1,"17","3","Rule of Law Government Establishment","We will improve people's democracy, basically complete the establishment of a rule of law government, and achieve a marked improvement in the credibility of the judiciary.",""],[1,"208","3","Socialist Rule of Law Country Construction","We will ensure the unity of leadership by the Party, the position of the people as masters of the country, and law-based governance, accelerate efforts to build a socialist rule of law country, and advance socialist political progress.",""],[1,"209","2","Rule of Law Governance System Development","We will ensure that the country is governed, governance is exercised, and administration is conducted in accordance with the law, and that our country, government, and society are all based on the rule of law, developing a rule of law system of socialism with Chinese characteristics and the rule of law in socialist China.",""],[1,"210","1","Legislative Process and Lawmaking Reform","ensure that people's congresses better organize and coordinate legislative work; refine mechanisms for drafting, debating, coordinating, and deliberating on legislation; and improve channels and methods through which legislative bodies lead legislation while other sectors of society also participate in a systematic way.",""],[1,"210","1","Accelerated Legislative Development in Key Areas","We will work faster to see that a complete system of laws and regulations takes shape by speeding up legislation in key areas, working at once to enact, revise, abolish, and interpret laws, and improving laws for the socialist market economy and social governance.",""],[1,"210","2","Rule-of-Law Government Implementation Plan","We will implement, both to the letter and in spirit, the Plan for Building Rule of Law Government (2015-2020) released by the CPC Central Committee and the State Council, thoroughly advance law-based administration, and ensure that power is defined, exercised, held in check, and overseen in accordance with the law and that all government activities are in line with the rule of law.",""],[1,"210","2","Administrative Legislation and Procedure Reform","We will see that government functions are fully carried out in accordance with the law, improve legislation on administrative organization and procedures, and define governmental institutions, functions, powers, procedures, and responsibilities by law.",""],[1,"210","2","Government Decision-Making Mechanism Reform","We will refine procedures for making government decisions and improve law- based decision-making mechanisms.",""],[1,"210","2","Administrative Law Enforcement Reform","We will deepen the structural reform of administrative law enforcement, advance coordinated law enforcement, and better coordinate administrative law enforcement with the administration of criminal justice.",""],[1,"210","2","Law Enforcement Standards and Assessment System","We will ensure that law is enforced in a strict, procedure- based, impartial, and civil manner, and narrow the scope of discretionary powers to the greatest extent possible.",""],[1,"210","2","Law Enforcement Assessment and Evaluation System","We will improve law enforcement assessment and evaluation systems.",""],[1,"210","2","Independent Audit Oversight Reform","We will improve the auditing system and make sure that auditing-based oversight is exercised independently in accordance with the law.",""],[1,"211","1","Judicial Structural Reform and Oversight Strengthening","We will deepen judicial structural reform, provide better judicial protection of rights, and ensure stronger judicial oversight over authority, so as to build a more just, efficient, and authoritative socialist judiciary.",""],[1,"211","1","Judicial Power Division and Case Jurisdiction Reform","We will improve the mechanism under which judicial power and responsibilities are divided among judicial bodies that both complement and place a check on each other, and refine the trial instance system, the judicial organization system, and the case jurisdiction system.",""],[1,"211","1","Cross-Administrative Jurisdiction Courts and Procuratorates","We will explore the establishment of people's courts and procuratorates with jurisdictions over multiple administrative divisions.",""],[1,"211","1","Judicial Occupational Safeguards and Independence Measures","We will strengthen occupational safeguards for judicial officers and improve systems for ensuring the law-based, independent, and impartial exercise of judicial and procuratorial powers.",""],[1,"211","1","Transparency and Human Rights Protection in Justice Institutions","We will take comprehensive measures to ensure transparency in court proceedings and in procuratorial, police, and prison affairs, and strengthen judicial protection of human rights.",""],[1,"211","1","Judicial Internal Oversight and Accountability Mechanisms","We will tighten oversight over judicial activities and ensure that judicial bodies build more robust mechanisms for internal oversight and power constraints.",""],[1,"211","1","Case Handling Accountability System Improvement","We will work to see that judicial bodies improve case handling accountability systems, ensuring that those in charge of a case take due responsibility.",""],[1,"211","1","Justice Sector Facilities Development Programme","We will improve facilities development in respect to prisons, mandatory drug treatment, community corrections, resettlement assistance for released inmates, forensic examinations, and other areas and programs.",""],[1,"211","2","Law-Based Governance and Rule of Law Promotion","We will advance law-based governance at all levels and in all fields and increase the level of rule of law in social governance.",""],[1,"211","2","Rule of Law Culture and Legal Awareness Campaign","We will strengthen efforts to foster a rule of law culture, advocate socialist rule of law, and strengthen the awareness of all members of society, especially public sector workers, of the need to respect, study, abide by, and apply the law, so that the rule of law permeates and takes root throughout the whole of society.",""],[1,"211","2","Public Legal Knowledge and Rule of Law Education Programme","We will intensify efforts to spread legal knowledge in accordance with the seventh five-year plan for increasing public knowledge of the law, incorporate education on the rule of law in the national education system, and improve the recording of citizens' and organizations' credit in terms of legal compliance.",""],[1,"211","2","Legal Services and Legal Aid Strengthening","We will ensure legal service systems are improved by strengthening the training of lawyers and other legal professionals as well as legal service personnel, promoting the development of public legal service systems covering all citizens, and improving the legal aid and judicial assistance systems.",""]],"51":[[1,"7","2","Macroeconomic Regulation Improvement and Development","we continued to improve and develop new methods of macroeconomic regulation",""],[1,"217","1","Government Responsibility Clarification and Policy Coordination","We will clearly define government responsibilities, ensure policies are well formulated and public resources are well allocated, and mobilize the energies of the whole society, so that everyone works together to promote the successful implementation of this plan.",""],[1,"217","2","National Development Planning System Coordination Framework","We will strengthen overall management and coordination, creating a development planning system headed by the plan for economic and social development, and supported by subject-specific, regional, local, and annual plans.",""],[1,"217","2","National Subject-Specific Plan Formulation","Relevant departments under the State Council shall organize the formulation of a set of national subject-specific plans-particularly key subject-specific plans-which set out in detail the implementation of the main tasks and targets of this plan.",""],[1,"217","2","Local Plan Alignment with National Development Plans","Local governments should, in their development plans, ensure that their development strategies, main targets, key tasks, and major projects are in coordination with those defined in the national plans and implement the unified arrangements provided for in these plans.",""],[1,"217","2","Development Plans Law Promulgation","We will work faster to see the promulgation of the Law on Development Plans.",""],[1,"217","3","Plan Implementation Coordination and Guidance Mechanism","All local governments and government departments must work hard to organize, coordinate, and guide the implementation of this plan.",""],[1,"217","3","Dynamic Monitoring and Evaluation System","We will carry out dynamic monitoring and evaluation of the implementation of this plan, use the results produced as an important basis for improving government work and measuring performance, and report the implementation of this plan to the Standing Committee of the National People's Congress in accordance with the law and willingly accept its oversight.",""],[1,"217","3","Implementation Accountability and Progress Management","Responsibility and requirements regarding progress must be made clear in order to ensure that the obligatory targets, projects, initiatives, policies, and reform measures specified in this plan are all carried out as scheduled.",""],[1,"217","3","Streamlined Approval Procedures for Plan Projects","Approval procedures related to the projects and initiatives included in this plan will be streamlined and priority will be",""],[1,"218","1","Implementation Oversight and Plan Adjustment Mechanism","We will ensure that auditing offices play a role in overseeing implementation.",""],[1,"218","2","Budget-Implementation Coordination and Fiscal Planning Reform","We will strengthen coordination between budgeting and the implementation of this plan, and having clearly defined the spending responsibilities of each level of government, we will ensure that budgeting at each level supports implementation.",""],[1,"218","2","Government Investment Legislation Acceleration","We will work faster on government investment legislation.",""],[1,"218","3","Public Mobilization for Plan Implementation","We will work to inspire within every Chinese person a sense of contribution to the implementation of this plan and to their country's development, stimulate the initiative, enthusiasm, and creativity of governments at all levels and of all sectors of society, respect the initiative of community-level organizations, and bring together the strength and wisdom of the people so that everyone contributes dynamically to the implementation of this plan and shares in the results thereof.",""]],"52":[[1,"17","3","Governance System Modernization and Institutional Reform","We will make major progress in modernizing China's governance system and capacity for governance, with frameworks for basic institutions being established in all areas.",""],[1,"39","2","Government Function Transformation and Administrative Streamlining Reform","We will accelerate the transformation of government functions, continue to streamline administration and delegate more powers, improve regulation, and provide better services, so as to refine government performance and stimulate market vitality and social creativity.",""],[1,"39","3","Government Powers and Obligations Management Reform","We will establish a sound management model based on catalogs of powers and obligations and a negative list, and delineate the boundaries between the powers and obligations of government, market, and society.",""],[1,"39","3","Government Review and Approval System Reform","We will deepen reform of the government review and approval system, reducing to the greatest possible extent government intervention in enterprises as well as the scope of the government pre- approval system.",""],[1,"39","3","Administration Streamlining and Power Delegation Coordination","We will strengthen targeting and coordination in streamlining administration and delegating powers.",""],[1,"39","3","Business System Reform and Service Simplification","We will deepen the reform of the business system and work to provide quick and convenient services.",""],[1,"40","3","Government Service Delivery Modernization","We will innovate the way government services are provided, ensuring that both government and public services are open, transparent, effective, convenient, fair, and easy-to-access.",""],[1,"40","3","Government Approval Standardization and Service Standards Reform","We will work faster to standardize government approval, and improve work processes and service standards for services provided directly to enterprises and the general public.",""],[1,"40","3","Inter-Agency Coordination Strengthening","We will strengthen coordination between government offices.",""],[1,"40","3","Internet Plus Government Services Expansion","We will popularize the use of the \"Internet +\" government services model and increase government transparency across the board.",""]],"53":[[1,"15","3","Comprehensive Party Self-Governance Strengthening","We need to implement the requirements related to comprehensively strengthening Party self-governance, continuously strengthen the Party's creativity, cohesiveness, and dynamism, and continuously improve its capacity for and performance in governance",""],[1,"212","1","Party Conduct and Anti-Corruption Enforcement Mechanism","We will implement the CPC Central Committee's eight-point decision on improving Party and government conduct, remain steadfast in the fight against formalism, bureaucratism, hedonism, and extravagance, and establish a sound, permanent mechanism for improving Party and government conduct.",""],[1,"212","1","Anti-Corruption Accountability and Discipline Inspection Measures","We will take resolute measures to punish and rectify improper conduct and corruption that harm people's interests, fight every phenomenon of corruption, and punish every corrupt official.",""],[1,"212","1","Anti-Corruption Consolidation and Deterrence Mechanism","We will also consolidate achievements made in anti-corruption campaigns, and establish effective mechanisms that deter, stop, and discourage officials from becoming corrupt.",""],[1,"212","2","Public Power Oversight and Accountability Reform","we will work to confine the exercise of power within an institutional cage, reinforce constraints and oversight over the exercise of power, and use institutional means to provide a check on power, to administer affairs, and to manage personnel.",""],[1,"212","2","Official Accountability and Audit Strengthening","We will clearly define the responsibilities and powers of officials, establish well-designed procedures and systems for accountability, and strengthen audits on the economic responsibilities of officials.",""],[1,"212","2","Government Power Supervision and Audit Oversight","We will improve checks on government powers and strengthen supervision and auditing- based oversight of departments with administrative powers.",""]],"54":[[1,"215","3","Improved Government Performance for Plan Implementation","we will, under the leadership of the CPC, ensure that governments at all levels better perform their duties and to the greatest possible extent stimulate the vitality and",""],[1,"216","2","Party Leadership and Governance Capacity Strengthening","We will see that the Party exercises overall leadership and coordinates all aspects of work and that Party committees and leading Party members' groups at all levels serve as the core leadership and exercise more effective leadership so as to provide a firm guarantee for the realization of this plan.",""],[1,"216","2","Party Self-Governance and Reform Innovation Initiative","We will uphold the principle of the Party exercising proper self- supervision and practicing strict self-governance, apply a spirit of reform and innovation in fully moving ahead with the new major Party building project, maintain and develop the advanced nature and purity of the Party, improve its governance capacity, and ensure that the Party always remains the strong core of leadership for socialism with Chinese characteristics.",""],[1,"216","2","Cadre Development and Performance Incentive System","We will strengthen the development of leading bodies and officials and improve performance assessment systems and reward and punishment mechanisms in order to mobilize the enthusiasm, initiative, and creativity of officials at all levels for their work.",""],[1,"216","2","Primary-Level Party Organization Strengthening","We will strengthen as a whole the functions of primary-level Party organizations, and give play to the leading role of these organizations and the exemplary role of Party members in order to lead the general public more effectively in building a moderately prosperous society in all respects.",""],[1,"216","3","Patriotic United Front and Social Consensus Building","We will attach importance to giving impetus to the role of trade unions, the organizations of the Chinese Communist Youth League, women's federations, and other people's organizations, consolidate and develop the broadest possible patriotic united front, fully implement the Party's policies on intellectuals, ethnic groups, religion, and work related to overseas Chinese, give full play to the roles of other political parties, chambers of commerce, and public figures without party affiliation, work to achieve the greatest possible popular consensus and combination of energies throughout society, promote reform and development, and safeguard social harmony and stability.",""]],"57":[[1,"209","1","People's Congress and Consultative Democracy System Improvement","We will continue our commitment to and improve the system of people's congresses, the system of multiparty cooperation and political consultation under the leadership of the CPC, the system of ethnic autonomous regions, and the system of community-level self-governance, so as to expand the systematic political participation of our citizens and give full expression to the strengths of China's socialist political system.",""],[1,"209","1","Consultative Democracy Framework Establishment","We will strengthen consultative democracy by establishing a well-structured and procedurally sound system of consultative democracy, continuing to improve consultation between political parties, and expanding consultation channels for organs of state power, CPPCC committees, political parties, community-level organizations, and social organizations.",""],[1,"209","1","Community-Level Democracy and Accountability Reform","We will improve systems for community-level democracy, further open democratic channels, and refine mechanisms for elections, deliberations, public access to information, performance reporting, and holding officials to account at the community level.",""],[1,"209","1","Community-Level Democratic Consultation Institutionalization","We will carry out diverse forms of community-level democratic consultation and work toward the institutionalization of community-level consultation.",""]],"58":[[1,"34","1","Economic Reform and Market-Government Balance Reform","Giving play to the leading role of economic reform, we will achieve a proper balance in the relationship between government and market, make breakthroughs in the reform of key areas, and create new systems and mechanisms conducive to guiding the new normal in economic development.",""],[1,"34","2","Public Sector Strengthening and Non-Public Sector Development Policy","We will remain dedicated to strengthening and developing the public sector of the economy while also encouraging, supporting, and guiding the development of the non-public sector.",""],[1,"34","3","State-Owned Enterprise Strengthening and Reform","We will remain firmly committed to ensuring that state-owned enterprises (SOEs) grow stronger, better, and bigger and work to see that a number of such enterprises develop their capacity for innovation and become internationally competitive, thereby injecting greater life into the state-owned sector, helping it exercise a greater level of influence and control over the economy, increasing its resilience against risk, and enabling it to contribute more effectively to accomplishing national strategic objectives.",""],[1,"34","3","Commercial and Public-Benefit SOE Governance Reform","The main aims of commercial SOEs will be to vitalize the state-owned sector, improve the efficacy of state capital, and maintain or increase the value of state-owned assets.",""],[1,"34","3","SOE Corporate and Shareholding System Reform","We will move faster to ensure that SOEs introduce corporate and shareholding systems and improve their",""],[1,"35","1","State-Owned Enterprise Governance and Incentive Reform","We will see that SOEs implement systems for employing management professionals and improve their differentiated salary systems and incentives for innovation.",""],[1,"35","1","SOE Social Function Divestment Reform","We will move more quickly to relieve SOEs of their traditional obligations to perform social functions and resolve other longstanding issues.",""],[1,"35","1","State Farm Reform and Development Programme","We will also channel energy into reforming and developing state farms on reclaimed land.",""],[1,"35","2","State Capital Oversight and Management Reform","We will tighten oversight over state-owned assets, focusing particularly on state capital, increase returns on state capital, and guard against the loss of state-owned assets.",""],[1,"35","2","State Capital Investment and Management Companies","We will establish state capital investment and management companies through reorganization, allocate and utilize state capital more efficiently, and create effective platforms for its flow, reorganization, and structural redistribution.",""],[1,"35","2","State Capital Allocation and Distribution Adjustment","We will improve mechanisms for ensuring the rational flow of state capital, make strategic adjustments to its distribution, and encourage more state capital investment in industries and sectors vital to national security and the economy.",""],[1,"35","2","State Asset Investor Regulatory Framework","We will establish lists of the regulatory powers and obligations of state-asset investors, make steady progress in bringing state- owned productive assets under unified oversight and supervision, and establish a budgetary management system for state capital operations across multiple levels covering all SOEs.",""],[1,"35","2","SOE State Capital and Leadership Audit Programme","Audits of all SOE state capital and of the performance of the economic responsibilities of all SOE leaders will be conducted.",""],[1,"35","3","Mixed Ownership Reform for State-Owned Enterprises","We will take steady steps in encouraging SOEs to develop mixed ownership and will begin the piloting and demonstration of reforms to introduce mixed ownership.",""],[1,"36","1","Mixed-Ownership Enterprise Development Policy","We will encourage the development of mixed-ownership enterprises in which the non-public sector holds a controlling share.",""],[1,"36","1","State Capital Participation in Non-State-Owned Enterprises","We will encourage diverse forms of state capital participation in non-state-owned enterprises.",""]],"59":[[1,"40","2","Market Oversight Modernization and Coordination Reform","We will formulate sound and effective rules, procedures, and standards for market oversight, better define responsibilities related to oversight, and promote oversight modernization.",""],[1,"40","2","Coordinated Law Enforcement and Oversight Using Big Data","We will innovate oversight mechanisms and methods, move forward with coordinated law enforcement and oversight using big data, and employ market, credit, and legal measures to coordinate oversight.",""],[1,"40","2","Random Inspection and Public Disclosure Oversight System","We will introduce, across the board, oversight based on inspections of randomly selected entities by randomly selected inspectors and the public release of results.",""],[1,"40","2","Strengthened Public Oversight","We will ensure that public oversight is strengthened.",""]],"60":[[1,"149","1","International Economic Governance Reform and Multilateral Trade System Support","We will help reform and improve the international economic governance system, actively guide the international economic agenda, safeguard and consolidate the multilateral trade system, work to see the international economic order develop in a way that facilitates equality, fairness, mutual benefit, and cooperation, and work with other countries to deal with global challenges.",""],[1,"149","2","Trade and Investment Liberalization and WTO Engagement","we will help promote the liberalization and facilitation of international trade and investment, and take a firm stance against all forms of trade protectionism.",""],[1,"149","2","Multilateral Trade Negotiation and Rules-Shaping Initiative","We will safeguard the status of the World Trade Organization as the main channel in international trade and investment, work for progress in multilateral trade negotiations, promote the balanced, mutually beneficial, and inclusive development of the multilateral trade system, and contribute to the development of international economic and trade rules that are just, reasonable, and transparent.",""],[1,"149","3","Free Trade Area Negotiation and Expansion Strategy","We will speed up efforts to implement the free trade area strategy, gradually establishing a network of high-standard free trade areas.",""],[1,"149","3","Belt and Road Free Trade Area Negotiations","We will actively engage in negotiations with countries and regions along the routes of the Belt and Road Initiative on the building of free trade areas;",""],[1,"149","3","Regional Trade Agreement Negotiation Acceleration","accelerate negotiations on regional comprehensive economic partnership agreements, the China-Gulf Cooperation Council Free Trade Area, and the China-Japan- RoK Free Trade Area;",""],[1,"150","1","Implementation of Free Trade Agreements and Trade Negotiations","We will ensure full implementation of our free trade agreements with the Republic of Korea and with Australia as well as the Protocol to Amend the Framework Agreement on Comprehensive Economic Cooperation between China and ASEAN.",""],[1,"150","2","Participation in Global Economic Governance Cooperation","We will actively participate in cooperation on global economic governance mechanisms, support the major platforms for global governance and those for regional cooperation in better playing their respective roles, and help make the global governance system more equal and sounder.",""],[1,"150","2","Support for Developing Countries in Global Economic Governance","We will support developing countries in participating in global economic governance on an equal footing and promote reform of the international monetary system and international financial regulation.",""],[1,"150","2","International Macroeconomic Policy Coordination","We will strengthen international coordination of macroeconomic policies and promote global economic equilibrium, financial security, and stable economic growth.",""],[1,"150","2","Participation in International Rule-Making and Standard Setting","We will take an active role in formulating international rules in areas such as the internet, the deep sea, the polar regions, and aerospace.",""],[1,"150","2","Successful G20 Summit Hosting","We will work to ensure a successful G20 Summit in Hangzhou.",""]],"61":[[1,"199","3","Modern Social Organization System Reform","We will improve social organization management and establish a modern social organization system in which the functions of government are clearly separated from those of social organizations, powers and responsibilities are clearly defined, and self- governance is exercised on the basis of law.",""],[1,"199","3","Social Organization Registration System Reform","We will reform the registration system, operating a system of registration by type.",""],[1,"199","3","Support for Social Organization Development","We will support the development of social organizations belonging to the following categories: industry associations and chambers",""],[1,"200","1","Decoupling Industry Associations and Chambers of Commerce from Government Bodies","We will move faster to uncouple industry associations and chambers of commerce from government bodies, and work to improve corporate governance.",""],[1,"200","1","Conversion of Eligible Public Institutions into Social Organizations","We will encourage public institutions that meet certain conditions to become social organizations, and help to see that social organizations take over functions transferred from the government.",""],[1,"200","1","Strengthened Oversight and Integrity Promotion Framework","We will strengthen comprehensive oversight, redouble our efforts to promote integrity, and see that self- regulation, external-regulation, and industry-wide regulation play a better role.",""],[1,"200","3","Public Participation and Oversight Mechanism Enhancement","We will, in accordance with the law, safeguard residents' rights to be informed, to participate, to make decisions, and to conduct oversight, and improve institutional channels for public participation in governance.",""],[1,"200","3","Public Consultation for Major Decisions","For major decisions related to key public interests, we will broadly solicit comments and suggestions from the public through residents meetings, discussions and deliberations, and democratic hearings.",""],[1,"200","3","Democratic Evaluation and Village Affairs Transparency Reform","We will strengthen public oversight and evaluation by improving democratic evaluations and the transparency of village and community affairs.",""],[1,"201","1","Interest Expression and Dispute Resolution Mechanism Improvement","We will improve mechanisms for interest expression and coordination and guide people in exercising their rights, expressing their concerns, and resolving disputes in accordance with the law.",""]],"62":[[1,"33","1","Investment Expansion and Optimization Programme","We will expand effective investment in response to effective demand, optimize supply structures, increase the return on investment, and see that investment plays a key role in sustaining growth and making structural adjustments.",""],[1,"33","1","Private and Corporate Investment Promotion Measures","We will see that the principal role of nongovernmental investment is given more effective impetus, help to create free, fair investment and business environments to encourage the private and corporate sectors to invest and stimulate private capital and unlock its potential.",""],[1,"33","1","Public Goods, Human Capital, and Supply Structure Investment","We will give full play to the leveraging role of government investment by increasing investment in public goods and services, investment in human capital, and investment in upgrading the supply structure, strengthening weak areas in the building of a moderately prosperous society, coordinating development between rural and urban areas and between different regions, and bolstering sustainable development.",""],[1,"33","1","Strategic Investment Programmes","We will launch investment programs that are of overall, strategic, and fundamental importance.",""],[1,"48","2","Enterprise Investment Project Approval Streamlining","We will further streamline investment approval procedures; reduce, combine, and regulate items required for development projects when applying for government approval; improve online platforms for reviewing, approving, and monitoring projects; and put in place a system to allow the different steps of the approval process for enterprise investment projects to be completed in tandem.",""],[1,"48","2","Market Opening and Public-Private Partnership Promotion","We will further lift market access restrictions on sectors such as infrastructure and public utilities, and use public- private partnership models such as franchise operations and government procurement of services to encourage the involvement of nongovernmental capital through investment, construction, and operations in these sectors.",""],[1,"48","2","Government and Industrial Investment Fund Mobilization","We will improve the way government funds are invested and ensure that national industrial investment funds play a better role in encouraging other types of investment.",""]],"63":[[1,"43","2","Financial Sector Reform and Modernization","We will improve financial institutions and market systems, promote the healthy development of capital markets, improve monetary policy mechanisms, deepen reform of the financial regulatory system, and refine our modern financial systems",""],[1,"43","3","Financial Institutions System Improvement","We will improve the system of financial institutions, ensuring an appropriate division of roles and complementarity between commercial, development, policy- backed, and cooperative financing.",""],[1,"43","3","Multilevel and Differentiated Banking Expansion","We will foster a system of multilevel and differentiated banking institutions that offers extensive coverage, expand the amount of private capital entering the banking sector, and develop inclusive finance and a variety of forms of micro, small, and medium financial organizations.",""],[1,"43","3","Internet-Based Financing Regulation","We will develop well- regulated internet-based financing.",""],[1,"43","3","Prudent Financial Institution Operations","We will promote the prudent development of comprehensive operations by financial institutions.",""],[1,"43","3","Private Financing Transparency and Microfinance Regulation","We will see that private financing becomes more transparent and regulate the development of microfinance and financing",""],[1,"44","1","Financial Institution Management and Service Quality Improvement","We will ensure that the quality of the management and services of financial institutions is improved.",""],[1,"44","2","Capital Market Development and Financial Infrastructure Reform","We will develop open, transparent, and sound capital markets, and increase the proportion of direct financing to reduce leverage ratios.",""],[1,"44","2","IPO Registration and Equity Market Reform","We will create the conditions for switching to a registration system for initial public offerings, develop a multilevel equity financing market, deepen reform of ChiNext and the New Third Board, ensure regional equity markets develop in line with regulations, and establish sound mechanisms for stocks to be delisted or transferred between market boards.",""],[1,"44","2","Bond Market Registration and Infrastructure Upgrade","We will improve the bond registration system and bond market infrastructure, and move faster to achieve connectivity between bond markets.",""],[1,"44","2","Financial Services and Product Innovation Support","We will develop financial services that meet the needs for innovation, encourage prudent bond product innovation, promote high-yield bonds and hybrid securities as methods of financing, and channel great energy into developing financial leasing services.",""],[1,"44","2","Interest Rate and Foreign Exchange Pricing Reform","We will improve mechanisms for determining interest rates and foreign exchange rates and make better use of the treasury yield curve as a benchmark for pricing.",""],[1,"44","2","Interbank and Derivatives Market Development","We will give impetus to the development of markets for interbank borrowing, repurchase agreements, negotiable instruments, foreign exchange, and gold.",""],[1,"44","2","Insurance and Reinsurance Market Expansion","We will move faster in developing the insurance and reinsurance markets and explore the possibility of establishing mechanisms for trading insurance assets.",""],[1,"44","2","National Treasury Project and Financial Infrastructure Security","We will establish secure and efficient financial infrastructure and implement the national treasury project.",""],[1,"45","4","Development of Multilevel Diversified Complementary Financial Markets","Establish multilevel, diversified, complementary financial markets to meet",""],[1,"45","6","Mixed Ownership Reform in Financial Institutions","Promote the switch to mixed ownership in financial institutions",""],[1,"45","8","Science and Technology Finance Development","Support the development of science and technology related finance, green",""],[1,"45","12","Interest Rate Liberalization","Improve on the extent to which interest rates are determined by the market",""],[1,"46","3","Big Data Credit Information System","Create a big data credit information system and a multilayered payment system.",""],[1,"46","3","Multilayered Payment System","Create a big data credit information system and a multilayered payment system.",""],[1,"46","5","Credit Guarantee and Default Enforcement Reform","Put an end to implicit guaranties and inflexible yields, and deal with credit violators in accordance with the law;",""]],"64":[[1,"16","2","Opening-Up and Global Resource Allocation Strategy","China will continue to be opened up more deeply and broadly to the outside world, and it will also continue to improve its ability to allocate resources globally.",""],[1,"17","3","Open Economy Institutional Framework Development","The new systems needed for an open economy will have basically taken shape.",""],[1,"21","2","Mutually Beneficial Opening-Up Strategy","we will pursue a mutually beneficial strategy of opening up",""]],"66":[[1,"78","13","Modern Infrastructure Network Upgrade","We will expand the space for infrastructure construction and move faster to improve modern infrastructure networks, making them safer and more efficient as well as smart, eco- friendly, and interconnected, thereby ensuring they better play their role in supporting and leading economic and social development.",""],[1,"79","1","Integrated Smart and Eco-Friendly Transportation Network Development","we will work to build a comprehensive transportation system that connects domestic and international transportation routes, extensively covers both urban and rural areas across regions, incorporates hubs with optimized functions, and provides integrated, efficient services.",""],[1,"79","2","Comprehensive Transportation Corridor Development","We will establish comprehensive transportation thoroughfares running from east to west and from north to south that ensure unobstructed and interconnected domestic and international transportation.",""],[1,"79","2","Xinjiang and Tibet Route Construction","We will step up construction on routes to and from Xinjiang and Tibet, and develop international transportation corridors starting from the northwestern, southwestern, and northeastern regions as well as transportation corridors along the Maritime Silk Road.",""],[1,"79","2","High-Speed Rail and Expressway Network Development","To develop high-quality express transportation networks, we will step up work to put in place a network of high-speed railways, improve the network of national expressways, build local expressways as appropriate, and strengthen the ability of hub airports and main and regional airports to fulfill their respective functions.",""],[1,"79","2","Basic Transportation Network Upgrading","To develop better, more extensive basic transportation networks, we will accelerate railway construction in the central and western regions; move forward with upgrading and renovating ordinary national and provincial highways as well as places where they are bottlenecked; ensure greater levels of expertise are used in the development of coastal and inland water transportation facilities; step up construction of rural roads and general purpose airports; and work to ensure regional interconnection of oil and gas pipelines.",""],[1,"79","2","Postal and Express Delivery Infrastructure Enhancement","We will also ensure better postal network services and strengthen the building of infrastructure for express delivery services.",""],[1,"80","2","Comprehensive Transportation Hub Development","we will develop comprehensive international transportation hubs in Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou, and other cities; improve the standards of national, regional, and local comprehensive transportation hubs; channel greater energy into building major hubs in the central and western regions; move forward with efforts to turn major ports of entry in border areas into transportation hubs",""],[1,"80","2","Integrated Transport Transfer and Logistics Network Improvement","We will improve the role of hubs as providers of comprehensive services, optimize transfer facilities and distribution and transportation networks, and work to ensure zero-distance passenger transfers and seamlessly integrated freight transportation",""],[1,"81","3","National Railway Line Completion and Construction Programme","Complete the Harbin-Beijing-Hong Kong (Macao), Lianyungang- Ürümqi, Shanghai-Kunming, and Guangzhou-Kunming lines; § Build the Beijing-Hong Kong (Taipei), Hohhot-Nanning, Beijing- Kunming, Baotou-Yinchuan-Haikou, Qingdao-Yinchuan, Lanzhou (Xining)- Guangzhou, Beijing-Lanzhou, and Chongqing-Xiamen lines;",""],[1,"81","4","Regional High-Speed Rail Line Expansion","Extend regional lines connecting high-speed railways.",""],[1,"81","6","National Expressway Network Construction","Speed up the construction of the national expressway network, which consists of 7 radial expressways from Beijing, 11 north-south expressways, and 18 east- west expressways, as well as regional ring roads, parallel highways, and connecting roads;",""],[1,"81","7","Expressway Network Expansion and Capacity Improvement","Increase the density and improve the service of expressway networks in the Yangtze Economic Belt and the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei region; increase capacity around heavily congested sections of expressways;",""],[1,"82","1","Coastal and Yangtze Corridor Transport Infrastructure Construction","Basically complete construction on a coastal high-speed railway from Dandong to Fangchenggang, a coastal expressway, and a high-speed railway along the Yangtze River from Shanghai to Chengdu;",""],[1,"82","2","Border Highway Construction Acceleration","Speed up the construction of highways along our borders;",""],[1,"82","3","Border Railway Construction Programme","Build railways along our borders such as the Hotan-Ruoqiang Railway, the Luoguhe-Laoheishan Railway along the border in the Northeast, and the Chengdu- Lhasa Railway;",""],[1,"82","4","Transborder and Belt and Road Road Construction","Press ahead with construction of transborder thoroughfares between China and neighboring countries and thoroughfares along the Belt and Road routes;",""],[1,"82","5","International Freight Train Logistics Platform Development","Build logistics platforms for international freight trains in Ürümqi, Lanzhou, and other major hub cities along the Belt and Road routes;",""],[1,"82","6","Shenzhen-Zhongshan Bridge Construction","Construct the Shenzhen-Zhongshan Bridge.",""],[1,"82","7","International Hub Airport Development","Build international hub airports:",""],[1,"82","8","Beijing New Airport Construction","Complete the construction of the new airport in Beijing;",""],[1,"82","9","World-Class Airport Cluster Development","Construct clusters of world-class airports in the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei region, the Yangtze River Delta, and the Pearl River Delta;",""],[1,"82","10","International Aviation Hub Construction","Speed up the construction of international aviation hubs in Harbin, Shenzhen, Kunming, Chengdu, Chongqing, Xi'an, Ürümqi, and other cities; Strengthen the functions of regional hub airports.",""],[1,"82","10","Regional Hub Airport Capacity Enhancement","Strengthen the functions of regional hub airports.",""],[1,"82","11","Airport Reconstruction, Relocation, and Expansion Programme","Implement projects to rebuild, relocate, or expand some of the busiest main airports, while also building regional airports and general purpose airports;",""],[1,"82","11","Cargo Airport Construction Programme","Build cargo airports including that in Zhengzhou;",""],[1,"82","13","Port Cluster Improvement and Upgrading","Improve and upgrade clusters of ports in the Bohai Sea rim, the Yangtze River Delta, and the Pearl River Delta;",""],[1,"82","14","High-Grade Inland Waterways Construction Programme","Speed up the construction of high-grade inland waterways on the Yangtze, Pearl-Xi, Huai, and Min rivers;",""],[1,"82","15","Construction of International Shipping Centers","Make a major push to move forward with the construction of international shipping centers in Shanghai, Tianjin, Dalian, Xiamen, and other harbor cities;",""],[1,"82","16","Construction of Specialized Coastal Harbor Berths","Adopt an orderly approach in moving forward with the construction of specialized berths for containers, crude oil, and liquefied natural gas in coastal harbors;",""],[1,"82","16","International Cruise Terminal Development","Take steady steps to build international cruise terminals such as that on Phoenix Island, Hainan;",""],[1,"82","17","Harbor Intelligent Systems Upgrade","Increase the level of intelligent systems used in harbors.",""],[1,"83","11","Integrated Multimodal Passenger Transport Hub Development","Giving priority to the development of high-speed railways, intercity rail transit, and airports, build a number of open, integrated multimodal passenger transportation hubs, give impetus to the development of same-platform and multilevel- platform passenger transfers, and step up efforts to develop rapid transit between major passenger transportation hubs in cities, so as to reduce the distance and time of passenger transfers;",""],[1,"83","12","Multimodal Freight Transportation Hub Development","Build a number of multimodal freight transportation hubs to improve the efficiency of transloading;",""],[1,"84","1","One-Stop Passenger Ticketing Services","Move ahead with establishing one-stop ticketing services for railway, air, and road passenger transportation",""],[1,"84","1","Multimodal Transport Information Platform and Big Data Centers","build public information service platforms for multimodal transportation as well as big data centers for transportation",""]],"68":[[1,"68","3","New-Energy Vehicle Promotion","Promote the use of new-energy vehicles;",""],[1,"68","4","New-Energy Vehicle Promotion for Urban Public Transport and Taxis","Encourage the use of new-energy vehicles for urban public transport and taxi services;",""],[1,"68","5","Electric and Hybrid Vehicle Development Initiative","Develop all-electric vehicles and hybrid electric vehicles with a focus on making advancements in key technological areas such as battery energy density and battery temperature adaptability;",""],[1,"68","6","Electric Vehicle Charging Network Development","Facilitate the development of a network of charging facilities and services that are compatible with each other and come under unified standards;",""],[1,"68","7","Continuous Policy Support Improvement","Improve policies to provide continuous support in this regard;",""],[1,"68","9","Used Battery Recovery and Disposal Initiative","Strengthen efforts to recover and dispose of used batteries from new- energy vehicles.",""]],"69":[[1,"80","1","Intercity and Municipal Rail Network Development","we will actively develop intercity and municipal (suburban) rail services and encourage the use of existing tracks to operate intercity rail services so as to form core networks of rail transit lines",""],[1,"80","1","Urban Public Transport Expansion","We will give priority to the development of public transportation, speed up the development of urban rail transit, bus rapid transit, and other forms of mass public transportation",""],[1,"80","1","Eco-friendly Urban Mobility Promotion","and will encourage people to use eco-friendly transportation to get around",""],[1,"80","1","Customized Urban Transport Services Development","We will give impetus to the development of online vehicle booking and other forms of customized transportation services",""],[1,"80","1","Urban Rapid Transit and Parking Infrastructure Improvement","We will strengthen rapid transit between city centers and outbound main roads and ensure faster and smoother traffic flow into and out of cities",""],[1,"82","18","Metropolitan Area Commuting Transport Model Development","Within each city cluster develop a metropolitan area commuting transport model",""],[1,"82","19","Intercity Rail Network Construction Completion","Basically complete the construction of intercity rail networks for the",""],[1,"83","1","Intercity Rail Network Framework for City Clusters","put in place the framework of intercity rail networks for other city clusters;",""],[1,"83","2","Municipal Suburban Rail Demonstration Projects","Carry out demonstration projects for municipal (suburban) rail lines.",""],[1,"83","3","Urban Rail Transit Network Expansion","Improve urban rail transit networks in megacities and supercities and move faster to establish rail transit networks in cities with populations of over 3 million;",""],[1,"83","3","Urban Public Transport Improvement","improve urban public transportation systems;",""],[1,"83","3","High-Density Parking Facility Construction","build high-density parking facilities;",""],[1,"83","3","New Urban Rail Transit Line Construction","Open approximately 3,000 kilometers of new urban rail transit lines to traffic;",""],[1,"83","4","Urban Traffic Flow Improvement and Ring Road Construction","Ensure smooth traffic flow on urban roads and at busy entrances and exits of outbound highways; and in cities, where conditions permit, plan and construct ring roads.",""],[1,"83","13","Transit-Oriented City Complex Development","Encourage development of city complexes built around transportation hubs.",""],[1,"102","12","Public Transport Electrification Initiative","Working faster to achieve the electrification of public transport;",""]],"70":[[1,"81","1","Low-Carbon and Smart Transportation Development","We will make headway in the low-carbon development of transportation by seeing that resources are used intensively and economically and by promoting the application of standard modern transportation equipment and energy-efficient, environmentally friendly means of transport.",""],[1,"81","1","Smart Transportation Systems Upgrade","We will accelerate the development of smart transportation; make wider use of advanced information technology and intelligent technology and equipment in transportation services; improve multimodal transport systems, intelligent management systems, and public information systems; and accelerate the development of multimodal transportation, so as to improve the quality and increase the profits of transportation services.",""],[1,"81","1","Transport and Postal Safety Management Strengthening","We will tighten safety management over transportation and postal services and increase our capacity to ensure safety, respond to emergencies, and carry out emergency rescue.",""],[1,"81","1","Taxi, Railway, and Airspace Reform","We will press ahead with reform in the taxi industry, promote market-based reform in the railway sector, and speed up reform of the airspace management system.",""],[1,"83","14","Digital Transport Operations and Smart Mobility Upgrade","Promote the internet-based operation of transportation infrastructure and means of transportation and the digitalization of operation information, accelerate development of the Internet of Vehicles and the Internet of Vessels, improve early warning systems for failures and systems for operational maintenance and intelligent scheduling, press ahead with vehicle automation, the digitalization of facilities, and the increasing use of smart operations;",""]],"73":[[1,"49","3","Permanent Basic Cropland Protection System","We will continue to apply the strictest possible protection system for farmland and will designate permanent basic cropland throughout the country.",""],[1,"49","3","Food Crop Production Strategy","We will put in place a food crop production strategy that is based on farmland management and the application of technology, and with the focus on major growing areas of grain crop and other staple agricultural products, we will make a large-scale push to see the building of farmland irrigation systems and water conservancy infrastructure, the restoration of rural land, the improvement of low- and medium-yield cropland, and the development of high-quality farmland.",""],[1,"49","3","Cultivated Land Replenishment and Topsoil Reuse Mechanism","We will improve the system for ensuring that cultivated land taken over for nonagricultural use is replaced with land of an equivalent amount and quality, explore the possibility of formulating measures for national coordination in offsetting farmland that has been used for major construction projects, and ensure that the stripping and reuse of topsoil are practiced nationwide on all cultivated land put to nonagricultural use.",""],[1,"49","3","Grain Crop Production Functional Zones and Protected Areas","We will establish grain crop production functional zones and protected areas for the production of major agricultural products to ensure that the acreage of land devoted to growing grain crops such as rice and wheat remains basically stable.",""],[1,"54","2","Agricultural Innovation and Modernization Programme","we will improve systems for promoting innovation in and the application of modern agricultural science and technology, accelerate agricultural mechanization, strengthen the integration of information technology into agriculture, and develop intelligent agriculture.",""],[1,"55","1","Agricultural Innovation and Technology Upgrade Programme","We will strengthen innovation in agricultural science and technology and accelerate work on developing bio-breeding, agricultural machinery and equipment, and eco-friendly methods for increasing production.",""],[1,"55","1","High-Yield Crop Variety Promotion and Cultivation Standardization","We will promote the use of high- yield, high-quality crop breeds suited to mechanized agriculture as well as standardized and localized models of high-yield and high-performance cultivation, and we will improve the conditions for making innovations in major agricultural laboratories.",""],[1,"55","1","Modern Seed Industry Development Plan","We will develop the modern seed industry, tackle key scientific and technological issues to make progress in the development of superior seed varieties, implement a new action plan for upgrading crop varieties, develop national seed breeding and production centers, and help the growth of leading seed enterprises using integrated cultivation- breeding-promotion operations.",""],[1,"55","1","Crop Mechanization and Agricultural Technology Extension Network","We will promote complete mechanization of the production process of major crops as well as the integration of agricultural machinery and methods.",""],[1,"55","1","Community-Level Agricultural Technology Promotion Network","We will improve and invigorate networks for the promotion of agricultural technology at the community level.",""],[1,"57","3","High-Quality Farmland Development Program","give top priority to the development of high-quality farmland which can help to ensure food security; implement farmland projects to improve soil and build irrigation and drainage facilities, roads for farm equipment, farmland shelterbelt networks, and electricity transmission and distribution facilities; and ensure the development of 53 million hectares of high- quality farmland, while aiming for the completion of 67 million hectares",""],[1,"57","3","Arable Land Quality Assessment and Monitoring","Assess, grade, and monitor the quality of arable land.",""],[1,"58","1","National Germplasm Collection, Storage, and Research System","Develop a national system for the collection, storage, and research of germplasm resources;",""],[1,"58","2","Agricultural Seed and Breeding Technology R&D Programme","Strengthen research and development of key technologies for crop heterosis exploitation, molecular design breeding, cell and chromosome engineering, high- efficiency seed production, and fine and deep processing of seeds;",""],[1,"58","3","Seed Quality Inspection Capacity Strengthening","Strengthen capacity for seed quality inspection;",""],[1,"58","4","National and Regional Seed Production Centers","Establish national seed production centers in Hainan, Gansu, Sichuan, and other provinces, and 100 regional superior seed production centers.",""]],"74":[[1,"49","2","Agricultural Structural Adjustment and Productivity Improvement","We will make sure we achieve basic self-sufficiency in cereal grains and absolute food security, make agricultural structural adjustments and improvements, raise our production capacity for agricultural products while also improving quality and safety, and see that a better structured, more effective supply of agricultural products takes shape.",""],[1,"50","1","Green High-Yield Efficient Grain Production Initiative","We will intensify efforts to realize green, high-yield, and efficient grain crop production.",""],[1,"50","2","Integrated Agricultural Production and Modern Agriculture Development","We will promote the coordination of food, cash, and fodder crop production, step up integrated development of the farming, forestry, livestock, and fishing industries, and integrate planting, breeding, and processing.",""],[1,"50","2","Agricultural Production Center Development in Superior Producing Areas","support superior producing areas in developing production centers for cotton, oilseed, sugar crops, soybeans, forestry seedlings, and fruit.",""],[1,"50","2","Modern Livestock and Grass Industry Development","We will develop modern grass industries and herbivorous livestock industries region by region.",""],[1,"50","2","Standardization and Scaling of Livestock, Poultry, and Aquaculture Farming","We will ensure that livestock, poultry, and aquaculture farming are further standardized and brought up to scale.",""],[1,"50","2","Safe and Quality Dairy Production Improvement","We will ensure that the dairy industry produces safe, quality products.",""],[1,"50","2","Horticultural Product Quality and Cost-Effectiveness Improvement","We will improve the quality and cost-effectiveness of horticultural products.",""],[1,"50","2","Economic Forest and Under-Forest Economy Development","We will develop economic forests and under-forest economies that take advantage of local strengths.",""],[1,"50","2","Specialty Agricultural Product Spatial Optimization","We will improve the geographical layout of the production of specialty agricultural products.",""],[1,"50","2","Modern Agriculture Demonstration Area Development","We will accelerate the development of demonstration areas for modern agriculture.",""],[1,"50","3","Agricultural Production and Value Chain Development","We will promote the development of agricultural production and value chains, create different types of linkages between the interests of different entities, and foster entities that integrate primary, secondary, and tertiary industry operations as well as help develop new kinds of such operations in order to open up more channels through",""],[1,"51","1","Agricultural Processing and Value-Added Development","We will promote the development of processing industries and services for agricultural production.",""],[1,"51","1","Agriculture Diversification and Rural Integration Initiative","We will see that agriculture takes on more functions, promote close cooperation between agriculture on the one hand and leisure, tourism, education, culture, and health on the other, and develop new forms of agricultural business such as agri-tourism, agricultural experiences, and creative agriculture.",""],[1,"51","1","Modern Urban Agriculture Development","We will accelerate the development of modern urban agriculture.",""],[1,"59","3","Agricultural Demonstration and Industrialization Development","Develop demonstration family farms, demonstration agricultural cooperatives, agricultural industrialization demonstration centers, and demonstration service organizations;",""],[1,"59","6","Integrated Rural Industrial Development Pilot Demonstration Project","Implement the \"100 counties, 1,000 townships, 10,000 villages \" pilot demonstration project to promote the integrated development of the primary, secondary, and tertiary industries in rural areas;",""],[1,"59","7","Integrated Development Model Replication Initiative","Create a number of integrated development models and forms of business that can be replicated elsewhere;",""],[1,"59","8","Rural Enterprise Development for Industrial Integration","Develop a number of rural enterprises that can take the lead in integrating the development of the primary, secondary and tertiary industries;",""]],"75":[[1,"51","1","Rural Resource Utilization and Property Income Enhancement","We will put rural resources and factors of production to better use so as to increase the property income of rural residents.",""],[1,"53","3","Agribusiness Development and Modern Agriculture Support Policy","We will make policies more conducive to the growth of new types of agribusiness, support the development of large family farming businesses and family farms, guide and promote the well-regulated development of farmers' cooperatives, support the growth of enterprises that are leaders in agricultural industrialization, cultivate a new type of professional farmer, and nurture competent modern agricultural operators.",""],[1,"53","3","Agricultural Investment and Business Model Promotion","We will encourage and support industrial and commercial capital investment in modern agriculture and promote the development of agricultural-commercial alliances and other emerging business models.",""],[1,"54","1","Society-wide Agricultural Services Support Program","We will implement a program to support society-wide services for agriculture, and develop commercial service organizations.",""],[1,"54","1","Rural Agricultural Logistics and E-commerce Development","We will strengthen the development of distribution facilities and markets for agricultural products, work to improve rural logistics and comprehensive service networks, encourage the development of e-commerce in rural areas, and implement projects to encourage the development of precooling in specialty agricultural product producing areas and express delivery services in rural areas.",""],[1,"54","1","Supply and Marketing Cooperative Reform","We will deepen the comprehensive reform of supply and marketing cooperatives.",""],[1,"54","1","Agricultural Service Mechanism Innovation","We will make innovations in society- wide agricultural service mechanisms.",""]],"76":[[1,"3","20","Modern Agricultural Operations System","Establish a Modern Agricultural Operations System",""],[1,"53","1","Modern Agricultural Operations System","we will create new methods for organizing agricultural operations and establish a modern system of agricultural operations that is based on rural household operations, held together by cooperation and association, and supported by society-wide services",""],[1,"53","2","Rural Land Rights Separation and Transfer Reform","We will keep rural land contract relationships stable, improve the measures for separating land ownership rights, contract rights, and management rights, promote the orderly transfer of land management rights in accordance with the law, and develop appropriately scaled agricultural operations through means such as third party cultivation, joint cultivation of combined land, land trusteeship, and joint-stock cooperation.",""]],"77":[[1,"97","2","Urban Slum Rebuilding and Dilapidated Housing Renovation","We will basically complete the rebuilding of rundown urban areas and the renovation of dilapidated urban housing.",""],[1,"97","2","Integrated Urban Renewal and Industrial Upgrading","We will better integrate the rebuilding of rundown urban areas with urban renewal and industrial transformation and upgrading, speed up work to rebuild concentrated and contiguous rundown areas and urban \"villages,\" move forward step by step with the comprehensive improvement of old residential communities and the renovation of dilapidated housing and dormitory-style housing, and extend the policy on rebuilding rundown areas to cover all key towns around the country.",""],[1,"97","2","Urban Infrastructure Support and Project Quality Oversight","We will improve supporting infrastructure and strengthen project quality oversight.",""],[1,"97","3","Urban Governance and Management Reform","We will develop new forms of urban governance, reform urban management and law enforcement systems, and promote refined, life- cycle, and cooperative management.",""],[1,"97","3","Urban Planning and Spatial Regulation Reform","We will make innovations in the concepts and methods used in urban planning; properly define the scale, growth boundaries, development intensity, and protected space of cities; and strengthen planning and regulation to achieve multi- layered urban spaces, coordination among different spatial layers, a coherent overall style and look, and cultural continuity.",""],[1,"97","3","Organic Urban Renewal and City Regeneration","We will promote well-conceived design for all cities and make headway in organic urban renewal, and encourage the regeneration and transformation of cities.",""],[1,"97","3","Green and Safe Building Development","We will develop practical, economical, green, and visually pleasing buildings, improve the level of technique, safety standards, and construction",""],[1,"102","2","Urban Village and Run-Down Area Rebuilding Programme","Accelerate the rebuilding of urban \"villages\" and rundown urban areas with a combined population of approximately 100 million;",""]],"78":[[1,"94","1","Coordinated Urbanization Strategy","We will work faster in pursuit of an urbanization strategy which stresses reasonable distribution and coordinated development of cities of all sizes and small towns and which combines two horizontal axes-land bridges and the Yangtze River- and three vertical axes-China's coastline, the Beijing- Harbin and Beijing-Guangzhou railways, and the Baotou-Kunming Railway.",""],[1,"94","2","City Cluster Development and Coordination Mechanism","We will give a boost to city clusters in the eastern region; build world- class city clusters in the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei region, the Yangtze River Delta, and the Pearl River Delta; and make the city clusters on the Shandong Peninsula and the west side of the Taiwan Straits more open and competitive.",""],[1,"94","2","Central and Western City Cluster Cultivation Programme","We will cultivate city clusters in the central and western regions; develop the city clusters in the northeast and the Central Plains region, around the middle reaches of the Yangtze River, and in the Chengdu-Chongqing region and the Guanzhong Plains region; and plan and guide the development of city clusters in Beibu Bay, central Shanxi, the Hohhot-Baotou-Ordos-Yulin region, central Guizhou, central Yunnan, the Lanzhou-Xining region, the area around the Ningxia section of the Yellow River, and the northern foothills of the Tianshan Mountains, creating more growth poles to support regional development.",""],[1,"94","2","Urban Agglomeration Development in Lhasa and Kashi","We will promote the development of the urban agglomerations centered around Lhasa and Kashi.",""],[1,"94","2","City Cluster Coordination Mechanism","We will establish sound mechanisms for coordinating the development of city clusters and promote coordination in industrial division of labor, infrastructure, ecological conservation, and environmental improvement between cities in different regions in order to achieve the integration and efficient development of city clusters.",""],[1,"95","1","Central City and Metropolitan Area Development Programme","We will develop a number of central cities and ensure they better serve their respective regions.",""],[1,"95","2","Small and Medium City Development and Urban Infrastructure Upgrade","We will accelerate the development of small and medium cities, with efforts aimed at improving quality and increasing quantity.",""],[1,"95","2","Industrial Project Distribution in Small and Medium Cities","We will guide the distribution of industrial projects in these cities and in county towns, improve municipal infrastructure and public service facilities, and promote the allocation of quality education, medical care, and other resources for public services to small and medium cities and small towns.",""],[1,"95","2","Expansion of County-Level Administrative Authority for Large Towns","We will work more quickly to expand the functions of larger towns with populations of 100,000 or over, conferring on them part of the administrative authority enjoyed at the county level, and specify the standards for establishing cities and districts so that counties and large towns that meet criteria can be turned into cities.",""],[1,"95","2","Distinctive Small Town Development and Industrial-Urban Integration","In line with local conditions, we will develop attractive small towns that are distinctive in character and integrate industrial and urban development.",""],[1,"95","2","Border Port Function Improvement","We will improve the functions of border ports.",""],[1,"99","3","Urban-Rural Coordination and County Economy Support","We will promote coordination between the development of new urbanization and the building of a new countryside, improve the ability of county economies to support and lead economic development in their surrounding areas, promote the",""],[1,"100","2","Specialized County Economy Development","We will cultivate and develop specialized county economies that are full of vitality and characteristic of their local areas, and strengthen the ability of counties to take on functions formerly performed by cities and lead rural development.",""],[1,"100","2","Rural Industrial Upgrading and Integration Initiative","Based on competitive resources, we will promote the development of intensive agro-processing, the rural service industry, and labor-intensive industries, actively explore new models for rural areas to take over industries formerly located in urban areas, and integrate rural areas into regional industry chains and production networks.",""],[1,"100","2","County Town Industrial Concentration Policy","We will guide the concentration of rural secondary and tertiary industries in county towns, key towns and townships, and industrial parks.",""],[1,"100","2","County Fiscal Decentralization and Resource Assurance Reform","We will increase the decision-making power of counties over development and improve the basic assurances for adequate county-level financial resources.",""],[1,"102","4","County Seat and Large Town Function Expansion","move faster to expand the overall functions of eligible county seats and large towns",""],[1,"102","5","Small Town Development Initiative","Promote the development of small towns that possess unique resources, geographical advantages, or cultural heritage;",""],[1,"102","6","Urban Town Empowerment and Industrial Development Support","Help these towns to increase their functions and expand their powers, and provide them with greater financial and other support to enable them to use their distinctive features to develop industries in areas such as leisure and tourism, commerce and logistics, information technology, smart manufacturing, science and technology, education, and folk culture.",""],[1,"103","8","Regional Economic Belt Formation and Coordinated Development Strategy","we will promote the formation of north-south and east-west intersecting economic belts primarily along the coastline, the Yangtze River, and major transportation routes as well as a pattern of coordinated development between regions",""]],"79":[[1,"88","8","Water Conservancy Infrastructure Network Improvement","We will move faster to improve water conservancy infrastructure networks",""],[1,"89","1","Major Water Diversion and Source Development Projects","We will conduct feasibility studies and take steady steps to move forward with a number of major water diversion projects, key projects connecting river and lake systems, and key water source projects;",""],[1,"89","1","Small and Medium Water Conservancy Facility Expansion","coordinate and strengthen efforts to build small and medium water conservancy facilities;",""],[1,"89","1","Regional Water Supply Network Construction","move more quickly to construct safe and reliable regional water supply networks linking different water sources to ensure supply in both urban and rural areas.",""],[1,"89","1","Drought Water Source and Backup Supply Projects","We will implement region-specific counter- drought water source projects and step up efforts to develop emergency and backup water sources for cities.",""],[1,"89","1","Surface Water and Unconventional Water Use Regulation","We will exploit and utilize surface water and different kinds of unconventional water sources in a carefully- planned way and impose rigid controls on groundwater mining.",""],[1,"89","1","River Basin Restoration and Water Conservation Measures","We will take systematic measures to improve river basin environments, ensure adequate water to preserve river ecosystems, and improve capacity for water conservation and storage.",""],[1,"89","1","Cross-Border River Basin Development and Cooperation","We will implement well-planned steps to develop and harness the water of cross-border river basins, and deepen cross-border water cooperation with neighboring countries.",""],[1,"89","1","Weather Modification Activities","We will carry out weather modification activities.",""],[1,"89","3","Auxiliary Facilities and Water-Saving Irrigation Upgrading","Complete the building of auxiliary facilities and the upgrading of water- saving systems in all 434 large irrigation areas;",""],[1,"90","1","Large Irrigation Projects","Carry out large irrigation projects, including: the Nierji water conservancy project on the Nen River; the Songyuan irrigation project in Jilin; Xiangjiaba Dam in Sichuan;",""],[1,"90","10","Yellow River to Baiyangdian Lake Water Diversion Project","the project to divert water from the Yellow River to Baiyangdian Lake",""],[1,"90","16","Datong River to Huang River Water Diversion Project","the project to divert water from Datong River to the Huang River",""],[1,"90","17","Chuoer River to Xiliao River Water Diversion Project","the project to divert water from Chuoer River to the Xiliao River in Inner",""],[1,"90","20","Follow-up Projects for Eastern and Central Routes","Press ahead with the follow-up projects for the eastern and central routes",""],[1,"91","1","Counter-Drought Emergency Water Source Projects","Carry out counter-drought emergency water source projects;",""],[1,"91","2","Medium Reservoir and Regional Water Source Development","Intensify efforts to develop medium reservoirs and other key regional water sources.",""],[1,"91","6","Yangtze River Flow Regulation and Yellow River Waterway Improvement","control the flow regime of the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze; build levees on the lower reaches and improve the waterways along the middle and upper reaches of the Yellow River;",""],[1,"91","7","Huai River and Lake Tai Water Conservancy Projects","carry out a new round of major water conservancy projects to harness the Huai River and manage Lake Tai;",""],[1,"91","9","Preliminary Work on Major Water Conservancy and Hydropower Projects","Conduct preliminary work on the: Guxian water conservancy project on the Yellow River; Poyang Lake water conservancy project; Heishanxia hydropower plant on the Yellow River.",""],[1,"103","3","Rural Centralized Water Supply Expansion","Move ahead with ensuring that new types of rural communities have access to centralized water supplies",""]],"80":[[1,"89","2","River and Lake Flood Control Infrastructure Programme","We will strengthen the development of key projects to manage rivers and lakes and continue to reinforce the levees of major rivers and lakes, improve waterway management, carry out water control projects, and build flood detention basins.",""],[1,"89","2","Small and Medium River and Reservoir Safety Programme","We will move more quickly in our work on harnessing small and medium rivers, flash flood prevention and disaster management, and the reinforcement of dilapidated reservoirs and sluices; and work to ensure that key seawalls reach set standards.",""],[1,"89","2","Meteorological and Hydrological Flood Risk Monitoring System","We will strengthen meteorological and hydrological monitoring, rainfall forecasting, hydrological regime predictions, and flood risk management, improving our ability to prevent and mitigate damage caused by flooding.",""],[1,"91","3","River Basin Water Control Projects","Construct water control projects for river basins, including: the Datengxia project on the Xi River; the Chushandian project on the Huai River; the Artashi project in Xinjiang.",""],[1,"91","5","Flood Prevention Along Major River Channels","strengthen flood prevention along the primary channels of the Heilong, Songhua, and Nen rivers;",""],[1,"91","8","Flood Detention Basin Security and River Harnessing","ensure the security of flood detention basins; move more quickly to harness small and medium rivers such as the Yarkant River.",""],[1,"103","7","River Embankment Improvement Works","Improve river embankments.",""]],"81":[[1,"98","2","Housing Supply System Reform","We will establish a housing supply system whereby government plays the main role in providing basic housing while the market plays the main role in meeting the multi-layered demand for housing",""],[1,"98","2","Housing Supply and Demand Structure Improvement","we will improve housing supply and demand structures",""],[1,"98","2","Housing Quality Improvement and Universal Housing Assurance","steadily improve the quality of people's housing, and better ensure housing for everyone",""],[1,"98","3","Housing System Reform and Public Rental Housing Support","We will deepen reform of the housing system with the aim of meeting the housing needs of new urban residents and establishing a housing system that promotes both buying and renting.",""],[1,"98","3","Rental Housing Assistance for Non-Registered Urban Residents","We will support residents who are not in a position to buy, particularly those without registered urban residency, in renting housing, and provide eligible families with monetary rental assistance.",""],[1,"98","3","Public Rental Housing Policy Expansion","We will extend public rental housing policies to cover non-registered urban residents and develop these policies to enable assistance through the provision of monetary subsidies.",""],[1,"98","3","Government Employee Housing Policy Improvement","We will improve the government employee housing policy.",""],[1,"98","4","Housing Supply Structure Improvement","We will improve the housing supply structure, promote balance between market supply and demand, and ensure that the real estate market operates smoothly.",""],[1,"99","1","Housing Inventory Reduction and Demand Expansion Measures","we will steadily relieve housing inventory, expand effective demand for housing, and increase the proportion of direct monetary housing subsidies provided during the rebuilding of rundown areas.",""],[1,"99","1","Rental Market Development and Expansion","We will actively develop the rental market, encourage both natural person investors and different types of institutional investors to purchase commodity housing stock, expand rental market supply, and encourage the development of enterprises specializing mainly in rentals.",""],[1,"99","1","Real Estate Industry Consolidation and REIT Pilot","We will promote mergers and acquisitions in the real estate industry, increase the concentration of the industry, and pilot the use of trust funds for real estate investment.",""],[1,"99","1","Diversified Real Estate Development","We will develop new forms of business such as tourist real estate, senior citizen real estate, and cultural real estate.",""],[1,"99","1","Housing Industry Modernization Initiative","We will accelerate the modernization of the housing industry and improve the overall quality of housing.",""],[1,"99","2","Urban Government-Subsidized Housing Expansion and Management Reform","We will bring residence card holders within the scope of urban government- subsidized housing policies.",""],[1,"99","2","Government-Subsidized Housing Planning, Reconstruction, and Supporting Facilities","We will coordinate planning for developing government-subsidized housing, rebuilding rundown areas, and developing supporting facilities, ensure the quality of construction, and make everyday living and getting around more convenient for residents.",""],[1,"99","2","Public Rental Housing Supply Expansion","We will use multiple channels to increase the supply of public rental housing.",""],[1,"99","2","Housing Subsidy and Rental Assistance Expansion","We will both ensure adequate housing and provide monetary subsidies, and gradually grant more rental subsidies.",""],[1,"99","2","Government-Subsidized Housing Investment and Eligibility Mechanism Reform","We will improve the mechanisms for investing in and operating government-subsidized housing and for handling eligibility-related procedures.",""]],"82":[[1,"189","2","Cultural Sector Reform and Development","we will accelerate reform and development in the cultural sector",""],[1,"189","2","Coordinated Material and Cultural-Ethical Progress","promote coordinated material and cultural-ethical progress",""],[1,"189","2","Strong Socialist Culture Development","develop a strong socialist culture in China",""],[1,"189","3","Societal Integrity and Civic Civility Promotion","we will strengthen work to improve ethical and moral standards and promote integrity throughout society, advocate traditional Chinese virtues alongside modern virtues, and promote the spirit of science and humanity to advance civic development and civility throughout society.",""],[1,"189","4","Core Socialist Values Integration and Civic Education Campaign","We will incorporate the core socialist values into all areas of economic and social development and all aspects of social life by strengthening education about ideals",""],[1,"190","1","Core Socialist Values Promotion and Civic Morality Campaign","Through education, guidance, publicity, culture, practice, and institutions, we will work to see that our people internalize and firmly believe in the core socialist values and purposefully make them the basis for their actions, enhancing confidence in the path, theories, and system of socialism with Chinese characteristics throughout society.",""],[1,"190","1","Community-Level Communication and Cultural Work Strengthening","We will strengthen communication and cultural work at the community level.",""],[1,"190","1","Civic Morality Advancement Initiative","We will advance civic morality and foster a sense of moral judgment and moral responsibility.",""],[1,"191","2","Popular Civility and Volunteerism Initiative","We will launch extensive popular initiatives to increase civility in cities, villages, organizations, households, and schools and promote the spirit of Lei Feng through volunteer service activities.",""],[1,"191","2","Public Ethics and Traditional Culture Promotion","We will give impetus to the educative, cultural, and improving roles of important traditional festivals, major ceremonial events, and public service advertisements.",""],[1,"191","2","Positive Ethical Culture Promotion Initiative","We will foster a positive ethical culture at home, in the countryside, at school, and in business to bring about an atmosphere of modern ethical and social progress.",""],[1,"195","3","Moral Exemplars Recognition Initiative","Launch initiatives to select and commend, publicize and emulate moral",""],[1,"195","4","Societal Integrity Promotion Initiatives","Launch initiatives to promote integrity throughout society;",""],[1,"195","5","Nationwide Morality and Frugality Promotion Initiative","Carry out nationwide initiatives to promote morality and frugality;",""],[1,"200","2","Social Ethics and Norms Promotion Initiative","We will encourage the public to draw on social ethics, professional ethics, family virtues, personal morality, and other moral and ethical codes to improve themselves and practice self-discipline, to willingly perform their legal obligations, social responsibilities, and family duties, and to conscientiously observe and safeguard social order.",""]],"83":[[1,"16","4","Public Cultural Service System Development","We will build up the basic framework of the public cultural service system, and see that the cultural sector becomes a pillar of the economy.",""],[1,"16","4","Chinese Culture Promotion and Outreach","We will continue to expand the influence of Chinese culture.",""],[1,"191","2","Scientific Literacy and Reading Promotion Campaign","We will popularize scientific knowledge and encourage everyone to get reading, with the aim of increasing the proportion of citizens with scientific literacy to over 10%.",""],[1,"191","2","Public-Interest Performance and Fine Arts Access Expansion","We will work to see more public-interest performances being held and more fine arts activities being made available to the general public.",""],[1,"192","2","Public Cultural Services Standards and Access Expansion","We will move forward with setting standards for basic public cultural services and ensuring equitable access.",""],[1,"192","2","Public Cultural Facilities Network Improvement","We will improve networks of public cultural facilities and strengthen capabilities to provide public cultural services at the community level.",""],[1,"192","2","Inclusive Cultural Development Support","We will increase support for cultural development in old revolutionary bases, areas with concentrations of ethnic minorities, border areas, and poor areas.",""],[1,"192","2","Public-Interest Cultural Services Alignment","We will work to see cultural products and public-interest services better fit the cultural needs of the general public.",""],[1,"192","2","Non-Governmental Participation in Public Cultural Services","We will encourage nongovernmental actors to participate in the provision of public cultural services.",""],[1,"192","2","Free Public Access to Cultural Facilities","We will continue making efforts to see public cultural facilities are open to the public free of charge.",""],[1,"192","2","Protection of Cultural Rights for Vulnerable Groups","We will better protect the cultural rights and interests of the elderly, minors, migrant workers, people with disabilities, and other groups.",""],[1,"196","2","Public Cultural Facilities Improvement","Improve the conditions of prefecture- and county-level public cultural centers, libraries, and museums;",""],[1,"196","3","Rural Multipurpose Cultural Center Improvement","Improve the functions of multipurpose cultural centers in villages and ensure they are used more efficiently;",""],[1,"196","3","Mobile Cultural Center Coverage in Poor Counties","See that all counties in poor areas are equipped with vehicle-based mobile cultural centers;",""],[1,"196","8","National Cultural Facilities Development Programme","Move forward with the development of major national-level cultural facilities including the National Art Museum of China, the China National Arts and Crafts Museum, the Forbidden City Museum improvement project, and the National Documents Strategic Repository;",""],[1,"197","23","Reading in China Activities","Hold a series of activities around the theme of \"Reading in China\";",""],[1,"197","24","Community Reading and Rural Digital Library Facilities","While making full use of existing facilities, coordinate the building of community reading centers, rural digital libraries, public digital reading terminals, and other such facilities;",""],[1,"197","25","Provision of Reading Materials for Children","Provide books, newspapers, and periodicals for children;",""],[1,"197","26","Urban Book Provision Initiative","Provide books for city residents;",""],[1,"197","27","Braille Literature Publication Support","Support the publication of literature in braille;",""]],"84":[[1,"190","3","Traditional Culture Preservation and Promotion System","We will establish systems for carrying on the fine cultural traditions of China and ensure that traditional culture is creatively adapted and developed.",""],[1,"190","3","Traditional Culture Popularization and Education Integration","We will carry out extensive activities to popularize fine traditional culture and see its incorporation into national education, and we will see that the revolutionary culture established since the May 4th Movement is carried on.",""],[1,"190","3","Standard Chinese Language Promotion and Standardization","We will channel great energy into advocating and standardizing the usage of the standard Chinese language.",""],[1,"190","3","Cultural Heritage Protection and Utilization Measures","We will strengthen the protection and utilization of sites and items of cultural significance, putting an end to destructive development and improper business operations.",""],[1,"190","3","Intangible Cultural Heritage Protection and Revitalization","We will step up the protection and carrying on of intangible cultural heritage, revitalize traditional",""],[1,"191","1","Traditional Culture Development and Support Programme","We will develop ethnic and folk culture and support folk culture organizations.",""],[1,"196","10","Heritage Resources Protection and Utilization Programme","Strengthen the protection and utilization of heritage resources such as major national cultural and natural heritage sites; major nationally protected cultural and historical sites; famous historical and cultural cities, towns and villages; and national-level intangible cultural heritage;",""],[1,"196","11","National Cultural Parks Development and Protection Programme","Build national cultural parks and improve facilities for their protection and utilization;",""],[1,"196","12","National Memory Project","Carry out the national memory project;",""],[1,"196","13","Qufu Traditional Cultural Heritage Preservation and Development Exemplary Area Development","Move forward with the development of the Qufu Traditional Cultural Heritage Preservation and Development Exemplary Area in Shandong, as well as the Chinese Culture Inheritance and Innovation Zone in Gansu;",""],[1,"196","13","Chinese Culture Inheritance and Innovation Zone Development","Move forward with the development of the Qufu Traditional Cultural Heritage Preservation and Development Exemplary Area in Shandong, as well as the Chinese Culture Inheritance and Innovation Zone in Gansu;",""],[1,"196","14","Archaeological Work Strengthening","Strengthen archaeological work;",""],[1,"196","15","Cultural Heritage Protection Projects","Advance the protection of important cultural remains through projects such as the Erlitou Xia Dynasty Ruins Museum and the Jingdezhen Imperial Kiln Heritage Site.",""],[1,"197","1","Survey on Traditional Chinese Opera Varieties","Conduct a survey on the varieties of traditional Chinese opera;",""],[1,"197","2","Traditional Opera Digitization and Archiving Subsidy","Subsidize efforts to digitize and record traditional opera;",""],[1,"197","3","Traditional Opera Knowledge Transmission Support","Support opportunities for masters of Peking opera, Kunqu opera, and other local operas to pass on their knowledge and skills;",""],[1,"197","4","Regional Performance Art Centers Development","Build regional performance art centers;",""],[1,"197","5","Professional Traditional Opera Artist Development","Strengthen the cultivation of professional artists of traditional opera;",""],[1,"197","5","Traditional Craft Revitalization Plan","Formulate and implement a revitalization plan for traditional craftsmanship;",""],[1,"197","6","Traditional Craftsmanship Support Programme","Support traditional craftsmanship projects; § Encourage the creation of ethnic brand names.",""],[1,"197","6","Ethnic Brand Development Initiative","Support traditional craftsmanship projects; § Encourage the creation of ethnic brand names.",""],[1,"197","8","Nationwide Survey of Ancient Classical Texts","Basically complete the nationwide survey of ancient classical texts;",""],[1,"197","9","Ancient Classical Text Preservation and Repair Initiative","Encourage efforts to preserve the original form of or repair ancient classical texts;",""],[1,"197","10","National Publication of Important Texts","Publish 300 kinds of important texts through national projects;",""],[1,"197","11","National Database for Ancient Texts","Establish a national database for ancient texts;",""],[1,"197","12","Classical Religious Books Reorganization and Repair Support","Support efforts to reorganize and repair classical religious books, such as the Continued Taoist Canon and Tripitaka;",""],[1,"197","13","Support for Historical Works and Chorography Compilation","Increase support for the compilation of historical works and chorography;",""],[1,"197","13","Protection of Republic of China Era Documents","Protect Chinese documents originating from the Republic of China era (1912-1949);",""],[1,"197","14","Classical Texts and Documents Publication Programme","Systematically organize and publish major classical texts and documents written since the beginning of recent modern times.",""]],"85":[[1,"194","2","International Cultural Exchange and Cultural Trade Expansion","we will carry out more cultural exchanges, create new ways of communicating with international audiences, of conducting international cultural exchanges, and of carrying out cultural trade with foreign partners",""],[1,"195","1","International Cultural Exchange and Cultural Industry Cooperation Initiative","We will promote both governmental and nongovernmental exchanges to increase mutual cultural trust as well as cultural exchanges.",""],[1,"195","1","International Chinese Studies Exchange Promotion","We will encourage international exchanges in Chinese studies.",""],[1,"195","1","Overseas Chinese Cultural Centers Operating Mechanism Improvement","We will improve the operating mechanisms used by overseas Chinese cultural centers.",""],[1,"195","1","Overseas Chinese Participation in Cultural Exchange Support","We will support overseas Chinese in engaging in China-foreign cultural exchanges.",""],[1,"195","1","International Cultural Market Expansion and Cultural Product Export Promotion","We will strive to explore the international cultural market, encouraging cultural enterprises to engage in overseas investment and cooperation and exporting cultural products and services.",""],[1,"195","1","Foreign Cultural Achievement Adoption and Management Modernization","We will work to adopt outstanding foreign cultural achievements and advanced managerial concepts in the cultural sector, and encourage overseas-invested enterprises to conduct science and technology research and development as well as service outsourcing in the cultural sector in China.",""],[1,"195","1","National Cultural Security Protection","We will ensure national cultural safety.",""],[1,"195","2","Overseas Communication Network Expansion","We will expand our networks for overseas communication and use a greater variety of channels and methods for such communication.",""],[1,"195","2","Flagship Media and International Media Cooperation Initiative","We will establish flagship media, move forward with cooperative communication, strengthen efforts on joint ventures and cooperation with large international media groups, and ensure information networks and facilities work to facilitate cultural communication.",""],[1,"195","2","Chinese Cultural Discourse System Development","We will develop a system of discourse based on Chinese cultural characteristics that fits with both international practice as well as the unique characteristics of individual countries, and work to increase the accessibility of China's cultural communication through the use of more vibrant and diverse methods of expression.",""],[1,"197","21","International Audience Communication Coordination","Coordinate resources for communication with international audiences to expand high-end, localized, and border coverage;",""],[1,"197","22","Support for Storytelling Talent Development","Support the cultivation of those talented in telling stories of China.",""]],"87":[[1,"191","3","Cultural Initiatives and Culture Industry Development Projects","We will strengthen the development of both cultural initiatives and the culture industry by implementing projects to develop culture and help people emerge as eminent cultural figures so as to give an extra touch of color and vitality to people's cultural lives.",""],[1,"191","4","Support for Creation of Outstanding Cultural Works","We will support the creation of outstanding cultural works so that a greater number of masterly works will be produced to articulate contemporary Chinese values,",""],[1,"192","1","Cultural Content Innovation and Performance Venue Development","We will make more effective use of government investment and all types of funds, encourage innovative content and forms, support the development of theater troupes, and strengthen the development of performance and rehearsal venues.",""],[1,"192","1","Literature and Arts Theory, Critique, and Talent Development Support","We will develop literature and art theory and critique as well as support the development of artists and writers that demonstrate moral and political integrity and strong artistic talent.",""],[1,"192","2","Cultural and Creative Industries Promotion","We will promote the flourishing of literature, art, the press, publishing, radio, television, film, and sports.",""],[1,"192","3","Emerging and Creative Cultural Industries Development","We will accelerate the development of emerging industries such as online audio and video, mobile multimedia, digital publishing, animation, comics, and games, in addition to transforming and upgrading traditional industries such as publishing, film and television production, and arts and crafts.",""],[1,"192","3","New Cultural Business Forms Development","We will advance the development of new forms of business in the cultural sector, develop creative and cultural industries, and",""],[1,"193","1","Cultural Industry Development and Enterprise Restructuring","We will encourage mergers and restructuring of cultural enterprises and support the development of micro, small, and medium cultural businesses.",""],[1,"193","1","Cultural Consumption Promotion","We will expand and guide cultural consumption.",""],[1,"196","1","Cultural Works and Creative Arts Support Programs","works by organizing the implementation of the Award for Cultural Works on Five Areas, the National Stage Art Works Creation Program, the National Publishing Project, the National Film and Television Creation Program, the China Program for the Creation of Contemporary Literary and Artistic Works, the Outstanding Screenplay Support Project, and the National Project for Developing and Collecting Fine Art.",""]],"88":[[1,"166","9","Healthcare System Reform and Basic Healthcare Expansion","We will deepen reform of the healthcare system.",""],[1,"166","10","Integrated Healthcare and Public Hospital Reform","We will coordinate medical services, medical insurance, and pharmaceutical reforms, promote the separation of medical care from pharmacy operations, and establish a sound basic healthcare system covering all citizens.",""],[1,"166","10","Comprehensive Public Hospital Reform","We will execute comprehensive reform of all public hospitals to see that they are there to serve the public without having to make a profit, their operational costs are lowered, and markups on pharmaceuticals are gradually eliminated.",""],[1,"167","1","Public Hospital Management and Compensation Reform","We will establish modern hospital management systems, see that public hospitals act as independent legal persons, and establish staffing and remuneration systems suited to the particular characteristics of the healthcare industry.",""],[1,"167","1","Essential Medicines and Pharmaceutical Logistics Reform","We will improve the system of essential medicines, deepen reform of logistics systems for pharmaceuticals and consumables, and improve medicine supply mechanisms.",""],[1,"167","1","Health Innovation and Insurance Medicines Inclusion","We will encourage the research and development of new medicines, and give precedence to newly developed medicines available on the market and medicines that have passed evaluations for consistency in adding to the catalogue of medicines covered by healthcare insurance.",""],[1,"167","1","Private and Nonprofit Healthcare Participation Policy","We will encourage nongovernmental actors to provide healthcare services and see that nonprofit private hospitals enjoy treatment equal to that of public hospitals.",""],[1,"167","1","Healthcare Oversight and Patient Relations Improvement","We will strengthen oversight over the healthcare industry across the board, improve the quality of health care, and ensure that health care is safe.",""],[1,"167","1","Medical Practitioner Work Environment and Dispute Mediation","We will create a better work environment for medical practitioners, and improve mechanisms for mediating disputes between them and patients to facilitate more amicable relations.",""]],"89":[[1,"172","7","Free Maternal and Child Health Information Handbooks","Provide free maternal and child health information handbooks;",""],[1,"172","8","Free Pre-Pregnancy Health Examination Programme","Make free pre-pregnancy health exams available to all women to help ensure the birth of healthy babies;",""],[1,"172","9","Free Childhood Vaccination under the National Immunization Plan","Give free vaccines to children within the scope of the national immunization plan;",""],[1,"172","10","Free Maternal and Infant Care Services","Provide free maternal and infant care services;",""],[1,"172","11","Cervical and Breast Cancer Screening Expansion","Expand the scope of cervical and breast cancer screenings;",""],[1,"172","12","Maternal and Infant Healthcare and Family Planning Services Program","Implement a program to ensure maternal and infant healthcare and family planning services;",""],[1,"172","12","Emergency Care Capacity for Mothers and Newborns","Strengthen our capacity for treating emergencies and serious conditions in prenatal and postnatal women and newborns;",""],[1,"172","13","Maternal Health Capacity Expansion","Increase the number of hospital beds for childbirths by 89,000 and the number of obstetricians and midwives by 140,000.",""],[1,"172","14","Comprehensive Birth Defects Screening and Prevention Program","Include screening for 20 complications including Down syndrome, deafness, and thalassemia as well as congenital heart disease in the plan for the comprehensive prevention and control of birth defects;",""],[1,"172","15","Birth Defect Detection and Treatment Initiative","Strive to see that conditions within the scope of this plan are detected and treated so as to effectively reduce the incidence of birth defects.",""],[1,"176","27","Pre-Pregnancy Health Examination Service","Free pre-pregnancy health examinations;",""],[1,"176","30","Family Planning Guidance and Consultation Services","Guidance and consultation services regarding family planning methods;",""],[1,"185","1","Reproductive, Maternal, Newborn, Child Health and Early Childhood Services","We will provide better public services related to reproductive health and maternal, newborn, and child health as well as to childcare and early childhood education.",""],[1,"185","1","Lifecycle Family Services Expansion","We will ensure that services are available throughout the entire process of having and raising children.",""],[1,"188","9","School-Based Tuberculosis and HIV/AIDS Prevention and Treatment","Strengthen the prevention and treatment of tuberculosis and HIV/AIDS in schools.",""]],"90":[[1,"171","2","Food Safety Strategy Implementation","We will implement the food safety strategy.",""],[1,"171","2","Food Safety Law and Regulation Reform","We will improve food safety laws and regulations, raise food safety standards, focus greater effort on addressing food safety problems at the source, require all food enterprises to assume responsibility for food safety, exercise grid-based oversight, increase the frequency of inspections and the coverage of sample- based monitoring, and achieve product traceability throughout the whole production chain.",""],[1,"171","2","Model Food Safety Cities Development","We will develop model food safety cities.",""],[1,"171","2","Pharmaceutical and Medical Device Approval Reform","We will deepen reform of the evaluation and approval system for pharmaceuticals and medical appliances and explore reform of evaluation institutions based on an independent corporate governance model.",""],[1,"171","2","Pharmaceutical Enterprise Management by Level and Type","We will promote management of pharmaceutical enterprises by level and by type.",""],[1,"171","2","Food and Medicine Safety Governance System Upgrade","We will accelerate improvements to the food regulatory system and build a sound governance system for food and medicine safety that is thorough, efficient, and based on co-governance by social actors.",""],[1,"171","2","Rural Food and Medicine Safety Oversight","We will step up food and medicine safety governance in rural areas and improve oversight over online",""],[1,"172","1","Tighter Oversight of Imported Food and Medicine","We will conduct tighter oversight over imported food and medicine.",""]],"91":[[1,"168","2","Public Healthcare Service Improvement and Expansion","We will improve both basic and major national public healthcare service programs and provide better quality services in a more efficient and equitable way.",""],[1,"168","2","Community-Level Public Healthcare Capacity Strengthening","We will strengthen capacity for providing public healthcare services at the community level.",""],[1,"168","2","Maternal, Infant, Tumor, Mental Health, and Pediatrics Capacity Development","We will strengthen capabilities development in areas in need of attention such as maternal and infant healthcare, public healthcare, tumor and mental illness prevention and treatment, and pediatrics.",""],[1,"168","2","Comprehensive Chronic Disease Prevention and Control Strategy","We will implement a comprehensive strategy for the effective prevention and control of chronic diseases such as cardiovascular, brain, and vascular diseases as well as diabetes, malignant tumors, respiratory disease, and mental illness.",""],[1,"168","2","Major Communicable Disease Prevention and Control Programme","We will strengthen the prevention and control of major communicable diseases by working to lower prevalence of hepatitis B among the general population, keep HIV prevalence low, reduce the incidence rate of tuberculosis to 58 cases per 100,000 people, basically eradicate schistosomiasis, and eliminate malaria and leprosy.",""],[1,"168","2","Localized Disease Prevention and Control","We will ensure that work on the prevention and control of major localized diseases is carried out to proper effect.",""],[1,"168","2","Port Health Quarantine Capacity Strengthening","We will strengthen quarantine capabilities at ports of entry to keep out major communicable diseases.",""],[1,"168","2","Occupational Disease Survey and Prevention Programme","We will conduct surveys on and ensure the prevention and control of occupational diseases.",""],[1,"168","2","Free Special Medicines Supply for HIV/AIDS and Other Diseases","We will provide greater free supplies of special medicines for the prevention and treatment of HIV/AIDS and other diseases.",""],[1,"168","2","Universal Health Education Campaign","We will strengthen efforts to provide health education for everyone so as to spread health- related awareness and knowledge.",""],[1,"168","2","Public Smoking Ban Enforcement","We will make a major push to prohibit smoking in public places.",""],[1,"168","2","Patriotic Health Campaigns and Urban Health Improvement","We will step up patriotic health campaigns and efforts to improve the level of urban health.",""],[1,"168","2","National Nutrition Plan Development","We will strengthen efforts to work out a national nutrition plan and the provision of psychological health services.",""],[1,"169","1","Hospital Childbirth Assistance and Free Maternal Healthcare Services","We will implement an assistance program for hospital childbirths and provide pregnant and postnatal women with free, basic healthcare services throughout every stage of childbirth.",""],[1,"169","1","Birth Defects Prevention and Treatment System","We will strengthen the comprehensive prevention and treatment of birth defects and establish a system for providing free services covering all citizens for the prevention and treatment of birth defects during pre-pregnancy, prenatal, and neonatal stages.",""],[1,"169","1","Maternal and Child Health Service Capacity Improvement","We will comprehensively improve capacity for providing maternal and infant healthcare services, step up efforts to prevent and control major diseases affecting women and children, increase screening rates and early diagnosis and treatment rates for common gynecological diseases, and strengthen childhood disease prevention and treatment and childhood injury prevention.",""],[1,"169","1","Child Nutrition Improvement and Newborn Screening Project","We will fully implement the project to improve child nutrition and increase newborn screening in poor areas.",""],[1,"172","2","Expansion of Free Basic Public Healthcare Services","Gradually increase the range of free basic public healthcare services available to all citizens;",""],[1,"172","3","Severe Disease Prevention and Treatment Capacity Expansion","Increase capacity to prevent and treat severe, difficult, and complicated diseases including cardiovascular, brain, and vascular diseases, cancer, and chronic respiratory diseases;",""],[1,"172","5","Emergency Medical and Public Health Capacity Strengthening","Strengthen capabilities regarding emergency medical assistance, disease prevention and control, mental health care, blood donation centers, and health oversight;",""],[1,"172","6","Medical Specialty Development Support","Support development in both key and weak areas including pediatrics, tumor, cardiovascular, brain, and vascular diseases, diabetes, mental illnesses, communicable diseases, and occupational diseases.",""]],"92":[[1,"64","14","Medical Diagnostic and Treatment Equipment R&D Programme","Focus efforts on the research and development of diagnostic and treatment equipment such as nuclear medicine imaging equipment, superconducting magnetic resonance imaging systems, and non-invasive ventilators as well as in vitro diagnostic equipment such as fully automatic biochemistry analyzers and high-throughput genomic sequencers;",""],[1,"64","15","Medical Equipment and Implantable Devices Deployment","Develop and put into use medical accelerators and other treatment equipment as well as implantable and insertable medical devices, such as artificial heart valves and pacemakers, stents, and artificial joints;",""],[1,"65","1","Development and Deployment of Traditional Chinese Medicine Medical Devices","Develop and put into use medical devices that utilize the distinctive strengths of traditional Chinese medicine.",""]],"93":[[1,"169","2","Medical Service System Integration and Tiered Care Reform","We will optimize the structure of our medical institution systems, promoting integration of functions and innovations in services.",""],[1,"169","2","Integrated Public Health Coordination and Referral System","We will strengthen divisions of labor and coordination between specialized public health institutions, community-level medical and healthcare institutions, and hospitals by improving the medical service system to better ensure cooperation, coordination, and complementarity between institutions at different levels.",""],[1,"169","2","Community Health Service Model Upgrade","We will improve the community-level medical service model, make headway in improving the capacity of general practitioners (family practitioners), advance the use of electronic health records, and put into effect a healthcare model based on households directly contracting with family practitioners for service.",""],[1,"169","2","Tiered Medical Diagnosis and Treatment System","We will fully establish a tiered medical diagnosis and treatment system.",""],[1,"169","2","Community Medical Service Network and Incentive Reform","With an emphasis on raising the capacity of community-level medical services, we will improve service networks, operational mechanisms, and incentive mechanisms and implement differentiated medical insurance payout and pricing systems.",""],[1,"170","1","Integrated Medical Referral and Tiered Care System","we see that a system is basically put in place whereby a patient's initial diagnosis takes place at a community-level institution, referrals are made between medical institutions, medical institutions at different levels cooperate with each other, and different approaches are adopted in the treatment of acute and chronic diseases.",""],[1,"170","1","Healthcare Workforce Strengthening Program","We will strengthen the ranks of healthcare workers by implementing a program to ensure that we have the medical personnel needed to cater to the healthcare needs of all members of society, putting in place a plan to train and make use of general practitioners and pediatricians, and improving standardized resident physician training programs.",""],[1,"170","1","Medical Resource Redistribution to Underserved Regions","We will encourage more medical resources to flow to the central and western regions, community-level institutions, and rural areas by improving working environments and salaries for those in the medical profession.",""],[1,"170","1","Doctor Multi-Point Practice Reform","We will improve the system for allowing doctors to work at more than one medical institution.",""],[1,"170","1","Clinical Pathways Implementation","We will put clinical pathways into full practice.",""],[1,"170","1","Health Information and Telemedicine Upgrade","We will raise the capacity for health information services and big data applications, develop telemedicine, and promote smarter health care.",""]],"95":[[1,"67","12","Industrial Application of Key Clean Energy Technologies","Make breakthroughs in and promote the industrial application of key technologies such as next generation photovoltaics, high-efficiency, high-wattage wind power generation, biomass energy, hydrogen power and fuel cells, smart grids, and new types of energy storage devices;",""],[1,"67","13","Distributed New Energy Utilization Initiative","Facilitate the comprehensive utilization of distributed new energy",""],[1,"84","2","Energy Revolution Advancement and Modern Energy System Development","We will make a strong push to advance the energy revolution, giving impetus to a transformation in the way energy is produced and used, improving the energy supply mix, and elevating the efficiency of energy utilization.",""],[1,"84","3","Hydropower Development with Ecological Conservation","We will coordinate the development of hydropower with ecological conservation while giving priority to the latter; and with a focus on building main hydropower plants in key water basins, we will work systematically to develop hydropower resources in the southwest.",""],[1,"84","3","Wind, Solar, Biomass, and Solar Thermal Energy Expansion","We will continue to give impetus to the development of wind and photovoltaic power and provide strong support for solar thermal energy.",""],[1,"84","3","Coastal Nuclear Power Plant Belt and Safety Measures","Focusing particularly on the building of a coastal nuclear power plant belt, we will ensure adequate safety measures are taken in developing demonstration initiatives and projects in nuclear power generation.",""],[1,"84","3","Biomass, Geothermal, and Tidal Power Development","We will accelerate the development of biomass and geothermal energy and actively exploit tidal power in coastal areas.",""],[1,"84","3","Supportive Policies for Renewable Power Generation","We will improve supportive policies for power generation from wind, solar, and biomass energy.",""],[1,"84","3","National Comprehensive Energy Center Optimization","We will optimize the development of national comprehensive energy centers and step up efforts to ensure the cleaner and more efficient use of coal.",""],[1,"84","3","Coal Resource Zoning and Cleaner Coal Transformation","We will restrict coal resource development in the east of the country, limit it in the central and northeastern regions, and optimize it in the west; make progress in achieving more eco-friendly exploitation and transformations of large coal production centers; and encourage the application of new technologies in the development of coal based power generation.",""],[1,"84","3","Oil, Gas, and Natural Gas Exploration Expansion","We will strengthen onshore and offshore oil and gas exploration and exploitation, take well- ordered measures to relax control over mining rights, and actively exploit natural gas,",""],[1,"85","1","Oil Refining Industry Transformation and Upgrading Plan","We will move forward with the transformation and upgrading of the oil refining industry, implement an action plan for improving the quality of refined petroleum products, and develop new clean oils such as biofuels.",""],[1,"85","3","Smart Energy Sector Development","We will accelerate smart development across the entire energy sector and all areas of its operation in order to make energy development more sustainable and adaptable.",""],[1,"85","3","Distributed Energy and Demand-Side Management Upgrade","We will adapt to the development of distributed energy and the diversified demands of users, improve demand-side management of electric power, speed up the development of smart power grids, and make power grids and the power generation and demand sides more mutually responsive.",""],[1,"85","3","Energy Internet and Cross-Sector Infrastructure Integration","We will promote significant integration of new technologies between the energy sector and other sectors such as information technology; coordinate the development of energy infrastructure and communications, transportation, and other infrastructure; and build an energy internet that enables the",""],[1,"86","2","Peak Shaving Power Source Development","Speed up the development of quality peak shaving power sources such as pumped-storage hydroelectric plants, main hydropower plants, and natural gas peaking power plants;",""],[1,"86","2","Storage and Efficient Power Plant Demonstration Projects","Give impetus to the development of storage power plant and efficient power plant demonstration projects;",""],[1,"86","3","Power Source and Storage Integration Strengthening","Strengthen integration and complementarity between different power sources and storage facilities;",""],[1,"86","4","Power System Adaptation and Efficiency Improvement","Make power systems more adaptive and efficient.",""],[1,"86","5","Coal-Based Power Generation Energy Conservation and Emissions Reduction Upgrading Plan","Implement the upgrading action plan for energy conservation and emissions reductions in coal based power generation:",""],[1,"86","6","Nationwide Coal-Fired Power Unit Upgrade Programme","Carry out nationwide upgrades of coal-fired power units to achieve ultra-low emissions and energy efficiency;",""],[1,"86","8","Backpressure Thermal Power Heating and Multi-Source Energy Systems","Encourage the use of backpressure thermal power units for heating and develop combined multi-source heating, cooling, and power systems;",""],[1,"86","9","Coal-Based Power Generation Expansion","Increase the proportion of coal used for power generation.",""],[1,"86","10","Regular Hydropower Capacity Construction","Begin construction on 60 gigawatts of regular hydropower capacity, giving priority to hydropower development in the southwest;",""],[1,"86","11","End-Use Energy Market and Transmission Route Coordination","Coordinate the development of end-use markets and power transmission routes; take ordered steps to optimize the development of wind energy and photovoltaic energy in the northern, northeastern, and northwestern regions and in coastal areas;",""],[1,"86","12","Dispersed Wind Power and Distributed Photovoltaic Development","Accelerate the development of dispersed wind power and distributed photovoltaic power in the central, eastern, and southern regions;",""],[1,"86","13","Solar Thermal Energy Demonstration Projects","Carry out solar thermal energy demonstration projects;",""],[1,"86","14","National New Energy Integrated Demonstration Zone Development","Build the national new energy integrated demonstration zone in Ningxia, and actively move forward with the development of demonstration zones for renewable energy such as those in Qinghai and Zhangjiakou.",""],[1,"86","15","Sanmen and Haiyang AP1000 Nuclear Power Project Completion","Complete the Sanmen and Haiyang AP1000 projects;",""],[1,"86","16","Hualong-1 Nuclear Technology Demonstration Projects","Develop demonstration projects for Hualong-1 nuclear technology in Fuqing, Fujian and in Fangchenggang, Guangxi;",""],[1,"86","16","CAP1400 Nuclear Demonstration Project Construction","Begin construction on the CAP1400 demonstration project in Rongcheng, Shandong;",""],[1,"86","17","Coastal Nuclear Power Plant Construction","Begin construction on a number of coastal nuclear power plants",""],[1,"87","1","Tianwan Nuclear Power Plant Phase III Construction","accelerate construction on the third phase of the Tianwan nuclear power plant;",""],[1,"87","2","Preliminary Work for Inland Nuclear Power Plant Projects","Actively carry out preliminary work for inland nuclear power plant projects;",""],[1,"87","3","Feasibility Studies and Large Commercial Reprocessing Plant Development","Move more quickly to conduct feasibility studies and drive forward the development of large commercial reprocessing plants;",""],[1,"87","4","Nuclear Power Capacity Expansion","Installed capacity of nuclear power plants in operation will reach 58 gigawatts, with over 30 gigawatts of nuclear-generation capacity under construction;",""],[1,"87","4","Nuclear Fuel Supply System Development","Strengthen the development of systems for ensuring nuclear fuel.",""],[1,"87","5","Coal Seam Gas Industrial Base Development","Build coal seam gas industrial bases in: § the Qinshui Basin;",""],[1,"87","7","Shale Gas Exploration and Exploitation Acceleration","Accelerate the exploration and exploitation of shale gas in: § the Changning-Weiyuan region, Sichuan; § Fuling, Chongqing;",""],[1,"87","9","Tight Oil, Oil Sands, and Deep-Water Oil Development Programme","Give impetus to tight oil, oil sands, and deep-water oil prospecting and exploitation and to the comprehensive development and utilization of oil shale;",""],[1,"87","9","Natural Gas Hydrate Prospecting and Pilot Production Programme","Move forward with the prospecting and commercial pilot production of natural gas hydrate resources.",""],[1,"102","11","Expansion of New Energy Supply Systems","Spreading the use of supply systems for new energy such as distributed energy resources and shallow geothermal energy;",""],[1,"103","4","Renewable Energy Development and Clean Energy Demonstration Towns and Villages","Develop renewable energy suited to local circumstances and develop clean energy demonstration towns and villages;",""]],"96":[[1,"85","2","Integrated Energy Transportation and Storage Network Development","We will coordinate the development of multiple forms of transportation for coal, electricity, oil, and gas; step up efforts to build energy storage and peak shaving facilities; and move faster to develop safe and reliable modern energy storage and transportation networks which enable integrated energy development and free-flowing domestic and international energy transportation.",""],[1,"85","2","Trans-Regional Energy Transport Corridor Construction","We will strengthen efforts to build trans-regional core energy transportation networks; complete construction on the Inner Mongolia- Jiangxi north-to-south coal line; and optimize the construction of main power grids and trans-regional power transmission routes.",""],[1,"85","2","Oil and Gas Import Corridor and Storage Expansion","We will accelerate the construction of strategic land corridors for importing oil and gas.",""],[1,"87","10","Electricity Transmission Route Construction for Power Bases","Build electricity transmission routes for hydropower bases and large coal- fired power bases and, while building the 12 power transmission routes included in the action plan for air pollution prevention and control, focus on constructing power transmission routes from the southwestern, northwestern, northern, and northeastern regions;",""],[1,"87","11","Strategic Land Corridor and Trunk Pipeline Development","Step up work on the development of strategic land corridors for importing oil and gas and related trunk pipeline networks in the northwestern, northeastern, and southwestern regions;",""],[1,"87","12","Natural Gas Transmission Pipeline Network Expansion","Improve the backbone pipeline networks for natural gas transmission, including the west-to-east gas transmission project, the Shaanxi-Beijing gas pipeline, and the project to transport natural gas from Sichuan to the central and eastern regions.",""],[1,"87","13","State Petroleum Reserves Project Phase II Completion","Complete the second phase of the state petroleum reserves project",""],[1,"87","13","Follow-up Petroleum Reserves Project Preparation","start preliminary work for the follow-up project",""],[1,"87","14","Refined Oil Products Reserve Building","Strengthen work on building reserves for refined oil products;",""],[1,"87","15","Natural Gas Reserve and Peak-Shaving Capacity Expansion","Build natural gas reserves, increasing the scale of gas storage and emergency response capacity for gas peak shaving;",""],[1,"87","15","Coal Storage, Transport, and Emergency Reserve System","Build coal storage and transportation facilities in areas where coal is in short supply and in coal distribution centers, and improve the emergency coal reserve system;",""],[1,"88","1","Natural Uranium Reserve Expansion","Increase the scale of natural uranium reserves.",""]],"97":[[1,"33","2","Foreign Trade Transformation and Export Competitiveness Upgrade","we will speed up the shift in the way we develop foreign trade, optimize the trade mix, and ensure exports better stimulate growth.",""],[1,"33","2","Export-Intensive Industry Competitiveness Enhancement","We will move faster to make our export-intensive industries more internationally competitive in terms of their technology, standards, brand names, quality, and services; encourage the export of high-end equipment; and increase the use of high technology and the value-added of our exports.",""],[1,"33","2","Services Export Expansion and Outsourcing Coordination","We will expand the export of services, improve after-sale maintenance and repair services, and coordinate the development of onshore and offshore outsourcing.",""],[1,"33","2","SME Export Support Expansion","We will increase support to the exports of micro, small, and medium enterprises.",""],[1,"143","1","Foreign Trade Quality Upgrade Strategy","We will implement a strategy of importing and exporting to our best advantage, promote a transformation in foreign trade toward better quality exports that command higher prices, optimize the mix of imports and exports, and work faster to build China into a trader of quality.",""],[1,"143","1","Trade in Services Expansion Programme","We will promote the integrated development of trade in goods and trade in services, greatly promote trade in producer services, and see to it that the volume of trade in services accounts for at least 16% of total foreign trade.",""],[1,"143","1","Processing Trade Innovation Support","We will consolidate and improve on our traditional export strengths and encourage more innovation in the development of processing trade.",""],[1,"143","1","Export Market Diversification Strategy","We will improve the structure of foreign trade by promoting diversification in export markets and increasing the proportion of emerging markets while maintaining the share of traditional ones.",""],[1,"143","1","New Trade Forms and Export Credit Insurance Development","We will encourage the development of new types of trade and work to develop export credit insurance.",""],[1,"143","1","Import Expansion and Structure Improvement","We will actively work to increase imports and improve the import structure by importing a greater amount of advanced technology, advanced equipment, and high- quality consumer goods.",""],[1,"143","1","Trade Friction Early Warning and Response Mechanism","We will actively respond to foreign technical barriers to trade, improve early warnings of possible trade friction, and defuse trade tensions and disputes.",""]],"98":[[1,"193","2","Mainstream Media Development and Integration Reform","We will strengthen the development of the mainstream media to improve its guidance on public communication and strengthen its credibility, influence, and communicative effectiveness.",""],[1,"193","3","Online Content and Cyber Culture Promotion","We will work to see that online content is improved, enrich cyber culture, encourage the creation of excellent original works and develop online literature and art and a positive cyber culture.",""],[1,"193","3","Online Communication Methods and Public Opinion Guidance","We will create new methods of online communication to better fit the nature of online media and improve analysis and guidance capabilities with respect to online public opinion.",""],[1,"193","3","Differentiated Regulation of Online Operators","We will differentiate management based on the type of online operator and ensure online operators strengthen their sense of social responsibility.",""],[1,"193","3","Civilized Online Behavior and Clean Internet Environment Initiative","We will promote the civilized running of websites and civilized surfing, promote proper online behavior among young people, advocate online public-benefit activities, and clean up the online environment.",""],[1,"194","1","Cultural Management System Reform","We will improve the cultural management system which, under the leadership of Party committees, is comprised of regulation by the government, industry self- governance, public oversight, and the law-based operation of cultural enterprises and public institutions.",""],[1,"194","1","Public-Interest Cultural Institution Reform","We will deepen reform of public-interest cultural institutions.",""],[1,"194","1","Modern Corporate System Development for Cultural Enterprises","We will encourage cultural enterprises to build a modern corporate system appropriate for the sector.",""],[1,"194","1","State-Owned Cultural Asset Management Reform","We will improve systems for managing state-owned assets in the cultural sector.",""],[1,"194","1","Private Investment Access for Cultural Industry","We will lower the threshold for nongovernmental investors to participate in the cultural industry and encourage the development of non- public cultural enterprises.",""],[1,"194","1","Special Right Shares Pilot in Media Enterprises","We will conduct trials of special right shares in news, publishing, and media enterprises.",""],[1,"194","1","Modern Cultural Market System Development","We will improve the modern cultural market system and implement and improve economic policies in the cultural sector.",""],[1,"194","1","Cultural Market Oversight and Coordinated Law Enforcement","We will expand efforts to combat pornography and illegal publications, strengthen market oversight, and become better able to carry out coordinated law enforcement.",""],[1,"197","15","Strengthening Key News and Media Outlets","Strengthen key news and media outlets;",""],[1,"197","18","New Media for Government Communications","Develop new media for communicating government affairs;",""]],"100":[[1,"180","13","Interdepartmental Data Sharing Acceleration","Accelerate data sharing among different departments;",""],[1,"184","2","Public Welfare Institution Reform","We will accelerate the reform of public welfare institutions, improve welfare facilities, optimize welfare distribution, and promote welfare resource sharing.",""],[1,"198","1","Social Governance Institutional Capacity Strengthening","We will strengthen efforts to develop the basic institutions for social governance, see that everyone contributes to and benefits from social governance, and work to increase social governance capabilities and effectiveness",""],[1,"198","2","Social Governance System Improvement","We will improve the social governance system to help see that Party committees play a leadership role, government plays a guiding role, social organizations play a cooperative role, the general public participates, and the rule of law acts as a guarantee",""],[1,"198","3","Government Governance Modernization and Social Governance Improvement","We will develop a new concept of government governance, strengthening rule of law awareness and service mentality, and ensuring that service is implicit in management and that services facilitate management.",""],[1,"198","3","Modern Technology for Social Governance","make full use of modern science and technology to improve social governance methods, work to make social governance more refined, and step up efforts to address problems at the source, exercise dynamic management, respond to",""],[1,"199","1","Government Information Release System Improvement","We will improve the system for the release of government information.",""],[1,"199","1","Local Government Service Delivery Capacity Strengthening","We will ensure that local governments improve their ability to provide services.",""],[1,"199","1","National Population Information Database","We will establish a national database of basic population information",""],[1,"199","1","Population Management Institutional Development","strengthen institutional development with respect to population management, real- name registration, credit rating systems, and crisis early warning and intervention.",""],[1,"199","1","Government Social Governance Accountability Mechanism","We will work to improve appraisal and accountability mechanisms for government social governance.",""],[1,"199","2","Community Governance and Integrated Service Improvement","We will work to improve the community governance system in both urban and rural areas, delineate according to law the powers and responsibilities of community- level governments and community organizations, and establish mechanisms for coordinated action between communities, social organizations, and social workers.",""],[1,"199","2","Integrated Community Service Platform Upgrade","We will improve management platforms for integrated community services in both urban and rural areas, promote interconnectedness between public services, convenience services, and volunteer services, and work to provide one-stop services.",""],[1,"199","2","Urban and Rural Community Facility Expansion","We will make sure that integrated community service facilities are established in all urban communities and will make progress in developing such facilities in rural areas.",""],[1,"199","2","Community Worker Professional Development","We will work to improve the professional competence of community workers.",""],[1,"199","2","Volunteer Registration Expansion","We will work to see the proportion of registered volunteers reach 13% of residents.",""],[1,"200","2","Social Norms Development and Community Governance Framework","We will strengthen the development of social norms such as industry standards, social organization charters, citizens' codes of conduct, and community conventions, and give full impetus to the positive role that social norms play in coordinating social relations and governing social behavior.",""]],"101":[[1,"185","1","Family Planning Policy Reform and Service Improvement","We will uphold the basic state policy on family planning and allow all couples to have two children.",""],[1,"185","1","Family Planning Service Management Reform","We will reform and improve the management of family planning services and improve birth registration service systems.",""],[1,"185","1","Policy Alignment for Two-Child Family Policy","We will make sure that relevant economic and social policies are effectively adapted to the policy of allowing all couples to have two children.",""],[1,"185","1","Skewed Birth Gender Ratio Response Strategy","We will adopt a comprehensive approach to addressing the problem of the skewed birth gender ratio.",""]],"102":[[1,"55","2","Agricultural Information Technology Integration Initiative","We will promote the integration of information technology into agricultural production management, operations management, market distribution, and fields related to resources and the environment.",""],[1,"55","2","Internet of Things Pilot for Agriculture","We will help spread the Internet of Things into agriculture by carrying out an experimental project to promote its use in certain regions, thereby promoting the development of intelligent agriculture and precision agriculture.",""],[1,"55","2","Agricultural Big Data and Information Services Strengthening","We will promote the use of big data in agriculture and strengthen the overall capabilities of agricultural information services.",""],[1,"55","2","Agricultural Service Platform and E-Commerce Development","We will encourage internet enterprises to establish agricultural service platforms that bring together the processes of production and marketing, and accelerate the development of agriculture-related e- commerce.",""],[1,"58","12","Internet Plus Modern Agriculture Initiative","Introduce \"Internet +\" modern agriculture, facilitate the adoption of the Internet of Things in field planting, livestock and poultry production, and fishery operations, and support e-commerce, logistics, commercial, trade, and financial enterprises in participating in the development of e-commerce platforms for farmers, rural areas, and agriculture;",""]],"103":[[1,"203","3","Comprehensive Workplace Safety Governance System","We will establish a comprehensive governance system for workplace safety featuring complete coverage in term s of responsibility, all- encompassing management, and oversight over the entire production process, and we will create a permanent workplace safety mechanism.",""],[1,"203","3","Workplace Safety Responsibility and Assessment Mechanisms","We will improve and implement responsibility and assessment mechanisms as well as management systems for workplace safety, ensuring that both Party committees and governments assume responsibility, officials perform",""],[1,"204","1","Workplace Safety Law and Regulatory Reform","We will work more quickly to formulate and revise workplace safety laws, regulations, and standards.",""],[1,"204","1","Workplace Safety Evaluation and Risk Control Reform","We will reform the safety evaluation system; improve multi-party mechanisms for risk control, safety hazard identification and correction, and early warning and emergency response; step up regulation and law enforcement efforts over workplace safety and occupational health; and work to curb the frequent occurrence of major and serious workplace accidents.",""],[1,"204","1","Workplace Safety Information Technology and Emergency Capacity Upgrade","We will strengthen systems for identifying, preventing, and dealing with safety hazards, promote the use of information technology in workplace safety regulation, increase emergency rescue capabilities, and build capacity in respect to workplace safety inspection and oversight.",""],[1,"204","1","Hazardous Chemical Plant and Warehouse Relocation Initiative","We will implement initiatives to relocate hazardous chemical plants and warehouses to ensure safe and eco-friendly production and storage of chemicals.",""],[1,"204","1","Critical Infrastructure Safety Monitoring and Protection","We will strengthen basic capabilities for workplace safety such as networks for preventing and managing traffic accidents and step up efforts to monitor and protect the safety of important infrastructure such as telecommunications, power grids, roads, bridges, water supply facilities, and pipelines for oil and gas transmission.",""],[1,"204","1","Workplace Safety Awareness Campaign","We will work to make society as a whole more safety conscious.",""]],"105":[[1,"204","2","Comprehensive Disaster Prevention and Response System Strengthening","we will work to strengthen comprehensive prevention capabilities with respect to floods, droughts, and earthquakes as well as other meteorological, geological, and marine disasters.",""],[1,"204","2","Disaster Prevention, Mitigation, and Response System Reform","We will refine disaster prevention, mitigation, and response systems, improving disaster investigation, assessment, monitoring, early warning, prevention, and emergency response systems.",""],[1,"204","2","Urban Emergency Shelter Construction","We will construct more emergency shelters in urban areas.",""],[1,"204","2","Relief Supply Stockpiling and Resource Coordination System","We will improve the system for stockpiling relief supplies and improve ability to use resources in a more coordinated way.",""],[1,"204","2","Catastrophe Insurance System Establishment","We will accelerate the establishment of a catastrophe insurance system.",""],[1,"204","2","Compensation Policies for Emergency Relief and Requisitioned Assets","We will formulate policies on compensation for nongovernmental emergency relief services, compensation for requisitioned materials and equipment, and",""],[1,"205","1","Disaster Prevention and Mitigation Drills and Awareness Campaigns","We will carry out extensive drills as well as publicity and educational campaigns for disaster prevention and mitigation.",""]],"107":[[1,"36","2","Non-Public Sector Regulatory Liberalization","We will abolish all unreasonable regulations within the non-public sector, remove all hidden barriers to its development, and ensure that it has equal access to factors of production, participates in market competition on an equal footing, receives equal legal protection, and performs its social responsibilities alongside other sectors.",""],[1,"36","2","Private Enterprise Market Entry Expansion","We will encourage private enterprises to enter more sectors in accordance with the law.",""],[1,"37","3","Unified Open Market System Development","We will accelerate the development of a unified and open market system that ensures orderly competition, establish mechanisms for ensuring fair competition, overcome regional segmentation, break up industry monopolies, and remove market barriers in order to promote the free and orderly flow and equitable exchange of goods and factors of production.",""],[1,"38","1","Equal Employment System","We will coordinate human resource markets as a whole and implement an equal employment system.",""],[1,"38","1","Technology Exchange Platform Development","We will step up the development of technology exchange platforms, improve regulations concerning technology trading markets, and encourage the development of technology intermediary service organizations.",""],[1,"38","2","Price Control Liberalization and Pricing Reform","We will reduce government intervention in pricing, lift all price controls over goods and services in competitive industries, and lift price controls over competitive areas within the power, petroleum, natural gas, transportation, and telecommunications industries.",""],[1,"38","2","Medical, Water, Electricity, and Gas Pricing Reform","We will improve medical service pricing.",""],[1,"38","2","Tiered Household Utility Pricing Reform","We will improve tiered pricing for household electricity consumption and introduce, across the board, tiered pricing for household water and natural gas consumption.",""],[1,"38","2","Commodity Subsidy Pricing Mechanism Reform","We will refine the mechanisms for determining commodity price-linked subsidies.",""],[1,"38","2","Public Utility Investment and Price Adjustment Coordination Mechanism","We will establish a sound mechanism for coordinating government investment and price adjustments for public utilities and public-benefit services.",""],[1,"38","2","Pricing Compliance and Cost Oversight Strengthening","We will ensure that pricing complies with standardized procedures, that cost oversight and review are strengthened, and that costs are more transparent.",""],[1,"39","1","Unified Market and Fair Competition Reform","We will abolish all regulations and practices that impede the promotion of a unified market and fair competition.",""]],"108":[[1,"147","2","Belt and Road Cooperation Mechanism Enhancement","We will improve the bilateral and multilateral cooperation mechanisms of the Belt and Road Initiative focusing on policy communication, infrastructure connectivity, trade facilitation, capital flow, and people-to- people exchanges.",""],[1,"147","2","Belt and Road Transport and Customs Facilitation","We will increase cohesion between the development plans and technological standards of China and those of other countries along the routes of the Belt and Road Initiative, make further efforts to facilitate transport among countries along the routes, and simplify customs clearance procedures along the routes.",""],[1,"147","2","Diversified Project-Based Financing Model","We will establish a diversified, project- based financing model that includes the participation of enterprises and institutions with enterprises as the main actors and that is led by investment funds of various types.",""],[1,"147","2","International Financial Cooperation Platform Development","We will strengthen cooperation with international organizations including international financial organizations and institutions, work actively to promote the development of the Asian Infrastructure Investment Bank and the New Development Bank, put the Silk Road Fund to effective use, and attract international capital for the creation of a financial cooperation platform that is open, pluralistic, and mutually beneficial.",""],[1,"147","2","Overseas Chinese Friendship and Communication Network","We will give full play to the role of overseas Chinese, returned overseas Chinese, and the relatives of overseas Chinese who live in China in fostering bridges of communication and bonds of friendship.",""],[1,"147","3","International Economic Cooperation Corridor Development","We will actively advance the development of international economic cooperation corridors, such as the China-Mongolia-Russia corridor, the China-Central Asia-West Asia corridor, the China-Indochina Peninsula corridor, the new Eurasian Continental Bridge, the China-Pakistan corridor, and the Bangladesh-China-India-Myanmar corridor.",""],[1,"147","3","Neighboring Country Infrastructure Connectivity Expansion","We will increase infrastructure connectivity with neighboring countries and work with",""],[1,"148","1","Regional Infrastructure Connectivity and Logistics Corridor Development","We will strengthen international cooperation on energy and resources and production chains, and increase local processing and conversion.",""]],"111":[[1,"96","3","Urban Infrastructure Modernization Programme","We will create modern, safe, and efficient urban infrastructure systems with rational layouts, complete sets of facilities, and a full range of functions.",""],[1,"96","3","Urban Water Supply Upgrading Programme","We will accelerate the upgrading and building of urban water supply facilities.",""],[1,"96","3","Municipal Pipeline and Underground Infrastructure Upgrade","We will work faster to upgrade and build new municipal pipelines and other underground infrastructure.",""],[1,"96","3","Urban Roads, Parking, and Traffic Safety Improvement","We will step up efforts to improve urban roads, car parking and traffic safety facilities, and urban transport facilities for pedestrians and cyclists.",""],[1,"96","3","Accessible City Facilities Programme","We will move forward with building accessible facilities in all cities.",""],[1,"96","3","School and Kindergarten Co-development Compliance Enforcement","We will ensure strict compliance with regulations requiring that kindergartens and schools be developed to accompany the building of new residential areas and strict compliance with standards requiring that newly built residential communities come with parking spaces and charging facilities.",""],[1,"102","17","Trunk and Feeder Utility Tunnel Development","Move forward with the development of both trunk and feeder utility tunnels",""],[1,"103","2","Urban Underground Pipeline Network Upgrade","Upgrade urban underground pipeline networks for water supply, wastewater treatment, rainwater disposition, and gas and heating supply, and implement undergrounding initiatives for urban power lines and telecommunication network lines.",""]],"114":[[1,"190","2","Innovation Promotion Systems for Philosophy and Social Sciences","We will work for innovation in philosophy and the social sciences and develop the systems for promoting such innovation.",""],[1,"190","2","Academic Discipline and Theoretical Work Strengthening","We will strengthen platforms for theoretical work as well as the development of academic disciplines, and make further progress in implementing the Marxist Theory Research and Development Project.",""],[1,"190","2","Governance Research and Concept Development Initiative","We will step up efforts to research and explain new concepts, ideas, and strategies for the governance of the country.",""],[1,"190","2","Chinese Socialist Political Economy Development","We will develop the discipline of Chinese socialist political economy.",""],[1,"190","2","Top National Think Tank Development Initiative","We will prioritize efforts to build 50 to 100 top national think tanks.",""]],"115":[[1,"170","2","Traditional Chinese Medicine Healthcare Service System Improvement","We will improve the traditional Chinese medicine (TCM) healthcare service system by developing new TCM service models and raising capacity for providing community-level services.",""],[1,"170","2","TCM Clinical Research and Research Institution Strengthening","We will strengthen TCM clinical research centers and research institutions.",""],[1,"170","2","TCM Resource Survey, Protection, and Knowledge Database Development","We will conduct surveys of TCM resources, strengthen their protection, and create a database and knowledgebase of ancient writings on TCM.",""],[1,"170","2","TCM Standards Development Acceleration","We will work more quickly to develop TCM standards to help boost the TCM industry.",""],[1,"170","2","Medicinal Materials Seed and Seedling Development Centers","We will establish seed and seedling development centers for medicinal materials commonly used in TCM as well as those from specific areas or those that are endangered, and promote the green development of the medicinal herb growing industry.",""],[1,"170","2","Ethnic Minority Traditional Medicine Development Support","We will support the development of ethnic minority traditional medicine.",""],[1,"170","2","TCM Technology Adoption and Internationalization Support","We will promote the adoption of technologies suitable for use in TCM and help TCM services to go global.",""]],"116":[[1,"171","1","National Fitness Strategy","We will implement a fitness strategy to get the nation moving.",""],[1,"171","1","Public Sports Facilities Access and Upgrade Initiative","We will develop the physical activity field by strengthening venues and facilities for popular fitness activities and ensuring that public sports facilities are open either free of charge or at low cost to the public.",""],[1,"171","1","Youth Sports Promotion and Health Monitoring Programme","We will promote sports among young people, help them cultivate their sporting abilities and an interest in sports, popularize soccer, basketball, volleyball, and winter sports, and improve monitoring of the health of young people.",""],[1,"171","1","Work-Break Fitness Programme","We will encourage the implementation of work-break fitness programs, and help guide people toward exercising in a scientific way.",""],[1,"171","1","Recreational and Competitive Sports Development","We will promote the comprehensive and coordinated development of recreational and competitive sports.",""],[1,"171","1","Sports Industry Development Support for Nongovernmental Initiatives","We will encourage nongovernmental initiatives to develop the sports industry.",""],[1,"171","1","2022 Beijing Winter Olympic Games Preparations","We will ensure preparations go smoothly in the lead-up to the 2022 Beijing Winter Olympic Games.",""],[1,"173","12","Physical Fitness Testing Initiative","Step up physical fitness testing;",""],[1,"173","13","Fitness Guidance Services Promotion","Promote fitness guidance services;",""],[1,"173","14","Urban Fitness Facilities Construction Programme","Promote the construction of fitness facilities to see that such facilities can be reached within 15 minutes from anywhere in urban communities;",""],[1,"173","15","Community Sports Services Expansion","Work to see that community sports services are available to all permanent residents of towns and townships and that sports and fitness facility projects are available to all rural residents;",""],[1,"173","15","Public Sports Facilities Construction and Athlete Training","Strengthen the construction of public sports facilities including soccer fields and fitness centers as well as the training of reserve athletes.",""],[1,"177","24","Open Public Stadiums and Gymnasiums","Open public stadiums and gymnasiums;",""],[1,"188","7","Youth Sports and Physical Fitness Expansion","Expand sports activities for young people and ensure that at least 95% of our youth can meet physical standards;",""]],"117":[[1,"136","13","Climate Change Mitigation and Adaptation Action","we will take active steps to control carbon emissions, fulfill our commitments for emissions reduction, increase our capability to adapt to climate change, and fully participate in global climate governance",""],[1,"137","1","Industrial Low-Carbon Emissions Control and Transition Programme","We will bring carbon emissions in power, steel, building materials, chemical, and other major carbon-emitting industries under effective control, and promote low-carbon development in industry, energy, construction, transport, and other key sectors.",""],[1,"137","1","Regional Carbon Peak Pilot and Near-Zero Emissions Zone Demonstration","We will support leading development regions in becoming the first to reach their carbon dioxide emissions peak.",""],[1,"137","1","National Carbon Emissions Trading and MRV System","We will promote the establishment of a national carbon emissions trading scheme, and implement systems for carbon emissions reporting, inspection, verification, and quota management for major carbon-emitters.",""],[1,"137","1","Carbon Accounting, Evaluation, Accountability, and Standards Reform","We will improve statistical accounting, performance evaluation, and accountability systems as well as carbon emission standards.",""],[1,"137","1","Low-Carbon Technology and Product Expansion Initiative","We will step up efforts to expand the use of low- carbon technologies and products.",""],[1,"137","2","Climate Change Adaptation Action Plan","We will formulate and adjust technical standards in this regard at an appropriate time and put into effect an action plan for adapting to climate change.",""],[1,"137","2","Climate Change Observation, Research, and Early Warning Systems","We will strengthen systemic observation and research on climate change, improve systems for forecasting and giving early warnings, and become better able to respond to extreme weather conditions and climatic events.",""]],"124":[[1,"44","3","Macroprudential Regulation and Financial Regulatory Reform","We will strengthen the system of macroprudential regulation for the financial sector, step up planning and coordination, reform and improve the financial regulatory framework to see that it is better adapted to developments in modern financial markets,",""],[1,"45","1","Comprehensive Financial Risk Regulation and Supervision Framework","We will coordinate regulation of systemically important financial institutions, financial holding companies, and key financial infrastructure, integrate comprehensive financial sector statistics, and strengthen comprehensive and functional regulation.",""],[1,"45","1","Central and Local Financial Management System Improvement","We will improve central and local financial management systems.",""],[1,"45","1","Financial Consumer Protection and Conduct Oversight Framework","We will improve regulatory rules to ensure they are suited to the Chinese context and in accord with international standards, and establish frameworks for functional regulation targeted at each type of investment and financing behavior and for conduct oversight that genuinely protects the legitimate rights and interests of financial consumers, so as to achieve oversight that covers every aspect of financial risks.",""],[1,"45","1","State-Owned Financial Capital Management Reform","We will improve the management system for state- owned financial capital.",""],[1,"45","1","Foreign Exchange Reserve Management Optimization","We will strengthen the management of foreign exchange reserves and optimize their use.",""],[1,"45","1","Financial Risk Monitoring and Early Warning System","We will make effective use of and develop tools for financial risk management, and improve mechanisms for monitoring, early warning, stress testing, risk assessment and management, and market stability, so as to prevent the occurrence of systemic and regional financial risks.",""],[1,"45","21","National Financial Security Review Mechanisms","Create national financial security review mechanisms and counter-",""],[1,"46","1","Countercyclical Financial Risk Policy Tools","Establish countercyclical policy tools for guarding against systemic financial risks;",""],[1,"46","2","Financial Risk Monitoring and Emergency Response Mechanism","Establish a mechanism for consolidating statistics, risk monitoring and management, and emergency response and crisis rescue covering all financial institutions, financial holding companies, financial infrastructure, all types of investment and financing behavior, internet finance, and cross-border finance;",""],[1,"46","4","Financial Consumer Protection System Improvement","Improve systems that protect the rights and interests of financial consumers;",""],[1,"46","6","Deposit Insurance System Strengthening and Bank Resolution Reform","Allow the deposit insurance system to play a better role and improve the market-based disposition and exit mechanisms for failing financial institutions;",""],[1,"46","7","Collective Litigation and Financial Crime Enforcement Measures","Explore the possibility of a system for collective litigation, strengthen punishments for financial crimes, and crack down on illegal fundraising.",""],[1,"207","2","National Economic Security Safeguarding and Risk Response Mechanism","we will safeguard national economic security in areas such as strategic resources, key industries, finance and banking, and cross-border capital flow.",""],[1,"207","2","Dynamic Monitoring and Emergency Planning for Economic Risks","We will strengthen dynamic monitoring and analysis of key economic indicators and formulate an emergency plan for responding to risks in major economic sectors.",""],[1,"207","2","Fiscal and Financial Risk Coordination Framework","We will coordinate responses to fiscal and financial risks that arise as we work to address overcapacity, reduce commodity housing stock, and carry out debt deleveraging, thus working proactively to diffuse risks both in a controlled manner and at a controlled pace.",""],[1,"207","2","Financial Market Regulation and Risk Containment","We will strengthen regulation over and response to both unusual fluctuations and risk transference in the financial market and risks that come with new forms of financial business.",""],[1,"207","2","Unified Government Debt Management Reform","We will improve the unified management of government debt and work to see local government financing platforms become more market-based so as to effectively",""],[1,"208","1","Local Government Debt Risk Mitigation","defuse the risks posed by local government debt.",""],[1,"208","1","Banking Sector Non-Performing Asset Resolution Measures","We will ensure that there are more options for dealing with non-performing assets in the banking sector, improve tools and emergency plans for managing liquidity risks, and crack down hard on illegal fundraising.",""],[1,"208","1","Enterprise Debt Risk Monitoring","We will be on the alert for enterprise debt risks.",""],[1,"208","1","Risk Prevention and Control in Strategic Sectors","We will strengthen our ability to prevent and control risks in areas such as energy, mineral resources, water resources, grain, ecological conservation, environmental protection, workplace safety, and the internet.",""]],"125":[[1,"203","2","Comprehensive Public Security Net","We will keep firmly in mind the need to pursue safe development, give primacy to the interests of the people, strengthen awareness of security throughout society, improve public security systems, and put in place a comprehensive multidimensional public security net",""],[1,"205","2","Integrated Crime Prevention and Control System","We will work to improve the institutions and mechanisms for the comprehensive maintenance of law and order, accelerate the establishment of a multidimensional IT- based system for crime prevention and control, and put in place platforms for integrated, community-level management and services.",""],[1,"205","2","IT-Enabled Community Policing Reform","We will step up efforts to apply information technology in community-level police work, achieve concrete results in the field, ensure procedure-based law enforcement, and strengthen the professional organization of the police force.",""],[1,"205","2","Public-Police Crime Prevention Networks","We will build crime prevention and control networks based on public efforts as well as cooperation between the public and police, and accelerate the development of online systems for comprehensive crime prevention and control.",""],[1,"205","2","Joint Law and Order Operations","We will initiate joint law and order efforts and problem identification and resolution in key locations, sectors, and regions.",""],[1,"205","2","Crime, Drug, and Cult Suppression Capacity Strengthening","We will strengthen basic capabilities for cracking down on crime, fighting against drugs, and preventing and handling cults.",""]],"126":[[1,"215","1","Border and Coastal Defense Infrastructure Strengthening","We will strengthen infrastructure for border and coastal defense",""],[1,"215","2","Defense Mobilization Reform and Institutional Improvement","We will deepen defense mobilization reform and improve defense mobilization institutions and mechanisms.",""],[1,"215","2","Defense Awareness and Patriotism Education","We will work to use patriotism as a pivot for teaching people about defense so as to help raise awareness of the need for strong defense.",""],[1,"215","2","Reserve Force and Rapid Response Capacity Strengthening","We will strengthen our reserve forces, give high priority to the mobilization of forces for maritime operations, and improve capabilities for organization and mobilization, rapid response, and logistics to strengthen the capacity of the armed forces to win wars and serve the country's interests.",""],[1,"215","2","Modern Armed Police Force Development","We will improve the modern Armed Police Force.",""],[1,"215","2","Civil Air Defense Works Development and Maintenance","We will strengthen the development and maintenance of civil air defense works.",""],[1,"215","2","Decommissioned Military Personnel Support System Improvement","We will improve the organization of and leadership over management and support work for decommissioned military personnel by improving service systems, policies, and institutions.",""],[1,"215","2","Border Security Coordination and Joint Action Mechanism","We will ensure that the Party, the government, the military, the police, and the people work together to strengthen border security.",""],[1,"215","2","Border Control Capability Enhancement","In order to improve our overall border control capabilities and ensure security and stability in border areas, we will use political and diplomatic means to ensure peace along our borders, bolster development and living standards in border areas, strengthen border security through military development, and adopt science and technology in the field of border control.",""],[1,"215","2","Xinjiang Production and Construction Corps Capacity Strengthening","We will work to ensure that the Xinjiang Production and Construction Corps strengthens its overall capabilities and self-development capacity, increases the pace of its development southward and better fulfills its role of maintaining stability and defending our borders.",""]],"127":[[1,"91","10","People-Centered Urbanization and Urban-Rural Integration Initiative","In committed pursuit of people-centered urbanization based on city clusters, supported by the comprehensive carrying capacity of cities, and safeguarded by institutional innovations, we will step up the pace of new urbanization, make further progress in building a new socialist countryside, strive to bridge the gap between urban and rural development, and facilitate urban and rural integration.",""],[1,"92","1","Household Registration and Urban Residency Reform","We will coordinate the reform of the household registration system and efforts to ensure more equitable access to basic public services, and improve incentives for granting urban residency to permanent residents from rural areas, giving impetus to more people to settle in urban areas.",""],[1,"92","2","Urban Residency Reform for Migrants","We will make progress in efforts to see that people who have moved from rural to urban areas and are able to find stable employment and settle into urban life can move their families with them and obtain urban residency, and that they enjoy the same rights and share the same responsibilities as other urban residents.",""],[1,"93","2","Residence Card System Implementation and Service Expansion","We will fully implement the provisional regulations on residence cards and see that the residence card system covers all permanent urban residents without urban residence registration.",""],[1,"93","3","Urban Residency Incentive and Rights Protection Mechanism","We will improve the mechanism linking the transfer payments a local government receives to the number of former rural residents granted urban residency in its jurisdiction, establish the mechanism linking increases in the amount of land designated for urban development in a locality to the number of former rural residents granted urban residency there, and put in place a mechanism linking the subsidies for infrastructure development a city receives from government development funds to the number of former rural residents to whom it grants urban residency.",""],[1,"93","3","Protection and Compensation for Rural Land Rights of Urban Residents","We will ensure that the rights of people from rural areas who hold permanent urban residency are protected in relation to the rural land they have contracted, the land on which their rural housing is built, and their share in proceeds from rural collective undertakings, and we will support and guide their voluntary transfer of such rights in return for compensation in accordance with the law.",""],[1,"93","3","Comprehensive New Urbanization Trials","we will intensify efforts to move forward with comprehensive new urbanization trials.",""],[1,"102","1","Urban Residency Registration Reform","Make progress in granting urban residency to approximately 100 million former rural residents and other permanent urban residents without urban household registration;",""],[1,"102","3","Urbanization Guidance for Migrating Populations","Guide the process of urbanization for around 100 million people in the central and western regions as they move to city clusters, small and medium cities, county seats, and key towns near their places of origin.",""]],"128":[[1,"167","2","Medical Insurance Financing and Reimbursement Reform","We will improve the mechanisms to ensure stable and sustainable funding for medical insurance and to adjust reimbursement rates for medical expenses, and will improve payment policies for medical insurance premiums.",""],[1,"167","2","Major Disease Insurance and Medical Assistance Expansion","We will fully implement the major disease insurance scheme for rural and non-working urban residents, and improve the assistance systems for major or serious diseases and for emergency disease treatment.",""],[1,"167","2","Medical Cost Reduction for Major and Chronic Diseases","We will work to lower the treatment costs of major and chronic diseases.",""],[1,"167","2","Medical Insurance Management and Payment Reform","We will reform medical insurance management and payment methods and keep medical expenses at a reasonable level, ensuring a sustainable balance of medical insurance funds.",""],[1,"167","2","Basic Medical Insurance Account and Outpatient Management Reform","We will improve the personal account side of the basic medical insurance scheme and bring outpatient expenditures under unified management.",""],[1,"167","2","Rural and Non-Working Urban Resident Insurance Coverage Expansion","We will work to keep the medical insurance participation rate for rural and non-working urban residents above 95%.",""],[1,"167","2","Cross-Locality Medical Insurance Settlement Reform","We will accelerate efforts to enable medical bills incurred in any locality to be settled through basic medical insurance accounts and see that a retiree living in a different province from that in which premium payments were made can settle inpatient expenditures where they were incurred.",""],[1,"167","2","Integrated Rural and Non-Working Urban Medical Insurance Management","We will integrate the medical insurance policies for rural and non-working urban residents along with the management of insurance.",""],[1,"168","1","Commercial and Supplemental Health Insurance Development","will encourage commercial insurance agencies to participate in providing medical insurance.",""],[1,"168","1","Maternity Insurance Integration into Basic Medical Insurance","We will merge maternity insurance into the basic medical insurance scheme.",""],[1,"168","1","Long-Term Care Insurance Scheme Pilots","We will explore the establishment of insurance schemes for long-term care and begin launching trials in this regard.",""],[1,"168","1","Medical Malpractice Insurance System Improvement","We will improve the medical malpractice insurance system.",""]],"129":[[1,"16","2","Urban Residency Expansion and Urbanization Quality Improvement","The quality of urbanization will improve notably, and the proportion of those living in urban areas granted urban residency will increase more quickly.",""],[1,"16","2","Regional Coordinated Development Framework","A new pattern of coordinated development among regions will begin to take shape, and the layout of development spaces will be improved.",""]],"131":[[1,"16","3","Public Service System Improvement","Public service systems related to employment, education, culture, sports, social security, healthcare, and housing will be improved, with access to basic public services becoming increasingly equitable.",""],[1,"174","2","Public Service Expansion and Accessibility Improvement","we will increase government responsibility for providing public services, see that all sectors become more involved in public service provision, and ensure that public services are accessible to a greater number of people.",""],[1,"174","3","National Basic Public Services System Improvement","we will accelerate efforts to improve national systems and institutions for providing basic public services.",""],[1,"175","1","Development of Non-Basic Public Service Industries","We will actively promote faster development of non-basic public services in areas such as health care, elderly care, culture, and sports, enrich service products, improve the quality of services, and provide personalized service solutions.",""],[1,"175","2","Public Service Delivery Diversification Reform","We will promote diversification in the methods of service provision.",""]],"132":[[1,"100","3","Rural Reform and Institutional Innovation Initiative","We will promote rural reform and institutional innovation, strengthen the service functions of collective economic organizations, and stimulate the vitality of rural development.",""],[1,"100","3","Rural Spatial Planning and Ecological Conservation Planning","We will draw up research- based plans for the spatial distribution of village and town development, farmland protection, village locations, and ecological conservation schemes.",""],[1,"100","3","Rural Infrastructure Upgrading Programme","We will accelerate the transformation of rural broadband, roads, and dilapidated housing, as well as drinking water, lighting, environmental sanitation, and fire-fighting facilities.",""],[1,"100","3","Rural Power Grid Upgrade Initiative","We will start a new round of initiatives to transform and upgrade rural grids, ensuring that a 99.8% power supply reliability rate is achieved.",""],[1,"101","1","Rural Drinking Water Safety Improvement","efforts to ensure the safety of drinking water in rural areas.",""],[1,"101","1","Rural School Conditions and Teacher Welfare Improvement","We will improve conditions in rural schools and see that teachers enjoy better working conditions and higher living standards,",""],[1,"101","1","Rural Community Health Institution Strengthening","we will strengthen community-level medical and healthcare institutions and step up efforts to develop the workforce of rural doctors.",""],[1,"101","1","Rural Left-Behind Care and Service System","We will establish sound care and service systems for women, children, and elderly people left behind in rural areas.",""],[1,"101","1","Rural Social Governance and Crime Prevention System","We will strengthen social governance in rural areas, improve the rural crime prevention and control system, and intensify efforts to ensure safety in rural areas.",""],[1,"101","1","Rural Cultural Development and Family Values Initiative","We will strengthen rural cultural development, devote energy to initiatives to foster exemplary households and families, and cultivate healthy rural practices, fine family practices, and a new rural culture of virtue.",""],[1,"101","1","Rural Social Norms and Problem-Behavior Control Measures","We will undertake specific initiatives to combat undesirable rural practices and deal with prominent rural problems such as illegitimate religious activities.",""],[1,"101","2","Integrated Urban and Rural Infrastructure Development","We will make coordinated plans for developing urban and rural infrastructure networks, improve long-term investment mechanisms for rural infrastructure, and promote the integration of urban and rural infrastructure related to the water supply, power supply, roads, gas supply, and telecommunications as well as the unified distribution and development of urban and rural facilities for ecological conservation and environmental protection.",""],[1,"101","2","Urban Public Services Extension to Rural Areas","We will give particular attention to the development of social programs in rural areas and those cities and towns that have welcomed more former rural residents, promote the extension of urban public services to rural areas, and ensure that both urban and rural areas gradually come to adopt the same basic public service systems and standards.",""]],"135":[[1,"52","1","Eco-Friendly Agriculture Development Initiative","We will work hard to develop eco-friendly agriculture.",""],[1,"52","1","Circular Agriculture Demonstration Project","We will implement a demonstration project for circular agriculture through integrated planting and breeding, and promote the recovery of resources and safe disposal of waste materials from planting and breeding industries.",""],[1,"52","1","Agricultural Non-Point Source Pollution Control Measures","We will take comprehensive measures to prevent and control agricultural pollution from non-point sources.",""],[1,"52","1","Cultivated Land Protection and Improvement Program","We will protect and improve the quality of cultivated land, promote deep planting and plowing to improve cropland in major agricultural product production areas, and strengthen the protection of chernozem soil in northeast China.",""],[1,"52","1","Crop Rotation and Fallow Pilot System","We will pilot crop rotation and fallow systems focusing on cones of depression, heavy metal contaminated areas, and areas suffering serious ecological degradation.",""],[1,"52","1","Sustainable Agricultural Development Pilot Zones","We will establish pilot demonstration zones for sustainable agricultural development.",""],[1,"58","14","Reduction of Pesticide and Chemical Fertilizer Use in Agriculture","Make a serious push to reduce pesticide and chemical fertilizer use in the production of agricultural products;",""],[1,"58","15","Development of Pollution-Free, Green, Organic, and Geographical Indication Agricultural Products","Develop pollution-free agricultural products, green foodstuffs, organic agricultural products, and agricultural products using geographical indications;",""]],"147":[[1,"3","12","Modern Property Rights System","Establish a Modern Property Rights System",""]],"148":[[1,"17","2","Eco-Friendly Low-Carbon Production and Resource Efficiency Measures","Our modes of production and ways of life will become more eco- friendly and low-carbon.",""],[1,"20","10","Resource-Conserving and Environment-Protection Development Path","We need to uphold the fundamental state policy of conserving resources and protecting the environment as we pursue sustainable development, and keep to a civilized development path that ensures increased levels of production, better living standards, and sound ecosystems.",""]],"149":[[1,"36","3","Property Rights System Reform","We will improve the modern system of property rights, ensuring clear ownership, well-defined rights and obligations, strict protection, and smooth transactions.",""],[1,"36","3","State-Owned Asset Property Rights Trading Reform","We will improve the property rights trading system for state-owned assets, ensuring that rules, processes, and outcomes are transparent.",""],[1,"36","3","Rural Collective Property Rights Registration Programme","We will improve the functions of rural collective property rights and complete, in all rural areas nationwide, the determination, registration, and certification of contracted land rights, rural home land rights, rural housing property rights, and rights for collectively owned land designated for construction.",""],[1,"36","3","Collective Economic Organization Asset Rights Reform","We will improve methods for verifying membership of collective economic organizations and for realizing the ownership rights of the assets of collective entities, allowing the productive assets of collective economic organizations to be converted into shares and allotted to",""],[1,"37","1","Rural Property Rights Transfer and Asset Disposition Reform","We will ensure that transfers of rural property rights are carried out in accordance with regulations, and will improve decision-making procedures for the disposition of the assets of rural collective organizations.",""],[1,"37","1","Integrated Immovable Property Registration System","We will implement an integrated registration system for immovable property across the board.",""],[1,"37","1","Natural Resource Asset Property Rights System","We will accelerate the establishment of a property rights system for natural resource assets, determine the holders of such rights, and make innovations in the ways in which such rights can be realized.",""],[1,"37","2","Natural Resource Asset Rights and Benefit-Sharing Reform","We will protect the rights and interests of owners of natural resource assets and ensure that returns generated from these assets are shared fairly.",""],[1,"37","2","Mining Rights System Reform","We will deepen reform of the mining rights system.",""],[1,"37","2","Ecological Conservation Rights Trading Platform","We will establish sound systems and platforms for trading rights and interests related to ecological conservation and environmental protection.",""],[1,"37","2","Intellectual Property Rights Protection and Trading Platform","We will enforce a stringent regime for the protection of intellectual property rights, improve the system of ownership of intellectual property rights to better incentivize innovation, and develop a trading and service platform for intellectual property rights, so as to turn China into a country strong on intellectual property rights.",""],[1,"37","4","Unified Rural-Urban Construction Land Market Reform","We will work faster to establish a unified rural-urban market for land designated for construction purposes.",""],[1,"38","1","Collectively Owned Land Requisition Reform","We will improve the system for requisitioning collectively owned land, narrow the scope of land requisition, establish standard requisition procedures, and improve mechanisms for safeguarding the rights and interests of those whose land is requisitioned.",""],[1,"38","1","Rural Land Collateral and Transfer Pilot","We will launch trials to make rural land for private housing eligible for use as collateral to secure financing, to allow for appropriate transfers of such land, and to allow such land to be given up voluntarily for compensation.",""],[1,"38","1","Market-Based Allocation of Industrial Land","We will improve systems for the market-based allocation of land designated for industrial purposes.",""]],"150":[[1,"42","1","Performance-Based Budget Management System","performance-based budget management nationwide.",""],[1,"42","1","Government Asset Reporting System","We will establish a system for reporting government assets,",""],[1,"42","1","Government Debt Management Reform","deepen reform of the government debt management system, and put in place standardized mechanisms for managing government debt and providing early warning against risks.",""],[1,"42","1","Accrual-Based Government Financial Reporting System","We will establish a system for comprehensive government financial reporting based on accrual accounting and a management system for the target balance of the treasury general account.",""],[1,"42","1","Public Budget Transparency Expansion","We will extend the scope and increase the level of detail of budgets made publicly available.",""]],"151":[[1,"42","2","Modern Tax System Reform","we must fully implement the principle of law-based taxation; establish a modern tax system which is composed of well-conceived tax categories, is better structured, legally sound, well-regulated, and fair, and which allows for efficient administration; and gradually increase the proportion of direct tax.",""],[1,"42","2","Business Tax to VAT Reform","We will complete across the board the reform to replace business tax with VAT and establish a standardized consumption-based VAT system.",""],[1,"42","2","Excise Tax System Improvement","We will improve the excise tax system.",""],[1,"42","2","Resource Tax Expansion","We will impose ad valorem tax on resources and steadily extend the scope of resources covered by the tax.",""],[1,"42","2","Administrative Charges and Government-Funded Review","We will review and regulate relevant administrative charges and government- managed funds.",""],[1,"42","2","Environmental Protection Tax","We will introduce an environmental protection tax.",""],[1,"42","2","Local Tax System Improvement","We will improve local tax systems and move forward with legislation to introduce a real estate tax.",""],[1,"42","2","Customs Duty System Improvement","We will improve the system of customs duties.",""],[1,"42","2","Non-Tax Revenue Management Reform","We will move faster with reform related to non-tax revenue management to establish a system for non-tax revenue management that is sound, standardized, and transparent and has a legal basis.",""],[1,"42","2","National and Local Tax Administration Reform","We will deepen reform of the system for the administration of national and local taxes, refine methods of tax administration, and improve the efficiency of tax administration.",""],[1,"42","2","Electronic Invoice Introduction","Electronic invoices will be introduced.",""]],"152":[[1,"45","13","New Monetary Policy Regulation Tools","and put into use new monetary policy regulation tools;",""],[1,"45","14","Targeted Credit Policy for Structural Adjustment","Boost the role of credit policy in targeted structural adjustments;",""],[1,"45","15","RMB Exchange Rate Flexibility Reform","Increase the flexibility of the RMB exchange rate and improve the RMB",""],[1,"45","17","Central Bank Forward Guidance Mechanism","Establish forward guidance mechanisms for the central bank;",""],[1,"45","18","RMB and Foreign Currency Policy Transmission Channels","Develop channels for RMB and foreign currency policy transmission.",""],[1,"45","20","Cross-Border Policy and Development Exchange Mechanism","Establish cross-border exchanges for policy-backed and development",""],[1,"46","8","Macroeconomic Regulation System Improvement","We will improve the macroeconomic regulation system, develop new methods of macroeconomic regulation, and strengthen the coordination of macroeconomic policies.",""],[1,"46","8","Employment, Price Stability, and Risk Control Measures","We will work harder to create jobs, keep prices stable, make structural adjustments, raise efficiency, guard against and control risk, protect the environment, and guide market behavior and public expectations, thereby fostering a stable macroeconomic environment for structural reform.",""],[1,"46","9","Macroeconomic Regulation Based on National Development Plans","We will exercise macroeconomic regulation based on long- and medium-term national development plans and objectives and total supply and demand.",""],[1,"46","9","Strengthening the Guiding Role of National Development Strategies and Plans","We will ensure that national development strategies and plans work to guide and constrain",""],[1,"47","1","Macroeconomic Policy Coordination Framework","We will improve our system of policies, ensuring fiscal and monetary policies play a leading role while industrial, regional, investment, consumption, and pricing policies play a supplementary role.",""],[1,"47","1","Fiscal and Monetary Policy Coordination","We will strengthen coordination between fiscal and monetary policies.",""],[1,"47","2","Targeted Macroeconomic Regulation Reform","On the basis of range- based regulation, we will place greater weight on targeted and well-timed regulation, taking well- targeted regulatory measures to carry out appropriately timed pre-emptive adjustment and fine-tuning.",""],[1,"47","2","Policy Stability and Market Communication Measures","We will maintain policy stability, improve communication with the market, and see that policy predictability and transparency are increased.",""],[1,"47","2","Monetary Policy Framework Reform","We will improve the operational targets, regulatory framework, and transmission mechanisms of monetary policies, establish mechanisms for target interest rates and interest rate corridors, and shift our focus from quantitative to price-based monetary policies.",""],[1,"47","3","Economic Monitoring and Early Warning Mechanism","We will strengthen economic monitoring, forecasting, and early warning mechanisms, and improve our ability to analyze and assess international and domestic situations.",""],[1,"47","3","Policy Analysis, Evaluation, and Adjustment Mechanism","We will strengthen research on major issues, build up policy reserves, and improve our mechanisms for policy analysis, evaluation, and adjustment.",""],[1,"47","3","Major Regulatory Policy Coordination Mechanism","We will establish a sound mechanism for coordinating major regulatory policies so that they work together effectively.",""],[1,"47","3","Modern Statistical Survey System","We will establish a modern statistical survey system, promote innovation in the systems, mechanisms, and methods used for statistical surveys, and",""],[1,"48","1","Digital Economic Data Collection and Macroeconomic Regulation Legislation","encourage the application of internet, statistical cloud, and Big Data technologies to collect more timely, comprehensive, and accurate information on economic performance.",""]],"153":[[1,"51","2","Agricultural Product Quality and Safety Oversight System","We will strengthen quality and safety oversight over agricultural products and inputs, strengthen safety management at production sites, implement a certification system for product oversight both before products leave production sites and on entrance into markets, and establish interconnected, shared agricultural product quality and safety information platforms allowing for full traceability at every stage, thereby forming a stronger quality and safety oversight system that covers the entire journey of agricultural products from farm to table.",""],[1,"51","2","Control of Agricultural Residues and Additives","We will strengthen work on addressing excess residues of pesticides and livestock medicines.",""],[1,"51","2","County-Level Agricultural Quality and Safety Capacity Initiative","We will move forward with the national initiative to develop counties with advanced capabilities for ensuring agricultural product quality and safety.",""],[1,"51","2","Animal and Plant Disease Prevention and Import Safety Oversight","We will strengthen our ability to prevent and control animal and plant diseases and increase oversight over the quality and safety of agricultural imports.",""],[1,"51","2","Quality Agricultural Branding and Marketing Support","We will develop brands of quality agricultural products and support brand marketing.",""],[1,"58","16","Epidemic Disease and Pest Monitoring and Early-Warning System","Strengthen epidemic disease and pest monitoring and early-warning",""],[1,"59","1","Agricultural Product Quality and Safety Traceability System","establish an information traceability system for oversight over the quality and safety of agricultural products, and achieve interconnection and information sharing between all types of platforms for products tracing information;",""],[1,"59","2","Food Safety Standards Compliance for Livestock Antibiotics and Residues","Ensure that livestock antibiotics are properly used and that the indexes for pesticide and livestock medicine residues are basically in line with Codex Alimentarius standards.",""]],"154":[[1,"52","1","Large-Scale Water-Saving Irrigation Expansion","Large- scale, high- efficiency, and water-saving irrigation will be introduced in all key irrigation areas.",""],[1,"52","1","Dry Farming Promotion Initiative","Dry farming will be encouraged in more areas.",""],[1,"52","1","Agricultural Water Conservation Action Plans","Special action plans for promoting water conservation will be implemented in the drainage basins of Yarkand, Hotan, and other rivers in southern Xinjiang and in seriously water-deprived areas such as the Hexi Corridor of Gansu and Baicheng in Jilin.",""],[1,"52","1","Agricultural Meteorological Service System Development","We will strengthen development of the meteorological service system for agriculture.",""],[1,"58","5","Water-Efficient Agriculture Promotion","Spread the application of water-efficient irrigation and promote water- efficient projects, crop breeds, agronomy, and management;",""],[1,"58","6","Regional High-Efficiency Water-Saving Irrigation Projects","Accelerate the implementation of regional scaled high-efficiency water- saving irrigation projects, using water-conserving methods to increase crop production in the northeast, raise irrigation efficiency in the northwest, address groundwater overdraft in the north, and reduce waste water discharge in the south;",""],[1,"58","7","High-Efficiency Water-Conserving Irrigation Expansion","Increase the area of cropland making use of high-efficiency water- conserving irrigation by 6.7 million hectares, thereby raising the irrigation water utilization coefficient to 0.55 or above.",""],[1,"58","13","Agricultural Monitoring, Analysis, and Early-Warning Systems","Establish monitoring, analysis, and early-warning systems based on agricultural information.",""]],"155":[[1,"52","2","Agricultural Trade Regulation and Import-Export Optimization","We will improve mechanisms for regulating trade in agricultural products, optimize the mix of sources of imports, expand exports of competitive agricultural products while ensuring domestic supply, and appropriately increase imports of agricultural products that are in short supply at home.",""],[1,"52","2","Overseas Agricultural Cooperation and Offshore Production Centers","We will actively pursue agricultural cooperation and development overseas, establish large-scale offshore centers for farm product production, processing, storage, and transportation, and cultivate internationally competitive multinational agricultural companies.",""],[1,"52","2","International Agricultural Technology Cooperation","We will broaden the areas of international agricultural cooperation and support bilateral and multilateral cooperation in agricultural technology.",""]],"156":[[1,"49","3","Major Grain Crop Production Subsidy Mechanism","We will improve the mechanism for subsidizing major grain crop production",""],[1,"56","1","Agricultural Policy Support and Protection Enhancement","we will improve policy support aimed at strengthening agriculture, benefiting farmers, and raising rural living standards and raise our level of support and protection for agriculture.",""],[1,"56","2","Agricultural Investment and Subsidy Reform Mechanism","We will establish a mechanism for steadily increasing investment in agriculture and rural areas.",""],[1,"56","3","Agricultural Market Regulation Reform","We will ensure equal emphasis is placed on both carrying out market- oriented reforms and protecting the interests of farmers, and improve the system for regulating the market for agricultural products and the market system itself.",""],[1,"56","3","Minimum Purchase Price Policy for Rice and Wheat","We will continue to implement and improve the minimum purchase price policy for rice and wheat, and deepen reform of the program for guaranteeing base prices for cotton and soybeans.",""],[1,"56","3","Base Price Guarantee Reform for Cotton and Soybeans","We will continue to implement and improve the minimum purchase price policy for rice and wheat, and deepen reform of the program for guaranteeing base prices for cotton and soybeans.",""],[1,"56","3","Agricultural Base Price Insurance Pilot","We will explore the possibility of trialing base price insurance for agricultural products.",""],[1,"56","3","Price-Setting Mechanism Reform","We will actively and prudently carry out reform of the price-setting mechanism and the",""],[1,"57","1","Corn Purchase and Stockpiling Support System","purchasing and stockpiling systems for corn, and establish a system for subsidizing corn producers.",""],[1,"57","1","Grain Crop Purchase, Stockpiling, and Supply Security Project","We will implement a project to ensure security of the purchase, stockpiling, and supply of grain crops, research and determine the optimum scale of reserves of grain crops and other important agricultural products, reform and improve the grain crop reserve management system as well as mechanisms for grain crop regulation and adjustment, and guide a diverse range of market entities-such as distribution and processing businesses-in participating in the purchase and stockpiling of agricultural products.",""],[1,"57","1","Intelligent Grain Storage Facility Development","We will move forward with the development of intelligent storage facilities for grain crops and work to conserve grain crops and reduce waste.",""]],"157":[[1,"57","2","Inclusive Rural Agricultural Finance Support","We will ensure all types of financial institutions support agriculture, and develop inclusive financing in rural areas.",""],[1,"57","2","Rural Infrastructure Financing Support","We will improve systems for supporting agricultural development and for the construction of rural infrastructure using development and policy-backed financing.",""],[1,"57","2","Rural Credit Cooperative Reform","We will carry out reform of rural credit cooperatives and strengthen the service functions of provincial-level unions of such cooperatives.",""],[1,"57","2","Rural Financial Institution Development","We will actively develop diverse forms of rural financial institutions such as village banks.",""],[1,"57","2","Farmer Cooperative Internal Finance Trials","We will steadily carry out trials to allow farmers' cooperatives to use internal funds to provide financial services to their members.",""],[1,"57","2","Agricultural Credit Guarantee System","We will establish a sound policy-backed credit guaranty system for agriculture.",""],[1,"57","2","Agricultural Insurance System Improvement","We will improve the agricultural insurance system, steadily increase trials of the \"insurance +futures\" model, expand the scope of insurance coverage, raise insurance benefits, and improve the risk-spreading mechanisms of agricultural insurance against the risks posed by major disasters.",""]],"158":[[1,"58","8","Agricultural Mechanization Breakthrough Programme","Make breakthroughs in mechanizing the transplanting of rice seedlings, the sowing and harvesting of canola seeds, and the harvesting of cotton and sugarcane;",""],[1,"58","9","Agricultural Mechanization Promotion","Promote the use of high-horsepower and high-performance agricultural machinery and light, durable, and lower-power small and medium plowing, planting, and harvesting machines and crop protection machines;",""],[1,"58","10","County Agricultural Mechanization Demonstration Programme","Develop 500 counties able to demonstrate mechanization of the entire agricultural process;",""],[1,"64","13","Advanced Agricultural Machinery Development Programme","Develop advanced agricultural machinery suitable for all cultivation conditions, with a focus on high horsepower tractors and compound operations machinery, large and efficient combine harvesters, precision seeders, and other food- crop equipment, as well as machinery for seeding, farmland management, and harvesting of cotton, sugar cane, and other cash crops.",""]],"159":[[1,"62","2","Industrial Overcapacity Reduction and Structural Adjustment Mechanism","We will establish a mechanism to address overcapacity by ensuring compliance with standards for the production process, technology, energy consumption, environmental protection, quality, and safety, and will tighten industry regulations and market entry management in order to shut down outdated production facilities.",""],[1,"62","2","Industrial Enterprise Structural Adjustment Fund","We will set up a fund to provide rewards and subsidies for structural adjustments in industrial enterprises;",""],[1,"62","2","Industrial Overcapacity Resolution and Enterprise Restructuring Measures","move more quickly to address overcapacity in industries such as steel and coal through mergers, reorganizations, debt restructurings, bankruptcy liquidations, and better asset utilization; actively and prudently handle the winding up of enterprises in an organized way on the basis of classification; and ensure that employees laid off from such enterprises are properly resettled.",""]],"160":[[1,"73","1","Internet Plus Action Plan","We will implement the \"Internet +\" action plan to promote deeper and more extensive applications of the internet and help transform modes of production and methods of organization",""],[1,"73","2","Cloud Computing and Internet of Things Development Initiative","We will promote the development of cloud computing and the Internet of Things.",""],[1,"73","2","Internet of Things Deployment and Open-Loop Applications Programme","We will move ahead with the planned distribution of Internet of Things sensory equipment and promote the development of open-loop applications of the Internet of Things.",""],[1,"73","2","Cyber-Physical Systems Research and Application Programme","We will promote the research, development, and application of key technologies for cyber- physical systems.",""],[1,"73","2","Internet Plus Standards Development and International Standardization Initiative","We will establish standards for the \"Internet +\" action plan, accelerate the formulation and dissemination of fundamental generic standards and key technical standards for both the internet and areas integrated with the internet, and work to strengthen China's say in the formulation of international standards.",""],[1,"73","3","Internet Plus Initiative Implementation","We will organize the implementation of the \"Internet +\" initiative, accelerate efforts to promote innovations in internet-based business models, service models, management models, supply chains, and logistics chains, cultivate the \"Internet +\" ecosystem, and ensure the formation of a new pattern of internet-based collaboration and division of work.",""],[1,"74","1","Internet Plus Business Development and Sharing Economy Promotion","promote new forms of business based on \"Internet +,\" encourage the establishment of platforms for releasing and sharing resources, explore the creation of national experimental demonstration zones for an information economy, and develop the sharing economy.",""],[1,"74","1","Online Medical and Education Service Expansion","We will promote the rapid development of emerging forms of businesses such as online medical services and online education as well as those that integrate their offline and online presences.",""],[1,"74","1","Market Access Liberalization for Convergent Products and Services","We will relax restrictions on market access for convergent products and services.",""],[1,"77","12","Demonstration Projects for Major Applications","Promote the development of demonstration projects of major applications",""],[1,"77","16","Internet of Things Service Enhancement","Enrich services through the application of the Internet of Things.",""],[1,"77","18","Public Cloud Service Platform Development","Support the development of public cloud service platforms;",""],[1,"77","19","Cloud Computing and Big Data Centers Establishment","Plan for the establishment of cloud computing and big data centers;",""],[1,"77","20","Cloud Computing Solutions Capacity Improvement","Improve the ability to provide cloud computing solutions;",""],[1,"77","21","Cloud Application Services Promotion","Promote cloud application services in manufacturing, banking, people's",""],[1,"77","23","Cloud Computing Ecosystem Improvement","Continuously improve cloud computing ecosystems.",""],[1,"77","24","Internet Plus Business Startup and Innovation Promotion","Promote \"Internet +\" in starting up businesses, innovation, collaborative",""]],"161":[[1,"78","5","E-commerce Infrastructure Development","Support the development of e-commerce infrastructure;",""],[1,"78","6","E-Commerce Innovation and Adoption Promotion","Promote the innovation and adoption of e-commerce in key areas;",""],[1,"78","7","Cross-Border E-Commerce Experimental Zones Development","Promote the development of comprehensive experimental zones for cross- border e-commerce in Hangzhou and other areas so as to build international e- commerce thoroughfares.",""]],"162":[[1,"83","5","Rural Roads Development Programme","Continue to build rural roads:",""],[1,"83","6","Rural Road Interconnection Improvement","Move forward with rural road interconnection in areas where conditions allow;",""],[1,"83","7","County and Township Road Upgrading and Rural Road Safety Works","Upgrade county and township roads, build safety protection facilities on rural roads, and renovate dilapidated bridges;",""],[1,"83","8","Rural Roads Maintenance Programme","Intensify efforts to maintain rural roads;",""],[1,"83","9","Rural Road and Shuttle Bus Connectivity Programme","Ensure all administrative villages are linked to paved roads and shuttle bus services where conditions permit.",""],[1,"83","10","Rural and Western Postal and Express Delivery Infrastructure Improvement","Improve the infrastructure for postal and express delivery services in rural areas and in the western region of the country, and ensure every village has access to postal services.",""]],"163":[[1,"96","2","Green City Development Initiative","We will build green cities by adjusting the scale of cities in accordance with their resource and environmental carrying capacities, using eco-friendly planning, design, and construction standards, and carrying out initiatives to build ecological corridors and restore ecosystems.",""],[1,"96","2","Smart City Digital Infrastructure Development","We will build smart cities as we strengthen modern information infrastructure and promote the development of big data and the Internet of Things.",""],[1,"96","2","Urban Innovation and Business Park Development","We will build innovative cities by making full use of the concentrations of creative resources found in cities to develop business parks and cradles of innovation.",""],[1,"96","2","Urban Cultural Heritage Protection Initiative","We will build cities of culture through efforts to make cities more open and inclusive, strengthen the protection of cultural and natural heritage, and keep historical heritage alive.",""],[1,"96","2","Compact Transit-Oriented Urban Development","We will strengthen the development, use, and regulation of urban spaces and build high-density and public transit-oriented compact cities with integrated functions.",""],[1,"102","7","Smart City Development Initiative","Make full use of modern information technology and big data to develop a number of exemplary new-style smart cities, focusing on developing smart infrastructure, convenient public services, and refined social governance.",""],[1,"102","8","Exemplary Green and Eco-Friendly City Development","Build a number of exemplary green cities, eco-friendly garden cities, and forest cities",""],[1,"102","9","Eco-Friendly Building Construction Promotion","Promoting the construction of eco-friendly buildings;",""],[1,"102","14","Urban Landscaping Projects","Implementing urban landscaping projects;",""],[1,"102","16","Urban Sponge City Drainage and Rainwater Management Program","Support the development of sponge-like buildings, residential areas, roads, squares, parks, and green spaces by improving drainage and rainwater control and regulation facilities in urban areas and taking measures to enable rainwater to be absorbed, retained, stored, purified, used, or drained.",""]],"164":[[1,"97","1","Flood Prevention and Waterlogging Management Facilities","We will strengthen the development of facilities for preventing flooding and waterlogging and managing water flow",""],[1,"97","1","Urban Green Space and Ecosystem Support Development","the development of parks, green spaces, and other such facilities for supporting urban ecosystems",""],[1,"97","1","Sponge City Development Support","support the development of sponge cities",""],[1,"97","1","Urban Public Facilities Improvement","improve urban public facilities",""],[1,"97","1","Urban Building and Infrastructure Disaster-Proofing","We will work to disaster proof urban buildings and infrastructure.",""]],"165":[[1,"138","1","Active Participation in Global Climate Change Cooperation","We will take an active part in negotiations on global climate change and work toward a fair and equitable system of global climate governance based on mutually beneficial cooperation.",""],[1,"138","1","Climate Change Dialogue and Practical Cooperation","We will help deepen bilateral and multilateral dialogue, exchange, and practical cooperation on climate change.",""],[1,"138","1","South-South Climate Cooperation Fund Support","We will ensure the South-South Cooperation Fund on Climate Change fully plays its role and support other developing countries in improving their capacity to deal with climate change.",""]],"166":[[1,"138","3","Ecological Space Regulation and Ecological Redline Enforcement","We will regulate the use of ecological spaces, define and strictly observe ecological redlines, and ensure that the functions of ecosystem service zones are not degraded, that their total area is not cut, and that they are not used for other purposes.",""],[1,"138","3","Total Area Management System for Forests, Grasslands, and Wetlands","We will establish a system for managing the total area of forests, grasslands, and wetlands.",""],[1,"138","3","Eco-Tax System for Resource Use and Pollution","We will establish an eco-tax system that covers certain areas including mining, resource consumption, pollutant discharge, and the import and export of resource products.",""],[1,"138","3","Natural Resource Valuation and Accounting System","We will research the establishment of an ecological value evaluation system, explore the creation of balance sheets for natural resources, and establish accounts for natural resource accounting in physical terms.",""],[1,"138","3","Outgoing Officials' Natural Resource Asset Audit","We will audit outgoing officials' management of natural resource assets.",""],[1,"139","1","Environmental Damage Accountability System","environmental damage and put into effect a lifelong accountability system for such damage.",""]],"167":[[1,"144","1","Business Environment and Institutional Reform for International Trade","We will work to create a business environment that is more internationalized, convenient, and based on the rule of law, and to improve our institutions and mechanisms so as to make them more conducive to mutually beneficial cooperation and more compatible with international trade and investment rules.",""],[1,"144","2","Foreign Investment Legal and Regulatory Reform","We will unify laws and regulations for domestic and foreign capital, introduce basic laws on foreign capital, and protect the legitimate rights and interests of foreign companies.",""],[1,"144","2","Pilot Free Trade Zone Expansion and Experimentation","We will improve work in developing pilot free trade zones, encourage exploration and experimentation in service sector opening up, financial sector opening up and innovation, investment and trade facilitation, and operational and post- operational oversight over businesses, and apply successful experiences to other areas.",""],[1,"144","2","Foreign Capital Regulatory and Oversight System","We will put into force a regulatory system across the board for foreign capital based on pre-establishment national treatment with a negative list approach.",""],[1,"144","2","Foreign Investment Security Review System","We will improve the national security review system for foreign investment.",""],[1,"144","2","Cross-Border Trade Facilitation System","We will establish systems to facilitate new forms of trade, such as cross-border e-commerce, comprehensively implement the Single Window System, one-stop service, and the integration of regional customs clearance procedures, and fully promote the sharing and joint utilization of government information as well as joint efforts to prevent and control risks at ports of entry.",""],[1,"144","2","Trade in Services Promotion and Business Association Support","We will improve systems for promoting trade in services and give play to the roles of chambers of commerce, industrial associations, and trade and investment promotion agencies.",""],[1,"144","2","Intellectual Property and Antitrust Enforcement Strengthening","We will strengthen the protection of intellectual property rights as well as the enforcement of antitrust laws, and deepen international cooperation on law enforcement in this regard.",""]],"168":[[1,"145","1","Outbound Foreign Investment Planning and Regulation Reform","We will improve outbound foreign investment planning as well as planning systems for such investment in key areas, regions, and countries.",""],[1,"145","1","Outbound Investment Promotion and Service Improvement","We will facilitate outbound investment by improving the regulation system which is based primarily on registration and requires approvals in only a small number of cases and by refining policies for outbound investment promotion and better service provision.",""],[1,"145","1","Domestic Individual Investor Accreditation System","We will promote outbound investment by individuals and improve the accredited domestic individual investors system.",""],[1,"145","1","Overseas State Capital Investment Audit and Accountability System","We will establish an auditing system for overseas investment by SOEs or using state capital, and improve performance assessment and accountability systems for such overseas operations.",""],[1,"145","2","RMB Capital Account Convertibility and Foreign Exchange Reform","We will take systematic steps to realize RMB capital account convertibility, making the RMB more convertible and freely usable, so as to steadily promote RMB internationalization and see RMB capital go global.",""],[1,"146","1","Capital Market Opening and Financial Internationalization Measures","bidirectional opening up of capital markets, open stock and bond markets wider to foreign capital, and ease restrictions on domestic institutions in respect to international bond issuance as well as on overseas institutions in respect to issuing, investing in, and trading RMB- denominated bonds.",""]],"169":[[1,"146","2","Overseas Interests Protection and Consular Support System","We will build an efficient and effective system for safeguarding China's overseas interests so as to protect the legitimate rights and interests of Chinese nationals and legal persons abroad.",""],[1,"146","2","Anti-Smuggling and Financial Crime Regulatory Measures","We will improve comprehensive management mechanisms for combating smuggling; improve regulatory measures for countering money laundering, terrorism financing, and tax evasion; and strengthen our risk management systems and mechanisms.",""],[1,"146","2","Consular Protection and Overseas Citizen Services","We will improve China's capacity for ensuring the safety of Chinese people overseas, improve the consular protection system, and work to provide convenient services for Chinese nationals overseas such as risk warning, investment promotion, and rights and interests safeguards.",""],[1,"146","2","Foreign-Related Legal Services and Cross-Border Intellectual Property Protection","We will strengthen foreign-related legal services and put in place an assistance mechanism for the cross-border protection of intellectual property rights.",""]],"170":[[1,"148","2","International Cooperation for the Belt and Road Initiative","We will work to ensure the success of the International Summit for the Belt and Road Initiative and give expression to the role of the Silk Road (Dunhuang) International Culture Expo.",""],[1,"148","2","International Cooperation in Education, Science, Technology, Culture, Sports, Tourism, Environmental Protection, Health Care, and Traditional Chinese Medicine","We will conduct extensive international cooperation in the areas of education, science, technology, culture, sports, tourism, environmental protection, health care, and traditional Chinese medicine.",""],[1,"148","2","Multi-Party Cultural Exchange Mechanism","We will create mechanisms for official and nongovernmental cultural exchanges that involve the participation of multiple parties; hold events such as culture years, art festivals, film festivals, and expos with other countries; encourage diverse kinds of folk culture exchanges; and give full expression to the positive role of folk cultures such as Mazu culture.",""],[1,"148","2","International Tourism Product Development and Facilitation","We will coordinate China's efforts with other countries to develop unique tourism products and increase the convenience of tourism.",""],[1,"148","2","International Health Cooperation and Epidemic Prevention","We will strengthen international exchanges and cooperation on health care and epidemic prevention and enhance our capacity to jointly handle public health emergencies with other countries.",""],[1,"148","2","Think Tank Association Development","We will promote the establishment of think tank associations.",""]],"171":[[1,"150","3","Expansion and Improvement of Foreign Aid and Cooperation","We will increase the amount of foreign aid provided by China and improve the ways in which it is offered.",""],[1,"150","3","Free Advice and Training for Developing Countries","We will offer more advice and training to other developing countries free of charge in areas such as human resources, development planning, and economic policy;",""],[1,"150","3","Expanded Foreign Cooperation and Aid in Priority Sectors","expand foreign cooperation and aid in the areas of science, technology, education, medical care, disaster prevention and mitigation, environmental governance, the protection of wild fauna and flora, and poverty alleviation;",""],[1,"151","1","Humanitarian Aid Provision","provision of humanitarian aid.",""],[1,"151","1","Implementation of the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development","We will actively implement the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development.",""],[1,"151","1","Diversified Development Financing Systems","We will help establish diversified systems for development financing.",""],[1,"151","1","International Public Security and Counterterrorism Cooperation","We will help safeguard international public security, combat terrorism in all its forms and manifestations, and actively support and participate in the peacekeeping operations of the United Nations.",""],[1,"151","1","International Nonproliferation Cooperation","We will strengthen international cooperation on nonproliferation, participate in efforts to keep hotspots and sensitive areas under control, and work with other countries to maintain safety in international corridors.",""],[1,"151","1","Multilateral and Bilateral Coordination Enhancement","We will work to enhance multilateral and bilateral coordination, participate in international cyberspace governance, and help safeguard global cybersecurity.",""],[1,"151","1","International Anti-Corruption Cooperation","We will help promote international cooperation against corruption.",""]],"172":[[1,"151","2","Support for Hong Kong and Macao Economic Development","We will support Hong Kong and Macao in consolidating their traditional strengths while cultivating new ones",""],[1,"151","2","Peaceful Cross-Strait Relations Expansion","and expand the peaceful growth of relations between the two sides of the Taiwan Straits",""],[1,"151","3","One Country, Two Systems Implementation","We will implement, both to the letter and in spirit, the principles of \"one country, two systems,\" the people of Hong Kong governing Hong Kong, the people of Macao governing Macao, and both regions enjoying a high degree of autonomy, and stay true to the Constitution of China and the basic laws of these two regions.",""],[1,"151","3","Hong Kong and Macao Economic Role Enhancement","We will give expression to the distinctive strengths of Hong Kong and Macao, elevate their positions and roles in China's economic development and opening up, and support them in",""],[1,"152","2","Hong Kong International Financial and Trade Hub Development","We will support Hong Kong in strengthening and improving its status as an international financial, shipping, and trade center, and in strengthening its position as a global offshore RMB business hub and its function as an international asset management center.",""],[1,"152","2","Hong Kong High-Value Services Upgrading Initiative","We will work to see Hong Kong moves its finance, trade, logistics, and professional services toward the high- end and high value-added level.",""],[1,"152","2","Hong Kong Innovation and Emerging Industries Support","We will support Hong Kong in pursuing innovation, science, and technology and cultivating emerging industries.",""],[1,"152","2","Hong Kong International Legal and Dispute Resolution Services Center","We will support Hong Kong in becoming a center for international legal and dispute resolution services in the Asia-Pacific.",""],[1,"152","2","Macao Tourism and Trade Cooperation Platform Development","We will support Macao in becoming a major destination for international leisure and tourism and a service platform for trade and cooperation between China and Portuguese- speaking countries, actively developing its industries in areas such as conventions and exhibitions, trade, and commerce, and promoting an appropriate level of diversity in its economy in order to achieve sustainable economic development.",""],[1,"152","3","Hong Kong and Macao Economic Cooperation and Market Connectivity Measures","We will support Hong Kong and Macao in participating in the country's bidirectional opening up and the Belt and Road Initiative, and encourage mainland, Hong Kong, and Macao enterprises to go global by capitalizing on their respective strengths and multiple forms of partnership with each other.",""],[1,"152","3","Closer Economic Partnership Arrangement Improvement","We will open the mainland up more widely to Hong Kong and Macao and work to improve the Closer Economic Partnership Arrangement between the mainland and the two regions.",""],[1,"152","3","Mainland-Hong Kong Financial Cooperation and Market Connectivity","We will deepen financial cooperation and accelerate market connectivity between the mainland and Hong Kong.",""],[1,"152","3","Mainland-Hong Kong-Macao Social Exchange and Cooperation","We will deepen mainland exchange and cooperation with Hong Kong and Macao in relation to social development, living standards, culture, education,",""],[1,"153","1","Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area Cooperation Platform Development","We will support joint efforts by Guangdong, Hong Kong, and Macao to build a quality living area in the Greater Pearl River Delta region and accelerate the development of Qianhai, Nansha, and Hengqin as platforms for cooperation between Guangdong, Hong Kong, and Macao.",""],[1,"153","1","Innovation, Science, and Technology Cooperation Support","support cooperation in relation to innovation, science, and technology, and encourage micro, small, and medium businesses as well as young people from Hong Kong and Macao to start businesses on the mainland.",""],[1,"153","2","Cross-Strait Economic Cooperation and Peaceful Relations Promotion","On the basis of these principles, we will help deepen mutually beneficial economic cooperation between the two sides of the Taiwan Straits, expand areas of cooperation between and increase people's wellbeing on both sides, and strengthen and promote peaceful relations between the two sides.",""],[1,"153","3","Cross-Straits Economic Cooperation Expansion","We will help strengthen communication on macro-level policies between the two sides, expand economic cooperation, and deepen common interests.",""],[1,"153","3","Cross-Straits Industrial Integration and Innovation Cooperation","We will work to see that industries on the two sides achieve a better complementarity of strengths and a deeper integration of development, and encourage mainland and Taiwan companies to increase reciprocal holdings as well as to work together in making innovations, building brand names, and expanding markets.",""],[1,"153","3","Cross-Straits Financial Cooperation and Capital Market Linkages","We will work toward deeper cross-Straits financial cooperation and support multilevel cooperation between mainland and Taiwan capital markets.",""],[1,"153","3","Cross-Straits Trade and Investment Expansion","We will help expand and upgrade cross-Straits trade and investment.",""],[1,"153","3","Opening Mainland Service Markets to Taiwan","We will open the mainland more widely to Taiwan's service industries and work for greater cooperation in areas such as agriculture, fishery, small and medium enterprises,",""],[1,"154","1","Western Taiwan Straits Economic Zone Development","We will further develop the Western Taiwan Straits Economic Zone and the China (Fujian) Pilot Free Trade Zone, establish platforms for cooperation with Taiwan such as the Taiwan Investment Zone, the Pingtan Comprehensive Experimental Area, Fuzhou New Area, and Kunshan Experimental Mainland-Taiwan Industrial Cooperation Area, and expand efforts to build Xiamen into a hub for cooperation with Taiwan.",""],[1,"154","1","Support for Taiwan-Invested Company Upgrading and Relocation","We will encourage regions which host concentrations of Taiwan-invested companies such as the Yangtze River Delta, the Pearl River Delta, and the Bohai Sea Rim to give expression to their strengths, support transformation and upgrading in these companies, and guide them in gradually moving their operations toward the central and western regions.",""],[1,"154","2","Cross-Straits People-to-People Exchange Facilitation Measures","We will encourage individuals from the two sides to interact with each other more frequently, improve treatment policies and measures for our Taiwan compatriots, and make it more convenient for people from Taiwan to work, study, and live on the mainland.",""],[1,"154","2","Cross-Straits Cultural Exchange and Cooperation Initiative","We will help strengthen cultural exchanges and cooperation between the two sides of the Straits, work together with Taiwan in promoting Chinese culture, and enhance our common cultural and national identity.",""],[1,"154","2","Cross-Straits Educational Exchange and Credential Recognition Programme","We will help deepen educational exchanges and cooperation, work to increase the number of mutually recognized university credentials and degrees, and advance the development of the Experimental District for Fujian-Taiwan Vocational Educational Exchanges and Cooperation.",""],[1,"154","2","Cross-Straits Science, Technology, and R&D Cooperation","We will encourage joint efforts between the two sides of the Straits in conducting science, technology, and research and development projects, and deepen cross-Straits academic exchanges.",""],[1,"154","2","Cross-Straits Community and Youth Exchange Support","We will help strengthen community-level and youth exchanges between both sides so as to benefit ordinary people, the youth, and small and medium enterprises in Taiwan.",""]],"173":[[1,"157","1","Rural Transport Corridor and Village Road Construction","We will construct transportation corridors, creating links within poor areas and connecting them with other areas.",""],[1,"157","1","Rural Water Conservancy and Safe Drinking Water Access","We will improve water conservancy facilities in poor areas, ensure that all people living in poverty have access to safe drinking water, and support hydropower development in poor rural areas.",""],[1,"157","1","Rural Power Grid Upgrading and Broadband Expansion","We will step up work on upgrading power grids in poor rural areas.",""],[1,"157","1","Work-for-Relief Replacement and Small Public Infrastructure Support","We will increase investment in programs designed to replace direct relief with work, and support the construction of small and medium public benefit infrastructure in poor areas.",""],[1,"157","1","Village-Level Poverty Eradication and Livelihood Improvement","We will continue to work at the village level to eradicate poverty, and speed up efforts to improve production and living conditions in poor villages.",""],[1,"157","2","Dilapidated Housing Renovation for Registered Poor Households","Giving high priority to registered poor households, we will complete all work on renovating dilapidated housing so as to guarantee safe housing for these households.",""],[1,"157","2","Basic Public Services Improvement in Poor Areas","We will improve basic public services in poor areas, improving the quality of education and medical services.",""],[1,"157","2","Cultural Projects for Poverty Reduction","We will carry out a number of cultural projects to benefit people and help reduce poverty",""],[1,"157","2","County-Level Public Cultural and Sports Facilities Upgrade","work to see that county-level public cultural and sports facilities in poor areas meet national standards.",""],[1,"160","4","Rural Roads Construction and Upgrading Programme","Build or upgrade one million kilometers of rural roads including roads for facilitating the development of tourism, resources, and industrial parks in poor areas;",""],[1,"160","5","Transportation Connectivity Projects for Poor Areas","Carry out 100 key transportation projects to connect poor areas with the national trunk highway network.",""],[1,"160","6","Ecological Conservation Subsidies and Restoration Projects","focus on increasing subsidies for ecological conservation and implementing ecological protection and restoration projects in order to create more jobs and raise incomes.",""]],"174":[[1,"159","2","Support for Village and Household Livelihood Industries","Focus on supporting poor villages and households in developing planting and husbandry industries and industries related to traditional crafts;",""],[1,"159","3","One Village One Leading Industry Program","Implement the \"one village one leading industry\" program to promote the development of industry in poor villages;",""],[1,"159","4","Internet Plus Industry-Based Poverty Reduction Initiative","Put into action the \"Internet +\" industry-based poverty reduction initiative;",""],[1,"159","5","E-business, Solar Power, and Rural Tourism Poverty Alleviation Initiative","Promote the development of e-business-based, solar power-based, and rural tourism-based poverty alleviation, to help more than 30 million people lift themselves out of poverty.",""],[1,"159","6","Vocational Training Plan Implementation Strengthening","Strengthen implementation of the vocational training plan and the education and training program for poor households, ensuring that members of a poor household who are fit to work acquire at least one work skill;",""],[1,"159","7","Labor Market Matching Initiatives","Implement initiatives to match labor with market demand;",""],[1,"159","8","Employment Guidance and Services Improvement","Provide better guidance and other employment services;",""],[1,"159","9","Interregional Labor Matching and Employment Support","Guide young and middle-aged members of the workforce in poor areas in seeking employment in other areas by matching labor supply and demand between these areas",""],[1,"160","2","Small Town and Industrial Park Development for Job Creation","Create more jobs for these people through the development of small towns and industrial parks;",""],[1,"161","1","Support for Locally Viable Industries in Poor Areas","institutions to give weight to supporting poor areas in developing locally viable industries",""],[1,"161","1","Employment and Self-Employment Support for People Affected by Poverty","supporting people affected by poverty in seeking employment or starting their own businesses",""]],"175":[[1,"159","10","Poverty Relocation Programme","Relocate approximately ten million people living in poverty in inhospitable areas;",""],[1,"160","3","Relocated People Self-Development Support and Employment Promotion","Work to help relocated people improve their self-development capacity; § Ensure adequate employment opportunities and stable poverty reduction.",""]],"176":[[1,"160","11","Medical Assistance for Impoverished Households","Provide medical assistance for those who have been driven into poverty by medical expenses;",""],[1,"160","12","Improvement of Medical Services in Poor Areas","Ensure notable progress is made in improving medical services in poor areas;",""],[1,"160","13","County-Health Institution Pairing Program","Move forward with pairing programs linking poor counties with health care institutions at and above Grade II nationwide;",""],[1,"160","14","Social Security and Subsistence Allowance Support","Ensure that households unable to escape poverty through industry-based support or employment assistance schemes have their basic needs met through social security programs, and that all eligible households living in poverty are supported through subsistence allowances.",""],[1,"161","5","Human Capital Development and Social Services Improvement","we will raise levels of education, health, and medical services throughout society and ensure that the people know more about science and culture and are in better health",""],[1,"161","6","Modern Education System Improvement","We will implement the Party's policy on education in all areas, continue to prioritize the development of education, and make faster progress in improving the modern education system",""]],"177":[[1,"166","3","School Broadband and Digital Learning Platforms","Move faster in implementing the project to ensure that broadband internet is accessible to each school, quality digital educational resources are accessible to each classroom, and an online learning space is accessible to each student and to put in place platforms for educational resources and management;",""],[1,"166","4","Rural School IT Infrastructure Support","Continue support for IT infrastructure construction in rural primary and secondary schools;",""],[1,"166","5","National Quality Learning Resource Platform","Establish a national quality learning resource platform through government service procurement;",""],[1,"166","6","Remote and Online Learning Development for Vocational and Applied Higher Education","Develop modern remote and online learning with a focus on vocational education and applied higher education.",""]],"178":[[1,"166","7","Belt and Road Education Promotion Activities","Promote educational activities related to the Belt and Road Initiative;",""],[1,"166","7","Study Abroad Action Plan","Implement the study abroad action plan;",""],[1,"166","8","Confucius Institute Operations Support","Continue to ensure Confucius Institutes are run successfully.",""]],"179":[[1,"172","16","County-Level Public Hospital Prioritization in Poor Central and Western Areas","Focusing on poor areas in the central and western regions, ensure each county prioritizes the operation of one or two county-level public hospitals (including county-level TCM hospitals),",""],[1,"172","16","Community-Level Medical Institution Standards Upgrade","and that the proportion of community-level medical institutions meeting standards reaches over 95%;",""],[1,"173","2","Resident Doctor Training Standardization and General Practitioner Expansion","Strengthen and standardize training for 500,000 resident doctors, and ensure the number of general practitioners rises to two for every 10,000 people.",""],[1,"173","3","TCM Hospital Infrastructure Improvement","Improve the infrastructure of TCM hospitals;",""],[1,"173","4","Development of Major Traditional Chinese Medicine Disciplines and Fields","Support the development of major disciplines and fields of TCM;",""],[1,"173","5","Traditional Chinese Medicine Practitioner Training","Strengthen the cultivation of TCM practitioners;",""],[1,"173","6","Traditional Medicine Standardization Action Plan","Put into effect an action plan to promote the standardization of traditional Chinese medicines and the traditional medicines of ethnic minorities.",""],[1,"176","12","Basic Medical Insurance for Non-Working Residents","Basic medical insurance for non-working residents;",""],[1,"176","25","HIV/AIDS Patient Follow-up Management","Follow-up management for HIV/AIDS patients;",""],[1,"176","26","Community HIV Intervention for High-Risk Groups","Community HIV intervention among high-risk groups;",""]],"180":[[1,"173","7","Internet Plus Healthcare Services Rollout","Put into place \"Internet +\" healthcare services across the board;",""],[1,"173","8","Regional Population Health Information Platforms","Develop regional population health information platforms;",""],[1,"173","9","Electronic Health Records Expansion","Expand the use of electronic health records;",""],[1,"173","10","Big Data Application in Health Care","Promote the application of big data in health care;",""],[1,"173","11","Regional Health Information Demonstration Centers","Establish a number of regional health information demonstration centers for clinical medicine.",""]],"181":[[1,"173","16","Food and Medicine Governance Capacity Upgrade","Comprehensively raise capacity for food and medicine governance by improving technical support systems for inspections and testing as well as IT-based oversight systems, building a contingent of professional food and medicine inspectors, and ensuring that the equipment of oversight bodies at all levels is up to standard.",""]],"182":[[1,"177","12","Rural Housing Renovation Programme","Renovation of dilapidated rural housing;",""],[1,"177","13","Rural Earthquake-Resistant Housing Renovation","Rural earthquake-resistant housing renovation;",""],[1,"187","2","Priority Housing Support for Persons with Disabilities","We will give high priority to persons with disabilities in the provision of basic housing.",""],[1,"187","2","Accessibility Facilities Construction and Maintenance","We will improve the construction and maintenance of accessibility facilities for persons with disabilities.",""]],"183":[[1,"184","3","Population Aging Response System","We will respond to population aging, strengthen top-level design, and establish a system for addressing population aging that is underpinned by population strategy, family planning policy, employment systems, elderly care services, the social security system, health programs, training systems, environmental support, and social participation.",""],[1,"185","2","Integrated Population and Development Decision-Making Mechanism","We will improve the strategy on population development and establish sound mechanisms for integrated decision-making on population and development.",""],[1,"185","2","Retirement Age Increase Policy","We will take a comprehensive approach to addressing the decline of the working population and implement policies to gradually increase the retirement age.",""],[1,"185","2","Older Worker Employability and Human Resource Development Programme","We will strengthen human resource development among older people and work to raise the employability of older members of the workforce.",""],[1,"185","2","Population Impact Assessment and Monitoring System","We will launch population impact assessments for major economic and social policies and improve dynamic population monitoring mechanisms.",""]],"184":[[1,"186","2","Gender Equality and Rights Protection Policy","We will uphold the fundamental state policy of gender equality and continue to put children first.",""],[1,"186","2","Protection of Women, Minors, and Persons with Disabilities","We will earnestly protect the rights and interests of women, minors, and persons with disabilities, and ensure that they can fairly participate in and share more of the results of development.",""],[1,"186","3","Women's Development Plan Implementation","We will implement the Plan for Women's Development in China (2011-2020).",""],[1,"187","1","Children's Development Plan","We will implement a plan on children's development.",""],[1,"187","1","Minor Guardianship and Community Protection System","We will improve the guardianship system for minors, build a social network for the care of minors, and improve community protection and service systems for minors.",""],[1,"187","1","Child Labor Elimination Measures","We will eliminate child labor.",""],[1,"187","1","Youth Development Plan","We will draw up and implement a plan for youth development and foster a sound environment for the growth and development of young people.",""],[1,"187","1","School-Family-Society Coordination for Youth Development","We will promote coordination and interaction between school education, family education, and social education and help young people to be studious, virtuous, upright, and able to tell right from wrong so as to inspire energy and creativity in them.",""],[1,"187","1","School Safety and Minor Protection Enforcement","We will strengthen all- round efforts to ensure order and safety in schools and their surrounding areas and crack down on illegal criminal activities that endanger the physical and mental health of minors.",""],[1,"187","1","Psychological Counseling Services for Minors","We will improve psychological counseling for minors.",""],[1,"187","1","Juvenile Delinquency Prevention Measures","We will take effective measures to prevent juvenile delinquency.",""],[1,"187","1","Youth Volunteer Service Promotion","We will encourage young people to participate more in volunteer services and public-interest activities.",""],[1,"188","2","Child Care and Psychological Counseling Services","Provide care, psychological counseling, and other services for children in need;",""]],"185":[[1,"192","2","Digitization of Cultural Practices and Texts","We will accelerate the digitization of cultural practices and texts.",""],[1,"193","1","Nationwide Cable TV Network Integration and Smart Technology Application","We will step up the pace of nationwide cable TV network integration as well as the application of smart technologies.",""],[1,"196","4","Expansion of Radio and Television Services to All Households","Increase the pace of efforts to extend radio and television services to all households;",""],[1,"196","5","Expansion of Digital Wireless Access to National Broadcasting","Increase coverage of digital wireless access to national radio and television programming;",""],[1,"196","7","Emergency Broadcasting System Improvement","Improve the emergency broadcasting system;",""],[1,"197","16","Media Convergence Platform","Create a convergence platform that integrates traditional and new media;",""],[1,"197","19","Digitization of Cultural Resources","Accelerate efforts to digitize cultural resources;",""],[1,"197","20","Online Availability of Chinese Culture Initiative","Promote online availability of Chinese culture;",""]],"186":[[1,"201","2","Integrity and Credibility Systems Development","we will work faster to develop credibility systems relating to key areas such as government administrative integrity, commercial and business integrity, social integrity, and judicial credibility, promote credit information sharing, and improve incentive and penalty mechanisms.",""],[1,"202","1","National Credit Information Management and Credit Legislation Reform","We will implement a unified system of credit rating codes nationwide.",""],[1,"202","2","National Credit Information Sharing and Disclosure System","We will put in place a system for the release and recording of credit- related information and move faster to improve credit reporting for all types of market entities and members of society.",""],[1,"202","3","Good Faith Incentive and Enterprise Credit Regulation Mechanism","We will establish a mechanism for encouraging and rewarding those who act in good faith.",""],[1,"203","1","Multilevel Credit Service Organization System","We will establish a multilevel system of credit service organizations which allows complementarity between public and social credit service institutions as well as between basic and value-added credit information services.",""],[1,"203","1","Credit Service Product Innovation and Application Promotion","We will promote the development, innovation, and broad application of credit service products.",""],[1,"203","1","Credit Investigation and Credit Rating Agency Standards and Regulation Reform","We will support credit investigation and credit rating agencies to develop in line with standards, and help improve their service quality and international competitiveness.",""],[1,"203","1","Credit Services Regulatory Oversight Improvement","We will improve regulation over credit investigation and markets for credit services.",""]],"187":[[1,"201","1","Psychological Services and Counseling Support for Special-Needs Groups","We will also work to provide better psychological services and strengthen counseling and treatment for groups with special needs.",""],[1,"205","3","Comprehensive Emergency Response System Development","We will complete the building of an emergency response system that corresponds with public security risks, covers the entire process of emergency management, and involves public participation.",""],[1,"205","3","Emergency Risk Management and Early Warning Capacity Strengthening","We will strengthen the development of basic emergency response capabilities, improve risk management systems for major sources of hazards and key infrastructure, strengthen capabilities with respect to sending out emergency early warnings and responding to emergencies, and improve community- level emergency management.",""],[1,"205","3","Urban Counter-Terrorism Capability Enhancement","We will strengthen counter-terrorism capabilities in large and medium cities.",""],[1,"205","3","Hazardous Materials and Marine Emergency Response Capacity Upgrade","We will strengthen core capabilities with respect to hazardous chemical disposal, marine oil spills, marine rescue and recovery, nuclear",""],[1,"206","1","Emergency Response and Medical Relief Strengthening","accident response, and emergency medical relief, and strengthen coordination on ensuring emergency resources.",""],[1,"206","1","Emergency Requisition Compensation System","We will establish a compensation system for emergency requisition and expropriation, improve the management of emergency volunteers, and work to improve people's ability to help themselves and others during emergencies.",""],[1,"206","1","Emergency Volunteer Management Improvement","We will establish a compensation system for emergency requisition and expropriation, improve the management of emergency volunteers, and work to improve people's ability to help themselves and others during emergencies.",""],[1,"206","1","Public Emergency Self-Help Capacity Building","We will establish a compensation system for emergency requisition and expropriation, improve the management of emergency volunteers, and work to improve people's ability to help themselves and others during emergencies.",""],[1,"206","1","Overseas Emergency Response Capability Enhancement","We will strengthen China's capabilities to respond to overseas emergencies that affect its interests.",""]],"188":[[1,"206","2","Integrative National Security Concept Implementation","We will fully put into effect the integrative national security concept, implement a national security strategy, and keep working to improve our ability to ensure national security, so as to effectively safeguard Chinese national security.",""],[1,"206","3","National Security Policy Formulation and Implementation Framework","We will formulate and implement national security policies in key areas including the political, territorial, economic, social, resource-, and internet- related fields, define medium-term and long-term security objectives, policies, and measures for these areas, and work to strengthen our ability to respond to all kinds of risks and challenges.",""],[1,"206","3","National Security Science, Technology, and Equipment Development","We will strengthen the development of national security science, technology, and equipment, establish a sound national security monitoring and early-warning system, tighten integration between monitoring and early-warning systems in different areas to increase efficiency, and improve security information gathering, analysis, and processing capabilities.",""],[1,"206","3","External Risk Warning System","We will establish a warning system for external risks based on risk classification and level.",""],[1,"206","3","Major Security Risk Monitoring and Emergency Planning","We will strengthen monitoring and assessment over major security risks and formulate a national emergency plan for handling major risks to national security.",""],[1,"206","3","National Security Review System Reform","We will improve national security review systems and mechanisms.",""],[1,"206","3","Security Risk Assessment for Major Areas and Reforms","We will conduct security risk assessments in major areas and for reform measures, projects, programs, and policies.",""],[1,"206","3","National Security Coordination Mechanism","We will put in place a coordination mechanism for safeguarding national security in key areas to better organize and coordinate national security efforts.",""]],"189":[[1,"207","1","Trans-departmental and Trans-regional Security Coordination Mechanism","We will establish a sound trans-departmental, trans-regional joint work mechanism to resolutely prevent and take severe action in accordance with the law against infiltration, subversion, and sabotage by hostile forces, violent terrorist activities, ethnic separatist activities, and religious extremist activities.",""],[1,"207","1","Professional Counter-Terrorism Force Development","We will strengthen the development of professional counter-terrorism forces.",""],[1,"207","1","International Counter-Terrorism Cooperation","We will increase international cooperation on combating terrorism.",""],[1,"207","1","Anti-Espionage Work Strengthening","We will strengthen anti-espionage work.",""],[1,"207","1","Cyberspace Sovereignty and Online Public Opinion Guidance","We will step up our struggle against hostile forces concerning cyberspace sovereignty, strengthen guidance on online public discourse, and work to prevent hostile and terrorist forces from carrying out infiltration and sabotage activities in cyberspace.",""],[1,"207","1","Technology-Enabled Border Protection","We will strengthen the use of technology in border protection.",""],[1,"207","1","Ideological Security Work","We will work hard to ensure ideological work is carried out properly in order to safeguard China's ideological security.",""]],"190":[[1,"208","2","National Security Law Implementation and Regulatory Framework","We will implement the National Security Law and formulate relevant implementation regulations.",""],[1,"208","2","National Security Legal System Improvement","speed up efforts to improve the system of laws relating to national security;",""],[1,"208","2","National Security Legislative Work Programme","We will promote legislative work in areas involving national security such as national economic security, nonproliferation, national intelligence, cybersecurity, export control, foreign agent registration, and security reviews for businesses involving foreign capital;",""]]}});